<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Matye</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Matye</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matye</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Matye</para>
  <para style="imt">Mɛkpa mɛ mɛkɛn</para>
  <para style="ip">Matye nakwyal Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ́ étɛp bot ɛ mbyak eYuda. Nyɛ nadi egu Ekwyala ee nadi tɔ ɛbhɛŋ ɛ na mwa ɛ ɛnyɔɛpe. Matye lɛɛ bot ɛ náá, Yezu nazyɛ ɛ́ étɛp ɛzɛsa náá, etɛp ee nakwyalaa tɔ bɛmɛkana menek ɛ neebela ɛsuk. Matye nakwyal ɛ́, é ghɛŋ ekeletyɛ yii mbyak eYuda nazesɔaa tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda ɛ. Bɛ nadi ɛ́ tɔ ezɛɛga bot ɛ nadi emyaal náá, bot ɛ membyak mɛ sis sulal pɛ daa lɔɔ ɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yɛ bɛ Matye ɔɔ, nyɛy ke ɛ́ náá, Yezu ɛ́ <char style="bd">Lyoel </char> di elɛɛ nɛ eghɛŋ djas sa Zɛɛb di ewaab nɛ bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ. Lyoel tak ɛpelyaal ɛzel na bes yii ɛmɛt mɛtiŋ mɛ di tɔ ɛbhɛŋ ɛ na mwa ɛ. Náá, Yezu ɛ́ <char style="bd">Mɛsia </char> mɛ eYuda nadi ebwood ɔ. É sok nyɛ di elii dum nɛ ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ, nyɛ dyeebake ɛ́ náá: Zɛɛb ɛ́ Mɛkoozi, eghɛŋ bɛ pe eezenyen kɔ bɔs.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Matye baazodu ɛ́ ɛzel ɛ wat nɛ bak bɛsɔ bɛlɛl.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɛ tɔ ɛzel ɛ tak, Matye nasɛɛg mɛkpa ɛ Yezu ɛ́, tɔ mwoob mɛtɛn: etɛp ee nyɛ nalii kana tɔ mɛlaŋel mɛ etɛn kɛkum ɛlaŋel etɛn nɛ ebá (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 5-7">5–7</ref></char>) ɛ, mɛkpa menek baadjóoaa ɛ́ mɛkpa mɛ kɔ ɛtsok. Ye kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ ko kyeed bɛdjekel ɛ Yezu nagoka nɛ ɛkɛ é tak ɛ. Ye nadyeebalyo ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, dáa bot di egoka nɛ ɛdi nɛ ɛgwakel pak'ɔɔ ɛ, nɛ dáa bɛ di egoka nɛ ɛgwakel bɛ nɛ Zɛɛb'ɔɔ ɛ. Yɛ kabɛ ekwyala ee nakan é ɛlaŋel kam (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10">10</ref></char>) ɔɔ, yenek lii ɛ́ dum nɛ ɛdul ɛ mɛlɔ nɛ mɛlyo étɛp bot aakɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɔ. Yɛ kabɛ mɛkpa mɛ di tɔ ɛlaŋel ɛ kam nɛ elɛl (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 13">13</ref></char>) ɔɔ, yenek sɛɛg ɛ́ etɛp ee di elyo bot esa ee di esael é sok di náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ mɛkoozi ɛ. Tɔ ɛlaŋel kam nɛ etɛn nɛ elɛl (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 18">18</ref></char>), yenek lyaal ɛ́ dáa bot di nɛ ghwyil ɛdi é di wat bɛkɛl nɛ bɛdhem tɔ zɛɛga ekeletyɛ ɛ. Yɛ kabɛ ekwyala ee di kan tɔ ɛlaŋel mɛkam-mɛmbá nɛ ená kɛkum mɛkam-mɛmbá nɛ etɛn (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 24-25">24–25</ref></char>) ɔɔ, yenek lyaal ɛ́ dáa bɛdjekel di egoka nɛ ɛbwood mɛgham mɛ mɛsik ɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɛsok nɛ bɛ nɛ bela mɛkpa menek, nɛ bhii mɛkpa menek, mɛkana mɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Matye kaada ɛ́ dáa Yezu nadi etsik bot ɛ, nɛ dáa nyɛ nadi edjɛ mɛdhuu mɛ bot edee ɛ. Ye baakaadaa ɛ́ étɛp ɛpus bot náá, bɛ siiza ɛbuɛpe, nɛ ɛbe ɛ mɛso bɛ nɛ bɛlyoel yii eYuda.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɛ mɛkɛn mɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Matye, nyɛ kaada ɛ́ etɛp e ɛbyel ɛ Yezu, edhɔma ɛ Yezu mot di mɛkoozi mɛ eYuda ɔ. Yɛ ɛ́ kwyala tɔ ɛlaŋel ɛ wat nɛ ɛlaŋel ɛ ebá (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 1-2">1–2</ref></char>). Pɛ mɛsik mɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal, Yezu, mɛkoozi mɛ eYuda eedjɛaa epɛ́ɛ e ɛsyee nɛ ɛbemaa é Mɛlaaba, yɛ ɛ́ kwyala tɔ ɛlaŋel mɛkam-mɛmbá nɛ etɛn nɛ ebá (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 27">27</ref></char>). Tin Zɛɛb naagomal nyɛ tɔ ɛsyee. Yezu eezɛtel bɛdjekel bɛ nyel. Nyɛ eezɛlwom bɛ, bɛ kɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal pɛ daa bot ɛ membyak djas kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs, yɛ ɛ́ kwyala tɔ ɛlaŋel mɛkam-mɛmbá nɛ etɛn nɛ elɛl (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 28">28</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɛsok nɛ Yezu nɛ byel, nyɛ nadjóoaa ɛ́ <char style="bd">Emanuɛl</char>: ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́ «Zɛɛb ɛ́ nɛ nena» (ɛlaŋel ɛ mɛkɛn, ze mɛkam-mɛmbá nɛ elɛl <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 1:23">1.23</ref></char>). Mbɛɛ Bhaadal Matye sik ɛ nɛ ekɛk ɛ Yezu bak: «Mɛ ɛ́ nɛ nen sam wat mɛlu djas kɛkum dwoo bɔs aakɛsi ɛ» (ɛlaŋel mɛkam-mɛmbá nɛ elɛl, ze mɛkam-mɛmbá <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 28:20">28.20</ref></char>). Yezu ɛ́ Zɛɛb pak bot.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Dhaad ɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Beeka dhaad ɛ Yezu Klisto, mɔn ɛ Dhavid, dha ɛ Abalaam:<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Yɛ ɛ́ Abalaam ɛ nabya Izak, Izak ɛ nabya Zakɔɔb, Zakɔɔb kabya yɛ ɛ́ Yuda nɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg. <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Tin, Yuda kabya ɛ́ Pelɛɛz bɛ nɛ Zaala. Din ɛ nyɛɛg'ɔɔ nabɛ ɛ́ Tamaad. Pelɛɛz kabya ɛ́ Ɛslɔm, Ɛslɔm kabya yɛ ɛ́ Alam. <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Mɔn Alam kadi ɛ́ Aminadaab, Aminadaab nakabya yɛ ɛ́ Naasɔn. Naasɔn kabya ɛ́ Salman. <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salman bɛ nɛ myɛl Layaab ɛ́ nabya Bhooz. Bhooz bɛ nɛ ngbɛ myɛl Luth nakabya ɛ́ Obɛɛd. Obɛɛd nabya ɛ́ Yese, <verse eid="MAT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Yese kabya ɛ́ mɛkoozi Dhavid.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:6">Mɛkoozi Dhavid kabya ɛ́ Salomɔŋ, nyɛ nabya Salomɔŋ ɛ́ bɛ nɛ mwaa Uli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mwaa Uli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nyɛ nadɛk nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti mɔɔ sodja yɛ, din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Uli.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Salomɔŋ nabɛ ɛ́ sɛɛg ɛ Loboam, Loboam nakabya yɛ ɛ́ Abya, Abya kazɛbya ɛ́ Asaf. <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asaf nabya yɛ ɛ́ Yozafat, Yozafat kabya ɛ́ Yolam. Mɔn Yolam nabɛ ɛ́ Ozias. <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Ozias nadi ɛ́ sɛɛg ɛ Yotam, Yotam kabya ɛ́ Akaaz, Akaaz eezɛbya Ezekias. <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Ezekias kabya ɛ́ Manase. Manase kabya ɛ́ Amɔn, Amɔn kabya ɛ́ Zozias. <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Zozias kadi ɛ́ sɛɛg ɛ Zekonias nɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg, yɛ é ghɛŋ bɔn ɛ Yisalaɛl natɔ́ é ekwom pɛ kyee dik Bhabhilɔn ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Bhii bɔn ɛ Yisalaɛl natɔ́ é ekwom pɛ kyee dik Bhabhilɔn ɛ, Zekonias naakɛbya Salatyɛl. Bhii tak, Salatyɛl eezɛbya Zoolobhabhɛl. <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Zoolobhabhɛl kabya ɛ́ Abyuud. Abyuud nabɛ ɛ́ sɛɛg ɛ Eliakim, Eliakim kadi ɛ́ sɛɛg ɛ Azɔɔd. <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Azɔɔd eezɛbya Sadɔk, Sadɔk kabya ɛ́ Akim. Mɔn ɛ Akim kadi ɛ́ Eliyuud. <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eliyuud kadi ɛ́ sɛɛg ɛ Eleazaad, Eleazaad kabya ɛ́ Matan. Matan eezɛbya Zakɔɔb, <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Zakɔɔb kadi ɛ́ sɛɛg ɛ Zozɛf ngom ɛ Maali. Yɛ ɛ́ Maali tak ɛ nabya Yezu bot di edjóo Mɛsia ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Tinaak, kana kɔkɔ mɛbyel ɛ Abalaam, kɛyaka nɛ yɛ Dhavid, ye nabɛ ɛ́, ye naasa tyee ekɔkɔ e mɛbyel kam nɛ ená (14). Ye naabaasa tyee ekɔkɔ e mɛbyel kam nɛ ená (14) kana ɛbyel ɛ Dhavid, kɛyaka nɛ membu mɛ bɔn ɛ Yisalaɛl natɔ́ é ekwom pɛ Bhabhilɔn ɛ. Kana membu mɛ bɔn ɛ Yisalaɛl natɔ́ é ekwom pɛ Bhabhilɔn ɛ kɛyaka nɛ ɛbyel ɛ Mɛsia, ye naasa tyee ekɔkɔ e mɛbyel kam nɛ ená (14).<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛbyel ɛ Yezu Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Gwakeka ɛsuk ɛ ɛbyel ɛ Yezu Klisto. Maali nyɛɛg nabɛ ɛ́ ghɔɔd ɛ Zozɛf. Ɛsok nɛ bɛ nɛ di moma nɛ motom, ye nabɛ ɛ́, Maali eezɛbela ɛbum nɛ ghwyil ɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Zozɛf, mwaaz'ɛ nabɛ ɛ́ mot epiki, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkwyɛl ɛdhusal nyɛ é mis mɛ bot. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke náá, emwaaz bɛ nɛ Maali si tɔ syaab. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Dáa nyɛ nadi esiiza deenek ɛ, dhiiti fofop ɛ Ghɛŋ ngɔt eezɛtuula nyɛ tɔ dhyam, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Zozɛf, dha ɛ Dhavid, nàbem ba étɛp ɛba Maali, etɛɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil Sisim na Dɛɛ ɛ, nyɛ bela ɛbum. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Nyɛ waabya mɔn mɔɔ motom, bi aaget nyɛ ɛ Yezu, etɛɛ náá, nyɛy ɛ́ kwaatsik bot ɛ mbyak'ɛ tɔ mesyem mɔɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Esesɛɛ binek djas aasael ɛ, etɛɛ náá, etɛp djas Ghɛŋ nalɛɛ tɔ nuub ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ neebela ɛsuk. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ náá:<verse eid="MAT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />«Mɔn ɛsyes ɛ moma di ààgu botom ɔ waabela ɛbum.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:23">Bhii tak, nyɛ waabya mɔn mɔɔ motom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:23">nyɛ aaget nyɛ ɛ́ Emanuɛl.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.23<char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 7:14">Eza 7.14</ref></char> </char></note>»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 1:23">Ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́: «Zɛɛb ɛ́ nɛ nena.»<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Dáa Zozɛf kadjem é gɔ́ ɛ, nyɛ zokasa ɛ́ dáa fofop ɛ Ghɛŋ nalɛɛ nyɛ ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛbeeb myɛl Maali. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Tin, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààsɛɛga goŋ bɛ nɛ myɛl kɛkum dwoo myɛl nabya mɔn motom, Zozɛf naget Yezu ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Bɛtsoŋ ɛ bot eezɛtɔ́ kɛduwal Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Yezu nabyel ɛ́ pɛ dɛl ɛ Bheteleɛm pɛ kyee dik Yude é ghɛŋ Eelood nadi mɛkoozi ɛ. É ghɛŋ tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́, bɛtsoŋ ɛ bot naadus pɛ kyee ɛdjem ɛ dwoo, kum pɛ Yeluzalɛm. <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />Tin, bɛ moo zɛdji náá: «Mɛkoozi mɛ eYuda, tɔlɔɔ mɔn byel ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ wo? Bis eebee kwyikwyen yɛ edus pɛ ɛdjem ɛ dwoo, bis ɛ́ bookazyɛ zɛduwal nyɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Dáa mɛkoozi Eelood nagwak deenek ɛ́, ye naanɛɛg nyɛ lo zɛm-zɛm, nyɛy nɛ bot ɛdi tɔ ghaada Yeluzalɛm ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛdjóo bot ɛ nadi kɔ elo e eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb ɔ djas, nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi djas, nyɛ needji bɛ di Mɛsia di esiŋa nɛ ɛbyel ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Bɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Pɛ Bheteleɛm, pɛ kyee dik Yude etɛɛ náá, ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb naakwyal náá:<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />“Wɔy Bheteleɛm, kyee dik Yude</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ wɔ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛbyaselaa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">pɛ kɔ mɛl mɛ di kɔ kyee dik Yude ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">etɛɛ náá, boo kukuma ɛ́ waawyis kɔ lɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">mot aadjɛɛd mbyak'am Yisalaɛl ɔ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.6 <char style="xt"><ref loc="MIC 5:1">Mis 5.1</ref></char> </char></note>”»<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Deenek, wɔ gwaa, mɛkoozi Eelood zɛdjóo bɛtsoŋ ɛ bot binɔk tɔ syaab. Tin, bɛ eezɛlɛɛ nyɛ sum di nɛ ɛwala ɛ kwyikwyen tak nanyen tɔ gwoo ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛlwom bɛ pɛ Bheteleɛm. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Tɔ́ka kɛsaa, da bi ɛ́ gu etɛp djas dum nɛ mɔn tak, dɔɔ nɛ zeza nɛ di nyɛ di ɔ. Bi ɛ bela ɔɔ, da bi ɛ́ lɛɛ mɛ, etɛɛ náá, mam pe, mɛ neezyɛ, zɛduwal nyɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Bhii bɛ nazegwak dáa mɛkoozi nalii nɛ nɔɔ ɛ, bɛ eezɛnɔɔ mɛnyel dhaa yɔbɔ. Tin, kwyikwyen bɛ nadi ebee pɛ ɛdjem ɛ dwoo ɛ, moo ekɛ pɛ sok bhwoob'ɔɔ pɛ ɛko, é sok bɛ nakum zeza nɛ di mɔn tak nadi ɔ, wɔ gwaa kwyikwyen zɛtyaa piki, é di wat, ààkabaakɛ. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Dáa bɛ nabee kwyikwyen ɛ, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ naamyaala ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛni tɔ ndjaa, zɛbela mɔn bɛ nɛ nyɛɛg Maali tin. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛkwyit mɛboŋ si étɛp ɛduwal mɔn. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛkɛɛ mɛkɔm mɔɔ. Bɛ eezɛpɛk nyɛ nɛ elɔɔd, nɛ epu ele na mbɛɛ mɛnuub di edikaa ɛ, zɛnɔɔ mul mɛ di djóoaa miid ɛ.<figure style="fig" alt="Les sages s’agenouillèrent pour adorer l’enfant" file="CN01632c.tif" size="span" loc="2.11" copy="David C. Cook" ref="2.11">Bɛtsoŋ ɛ bot eekwyit mɛboŋ étɛp ɛduwal Mɔn</figure><verse eid="MAT 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Bhii tak, wɔ gwaa Zɛɛb zɛlu bɛ tɔ dhyam náá, bɛ nàdhaa pɛ daa Eelood. Tin, é ɛsik ɛ lɔɔ pɛ dɛl, bɛ nakadhaŋ ɛ́, pɛ ze sis.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zozɛf nɛ Maali eezɛnɔɔ mɔn'ɔɔ Yezu, kaab tɔ́ pɛ Eziptɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Bhii bɛtsoŋ ɛ bot binɔk natɔ́ ɛ, fofop ɛ Ghɛŋ ngɔt eezɛtuula Zozɛf tɔ dhyam. Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Wyɛla, nɔŋa mwalɔ nɛ mɔn, da bi ɛ́ kaab, tɔ́, kɛsɔwa pɛ Eziptɛ. Kɛdi penek, kɛkum dwoo mɛ aake náá, wɔ bula ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, Eelood ɛ́ waasaa mɔn étɛp nyɛ neegó nyɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Tin, Zozɛf ɛ́ boozɛwyɛl, nɔɔ mɔn nɛ myɛl, zɛkaab pum nɛ pum, tɔ́, kɛsɔwa pɛ Eziptɛ. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />Zozɛf zokadi penek ɛ kɛkum ɛlu ɛ ɛsyee ɛ Eelood. Ye nasɛɛ deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, etɛp ee Ghɛŋ naloolɛɛ tɔ nuub ngoolel-mɛkpa mɛ ɛ, neebela ɛsuk. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ náá: «Pɛ mɛ nadi pɛ kyee dik Eziptɛ ɛ, mɛ eedjóo mɔn'am<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.15 <char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 11:1">Oze 11.1</ref></char></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eelood eezɛgó bɔɔ dhyeeb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Bhis Eelood nazɛgu náá, bɛtsoŋ ɛ bot binɔk naakɔɔ nyɛ ɛ, nyɛ naazɛbiyo ɛlyelɛpe. Wɔ gwaa nyɛ zɛdjɛ ɛlee nɛ bot bɛ náá, bɛ tɔ́ pɛ Bheteleɛm nɛ mɛl mɛ di é mengwoob ɛ djas, bɛ kɛgó bɔn botom djas di náá, bɛ dinaa ààpakum membu membá ɔ. Etɛɛ náá, ndem bɛtsoŋ ɛ bot nalɛɛ nyɛ ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ náá, mɔn tak nadi ɛ́, tɔ lɔɔg membu menek. <verse eid="MAT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Tin, etɛp ee ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Zeelemi nalɛɛ ɛ́, yɛ ɛ́ boo zɛbela ɛsuk. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ naake náá:<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />«Etsim ɛpegék pɛ dɛl ɛ Lama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">etsim e boo mɛgwyɛ nɛ mezuk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Yɛ ɛ́ Lasyɛl ɛ di edje bɔn bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Nyɛ aanàkwaakat ɛgwyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">etɛɛ náá, bɔn tokapɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.18 <char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 31:15">Zel 31.15</ref></char></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zozɛf nɛ Maali nɛ mɔn'ɔɔ eezɛdus kɔ Eziptɛ, sik pɛ Nazalɛt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Bhis ɛsyee ɛ Eelood, fofop ɛ Ghɛŋ ngɔt eezɛtuula Zozɛf tɔ dhyam pɛ Eziptɛ. <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Wyɛla, nɔŋa mwalɔ nɛ mɔn, da bi ɛ́ sik pɛ kyee dik Yisalaɛl etɛɛ náá, bot djas nadi ekwyɛl ɛgó mɔn'ɔ ɔ, bɛ eezesi bhɛɛɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Tin, Zozɛf ɛ́ boozɛwyɛl, nɔɔ mɔn nɛ myɛl sik pɛ kyee dik Yisalaɛl. <verse eid="MAT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Tinaak, dáa nyɛ nagwak náá, Aalekelaus naadjila sɛɛg Eelood kɔ bóó mɛkoozi pɛ kyee dik Yude ɛ, bwoo naazɛsa nyɛ, étɛp ɛtɔ́ penek. Zɛɛb ɛ́ boobaazɛdjɛ nyɛ mɛlyo mɛ sis tɔ dhyam. Tin, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ dhiiti dɛl ɛ sis, pɛ kyee dik Ghalile. <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛtɔ́ kɛdi pɛ dhiiti dɛl, din ɛ dɛl ɛ tak ɛ́ Nazalɛt. Ye nasael deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, dhiiti etɛp ee Zɛɛb nalɛɛ tɔ enuub e bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, neebela ɛsuk. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ náá: «Bɛ aadjóo nyɛ ɛ́ mot Nazalɛt.»<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo ɛ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />É ghɛŋ tak ye nabɛ ɛ́ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot eetuula tɔ kyee bɔs bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ pɛ kyee dik Yude. Nyɛ nadi elyo ɛ́ náá: <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />«Liigka elyem bin, etɛɛ náá, Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ, yɛ eezekunaa!» <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Ezayi nalii étɛp'ɛ ɛ́ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">«Mot ngɔt ɛpetuud kɔ kyee bɔs bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">“Koobalka mɛze ɛ Ghɛŋ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">Tuuka nyɛ mɛze mɛ na looba-looba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.3 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Eza 40.3</ref></char></char></note>!”»<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Kaad Zaŋ nadi ebɔt ɛ nasael ɛ́ nɛ mya mɛ boo yaaga bal. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bhɛtɛ ket é kuu. Nyɛ nadedɛ ɛ́ etsemaaka nɛ egho. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Bot ɛ ghaada Yeluzalɛm nɛ bot ɛ kyee dik Yude djas, zɛnɔɔ bot ɛ nadidi mbaka-mbaka nɛ dii Yuldɛn ɔ, nadi ezyɛ pɛ daa lɛ. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Bɛ nadi evaa mesyem mɔɔ é mis mɛ bot. Bhii tak, Zaŋ ɛ́ zɛduu bɛ Zɛɛb tɔ dii Yuldɛn.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Dáa Zaŋ nabee náá, bɛtɛ nɛ eFalizyɛ nɛ eSaduseɛ nadi ezyɛ pɛ daa lɛ ɛbuɛpe zɛduwa Zɛɛb ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Biyɔ mbyak mɛgel mak! Ɛzɛ lyo bin náá, bi kaab ɛbuk ɛ Zɛɛb zekunaa nɛ ɛzyɛ'enek? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Lyaalka nɛ esesɛɛ bin náá, yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, bi eezeliig elyem bin. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Betka ɛke biyɔ nɛ biyɔ náá: “Dhiiti sonok aanàkwaasa mena, etɛɛ náá: Abalaam ɛ́ bhaab'enaka.” Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛliig mɛkok mak ye liiza bɛdha ɛ Abalaam. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Ye nyɔ ɛ́ bi gu náá, zoŋ moo ɛ́ nɛɛga é ɛbok ɛ le étɛp ye neetsaal ekaŋal e tak. Ele ee di ààdjɛ mbɛɛ bhum ɔ djas, goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛkwyalaa. Bhii tak, da yɛ ɛ́ kɛmwasaa tɔ du.<verse eid="MAT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, mam duu bin Zɛɛb ɛ́ tɔ mɛdii, étɛp ye neelyaal náá, bi eezeliig elyem. Yɛ kabɛ mot di zyɛ bhis'am ɔɔ, nyɛ aaduu bin Zɛɛb ɛ́, tɔ ghwyil Sisim na Dɛɛ nɛ du. Nyɛ eedhaa mɛ nɛ mɛbwala. Mam aanàkwaakobela-bela duu ɛmalal étɛp ɛkotii-tiiak ekel ekoko bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Tɔ mɛmbɔ mɛ, nyɛ eemɛt wal étɛp nyɛ neewa mbɛk pak ezeeza nɛ embɛɛ mɛbhek. Tin, da nyɛ ɛ́ kwom mbɛɛ bhum kɔ taa. Yɛ kabɛ ezeeza ɔɔ, nyɛ kakɛmwas yɛ ɛ́ tɔ du na kɔm-kɔm.»<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛduwa Zɛɛb ɛ Yezu Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Dhiiti dwoo Yezu naazɛdus pɛ kyee dik Ghalile zɛkum pɛ dii Yuldɛn pɛ kyee Zaŋ nadi ɛ́, étɛp nyɛ needuwa Zɛɛb dáa Zaŋ. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Wɔ gwaa Zaŋ zɛbyen yɛ. Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ mam ɛ di egoka nɛ ɛzyɛ, zɛduwa Zɛɛb pɛ daa lɔ. Deenek, wɔy ɛ kadi ezyɛ pɛ daa lam é!» <verse eid="MAT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔ goka ɛ́ wɔ myaal náá, ye sɛ́ɛ deenek é ɛwala ɛlak. Etɛɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ mena aasaka ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb.» Tin, Zaŋ ɛ́ boozɛmyaal.<figure style="fig" alt="Le baptême de Jésus" file="WA03810b.tif" size="span" loc="3.15" copy="Graham Wade" ref="3.13-17">Yezu eeduwa Zɛɛb</figure><verse eid="MAT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Dáa Yezu naduwa Zɛɛb ɛ, wyisa nyɛ nazowyis tɔ mɛdii ɛ, é di tak wat, wɔ gwaa, gwoo zɛbɛŋel. Bhii tak, Sisim na Dɛɛ eezyɛ, zɛsul kɔ lɛ tyee ɛghum. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Dhiiti gwood eezɛgék tɔ gwoo náá: «Nwyak ɛ́ mɔn'am mɛ di kwyɛl ɔ. Mɛ eedyeebamyaala nɛ nɛ ɛbuɛpe.»<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Mɛbhowal ɛ Yezu Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Bhii tak, Sisim Zɛɛb eezɛnɔɔ Yezu, tɔ́ nɛ nɛ pɛ kyee bɔs bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ, etɛɛ náá, dim mot mɛkɔŋ neekɛwa nyɛ tɔ mɛbhowal. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Bhii nyɛ nazɛtsi edee étɛp mendjaala tyee mɛlu mɛkam-mɛná nɛ epum mɛkam-mɛná ɛ, za naazɛsa nyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Tin, dim mot mɛkɔŋ, mot mɛbhowal eezɛtiila pɛ daa lɛ. Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Yɛ bɛ náá, wɔ ɛ́ Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ, kea nɛ mɛkok mak náá, ye liiza emapa.» <verse eid="MAT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Ekwyala e Zɛɛb lɛɛ ɛ́ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:4">“Ye tok mapa nɛ emapa di esa náá, mot di nɛ tsik.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:4">Mot tsak ɛ́ nɛ mɛkpa djas di edus tɔ nuub Zɛɛb ɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.4 <char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Dɛt 8.3</ref></char></char></note>”»<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Bhii tak, dim mot mɛkɔŋ eebaazɛtɔ́ nɛ nɛ pɛ Yeluzalɛm ghaada na dɛɛ. Nyɛ eezɛgel nyɛ kɔ ngɛs Ndjaa-ebuwa. <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />Nyɛy nɛ Yezu náá: «Yɛ bɛ náá, wɔ ɛ́ Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ, tsela, da wɔ ɛ́ kɛduma pɛ si, etɛɛ náá, Ekwyala e Zɛɛb lɛɛ ɛ́ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">“Kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɔ, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waake nɛ efofop bɛ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">Bɛ bɛp wɔ nɛ mɛmbɔ mɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">ekaab náá, wɔ ɛ́ zɛkɛbema ɛbɛk.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.6 <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Mɛd 91.11-12</ref></char></char></note>”»<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Tin, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Ekwyala baalɛɛ ɛ́ náá: “Sa wɔ ààwa Ghɛŋ Zɛɛb'ɔ tɔ mɛbhowal<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.7 <char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Dɛt 6.16</ref></char></char></note>.”» <verse eid="MAT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Dim mot mɛkɔŋ eebaazɛnɔɔ nyɛ, tɔ́ nɛ nɛ pɛ kɔ dhiiti ɛtsok ɛ na vyɛɛg-vyɛɛg. Nyɛ eezɛtel nyɛ mɛyoŋ mɛ di kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɛ djas nɛ mɛkas nɛ enɛm tak djas. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />Dim mot mɛkɔŋ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɛ waadjɛ wɔ esesɛɛ bak djas ɛ, wɔ kwyit mɛboŋ mɔ si eduwal mɛ ɔɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />É di'enek, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Dusa tin, Satan! Etɛɛ náá, Ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ́ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:10">“Yɛ ɛ́ Ghɛŋ Zɛɛb'ɔ ɛ wɔ di egoka nɛ ɛduwal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:10">Wɔ goka nɛ ɛsa ɛ́ mɛsa mɛ met.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.10 <char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Dɛt 6.13</ref></char></char></note>”»<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />É sok'enek, dim mot mɛkɔŋ eezɛbet Yezu, é di'enek, wɔ gwaa efofop zokazyɛ, bɛ moo tin edjɛ nyɛ esa ee nyɛ nadi nɛ ɛkwosak ɛ tak ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eekan ɛsa mɛsa mɛ pɛ kyee dik Ghalile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Bhii Yezu nagwak náá, Zaŋ naamɛtaa é mbok ɛ, nyɛ naazɛtɔ́ pɛ Ghalile. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkosulal kɔ ghaada Nazalɛt. Tin, nyɛ nakwos ɛ́ kɛdi ɛ́ pɛ ghaada Kapɛlnaum, ghaada tak nadi ɛ́ mbaka-mbaka nɛ boo soob na djato-djato Ghalile, pɛ pak kyee dik ɛ Zabulɔŋ nɛ Neftali. <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />Nyɛ nasa deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, etɛp e ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Ezayi nalɛɛ ɛ́ neebela ɛsuk:<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />«Pɛ kyee mɛdhik mɛ Zabulɔŋ nɛ Neftali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">pɛ kyee ze boo soob na djato-djato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">pɛ yii kyiid dii Yuldɛn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">Ghalile, pɛ bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda di ɔ!<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Mbyak di tɔ ghooghom ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">yɛ waabee boo ngel gwyɛ ekas tɔ lɔɔ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">Dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ di ekɔɔla tɔ ghooghom pɛ kyee dik ɛsyee ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">gwyes ɛ́ waakas kɔ lɔɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.16 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 8:23-9:1">Eza 8.23–9.1</ref></char></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Kana ɛwala ɛlenek, Yezu naazɛkan ɛlyo bot náá: «Liigka elyem, etɛɛ náá, Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɔ, yɛ eezekunaa!»<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛdjóo bɛdjekel bɛ yii mɛkɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Dhiiti dwoo Yezu nadi ekɛ mbaka-mbaka nɛ boo soob na djato-djato e Ghalile. Dáa nyɛ nabee bɛlael ɛ mɛwyet bɛbá, dhyeeb nɛ tel, bɔɔ ela mɛwyet ɛ. Bot ɛ tak nabɛ ɛ́ Simɔŋ, mot nagetaa Pyɛɛd ɔ, zɛnɔɔ dhyeeb Andele ela ɛwyet tɔ dii. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Tin, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Duka mɛ, mɛ waasa náá, bi di bɛlael ɛ mɛwyet yii bot.» <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />É di'enek wat, bɛ eezɛdhuugal mɛwyet mɔɔ, étɛp ɛdu Yezu. <verse eid="MAT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Bhii Yezu nakɛ ba ziii ɛ, nyɛ eezɛboma nɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɛ sis, dhyeeb nɛ tel, Zak bɛ nɛ mɔn-nyɛɛg Zaŋ, bɔn ɛ Zɛbɛdɛ. Bɛ nadi ɛ́ tɔ elɛɛd, ekoobal mɛwyet mɔɔ, bɛ nɛ sɛɛg'ɔɔ. Tin, Yezu eezɛdjóo bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />É di'enek wat, bɛ eezɛdhuugal elɛɛd nɛ sɛɛg'ɔɔ, wɔ gwaa bɛ eezɛdu Yezu.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu moo elyo nɛ ɛtsik ɛ bot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Tin, Yezu naazɛtɔ́ pɛ kyee dik Ghalile djas, nyɛ nadi edjɛ mɛlyo tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda nadi pɛ kyee dik tak ɛ. Nyɛ nadi egoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal dum nɛ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ ɛbaatsik bot ɛ nazyɛ nɛ mɛbɛ́ membi nɛ membi ɔ nɛ bot ɛ nadi nɛ edjam ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́, menduk mɛ naakɛ kɔ kyee dik Siili djas. Bɛ ɛ́ boodi ezezyɛ nyɛ nɛ bot ɛ nadi nɛ mɛbɛ́ membi nɛ membi ɔ, nɛ bot ɛ embee esisim nadi edhe-dhek ɔ, dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ nadi ebil djem ɔ nɛ eboka e bot. Yezu zokatsik bɔɔ djas. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Mɛdhuu mɛ bot ɛ nadi edu nyɛ ɔ, nadudus ɛ́ pɛ Ghalile, pɛ pak eghaada kam, pɛ ghaada Yeluzalɛm, pɛ kyee dik Yude nɛ bot ɛ kyee dik nadi pɛ yii kyiid dii Yuldɛn ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛdjɛ bot mɛlyo kɔ ɛtsok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Dáa Yezu nabee ɛdhuu ɛ bot binɔk ɛ, nyɛ naazɛbyet kɔ ɛtsok, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ nyel'ɛ, disi. Bɛdjekel bɛ eezɛdisi é ngwoob'ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />Nyɛ eezɛni edjɛ bɛ mɛlyo:<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tɛtɛ mɛmyaala</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />«Mɛnyɔ nɛ bɛdjel ɛ bot tɔ sisim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:3">etɛɛ náá, Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ yɔbɔ.<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Mɛnyɔ nɛ bot ɛ di edje nenak ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:4">etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waadis ghoŋ di tɔ elyem bɔɔ ɛ!<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Mɛnyɔ nɛ bot ɛ di etela lyem ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:5">etɛɛ náá, bɛ waabela kyee bɔs Zɛɛb nakɛk bɛ ɛ!<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Mɛnyɔ nɛ bot ɛ di nɛ za nɛ gwyes ɛsa ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:6">etɛɛ náá, bɛ waadɛ, djil!<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Mɛnyɔ nɛ bot ɛ di egék bot ɛ sis ghoŋ ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:7">etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waagek bɛ ghoŋ!<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Mɛnyɔ nɛ bot ɛ di nɛ lyem sɛŋ ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:8">etɛɛ náá, bɛ waabee Zɛɛb.<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Mɛnyɔ nɛ bot ɛ di esaa egwyem pak'ɔɔ ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:9">etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waadiig bet náá, bɛ ɛ́ bɔn bɛ!<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Mɛnyɔ nɛ bot ɛ di tɔ tsik mezuk ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:10">etɛɛ náá, bɛ ɛpesa ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:10">etɛɛ náá, Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ yɔbɔ!<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />Mɛnyɔ nɛ nen, yɛ bɛ náá, bot ɛpelee bin ɔɔ, nɛ ɛwa bin tɔ tsik mezuk ɔɔ, bɛ di esu bin etɛp mbɛs ɔɔ, nɛ ɛbaasaab dék'en étɛp'am ɔɔ, <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />myaalaka, da bi ɛ́ bɔl zɛŋ, etɛɛ náá, boo etuud bin ɛ́ nɛɛga pɛ tɔ gwoo. Etɛɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ bɛ nazuk bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nazyɛ ɛsok nɛ nen ɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛdjekel ɛ́ mɛsɔn nɛ mɛkas kɔ bɔs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />«Yɛ ɛ́ biyɔ ɛ di mɛsɔn kɔ bɔs. Yɛ bɛ náá, mɛsɔn moo ɛ́, ààkagwom ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛsaaa dáa, étɛp mɛsɔn neebaagwom? Deenek mɛsɔn aakadi ɛ́, ààbɛ nɛ mɛsa mɛ yɛ aasaaa nɛ yɛ. Deenek, ye goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛmwasaa pɛ kel, da bot ɛ́ nyal yɛ.<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />Yɛ ɛ́ biyɔ ɛ di mɛkas kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs. Dɛl ɛ di suma kɔ ɛtsok ɔ, tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdi syela. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Wɔ aanàkwaatuub lama, da wɔ ɛ́ wa yɛ si bhe. Yɛ ààseaa deenek, ye goka nɛ ɛkɛlaa ɛ́, pɛ kɔ tɛɛg é di bot djas aadi tɔ gwyɛ tak ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ di egoka náá, mɛkas men nyen tɔ bot, étɛp bot neebee mɛnyɔ mɛ esesɛɛ bi di esa ɛ, étɛp bɛ needuwal Sɛɛg'en di tɔ gwoo ɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo dum nɛ etsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />«Nàgekeka náá, mɛ nazyɛ ɛ́ zɛgó etsi ɛ Moiiz nɛ mɛlyo mɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nadjɛ ɛ. Mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààzyɛ zɛgó etsi, mɛ nazyɛ ɛ́ zɛlyaal mɛsuk mɛ tak. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá: Dáa ye di náá, gwoo nɛ bɔs dinaa ààpadum ɛ, ye tok nɛ sa wat aadisaa tɔ etsi. Ye nakoozodi ba mɔɔ ɛtɔn nɛghu ba mɔɔ kyeeb, sa wat aanàdus tɔ etsi kɛkum dwoo mɛsik mɛ etɛp djas. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ di náá, mot aazodis tsi wat, ye nakoozotɔɔl dáa, da nyɛ ɛ́ lyo bɔn-nyɛɛg náá, bɛ sa dáa nyɛ sa ɔɔ, yenɔk aadi ɛ́, mɔɔ dhyeeb tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ. Tin, mot di eduwal etsi, da nyɛ ɛ́ lyo bɔn-nyɛɛg náá, bɛ sa dáa nyɛy ɔ, yenɔk aadi ɛ́ boo-mot tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá: Epiki bin é mis ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ di ààdhaa yii bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ eFalizyɛ ɔɔ, bi aanàkwaani tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo dum nɛ tɛp ɛbuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />«Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bi naagwak náá, nyɛ nake nɛ bɛbhaab bina náá: “Sa wɔ ààgó mot. Mot ɛ gó sɔ mot ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́ ye tɔ́aa nɛ nɛ é mis mɛ bɛtetɛp, nyɛ neepɛ́ɛaa.” <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Yɛ kabɛ mam ɔɔ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ náá: Mot djas aagwak ɛbuk nɛ mɔn-nyɛɛg ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́ náá, bɛtetɛp pɛ́ɛ nyɛ. Mot aake nɛ sɔ mot náá, “wɔ ɛ́ wo ɔ”, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nyɛ tɔ́ kɛpɛ́ɛaa pɛ boo kwan eYuda. Mot aake nɛ sɔ mot náá, “wɔ ɛ́ ndjemet ɔ”, ye goka ɛ́ náá, nyɛ kɛmwasaa tɔ du na kɔm-kɔm. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Yɛ bɛ náá, wɔ ɛpetɔ́ pɛ mesa-ebuwa étɛp ɛkɛduwal Zɛɛb nɛ esa bɔ ɔɔ, tin, wɔ siiza náá, mɔn-nyoog ɛ́ nɛ tɛp nyɛ di ebwak wɔ kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɔɔ, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />pookobet esa e duu tak kɔ mesa-ebuwa. Da wɔ ɛ́ pookokɛgwakel nɛ mɔn-nyoog. Bhii tak ɛ wɔ aakazyɛ, zɛkaa Zɛɛb ɛkɛɛ ɛ lɔ.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />Mot ɛ kɛpit wɔ ɔɔ, bi ɛ di etɔ́ pɛ daa bɛtetɛp ɔɔ, lela ɛgwakel nɛ nɛ é di bi dinaa é ze yenek, ekaab náá, mot tak ɛ́ zɛkɛka wɔ é mis mɛ bɛtetɛp. Bhii tak, da bɛtetɛp ɛ́ djɛ wɔ é mɛmbɔ mɛ esodja, da bɛ ɛ́ wa wɔ é membok. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ náá: Wɔ aanàkwaawyis tin, wɔ di ààtuud dɔɔ nɛ falanga ɛsik ɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo dum nɛ tɛp mɛzɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />«Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bi naagwak náá: “Sa wɔ ààsa ɛzɔ.” <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Tin, mam kalɛɛ nɛ nen ɛ náá, motom djas aagwyák mwaa sɔ, da nyɛ ɛ wyeeb nyɛ tɔ lyem ɔɔ, yenɔk tak eezesa ɛzɔ nɛ moma tak tɔ lyem'ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Yɛ bɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ dis ɛ kyee mbɔ eghɛŋ bɔ ɛ́ di esa náá, wɔ gheekwyekwyɛ tɔ mesyem ɔɔ, wɔ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛpiid ɛ yɛ, da wɔ ɛ́ mwas yɛ ɛtsetaɛpe. Yɛ aadi ɛ́, ɛnyɔɛpe nɛ nɔ náá, wɔ dis dhiiti kyes nyel'ɔ, ààkabɛ náá, wɔ kɛdyak tɔ du na kɔm-kɔm nɛ nyel'ɔ djas. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Yɛ bɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ mbɔ eghɛŋ bɔ ɛ di esa náá, wɔ gheekwyekwyɛ tɔ mesyem ɔɔ, tsaala yɛ, da wɔ ɛ́ mwas yɛ ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ nɔ. Yɛ aadi ɛ́ ɛnyɔɛpe nɛ nɔ náá, wɔ tsaal dhiiti kyes nyel'ɔ, ààkabɛ náá, wɔ kɛdyak tɔ du na kɔm-kɔm nɛ nyel'ɔ djas.»<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo dum nɛ tɛp ɛbel ɛ ɛba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />«Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ naabaake náá: “Mot ɛ pɛɛ myɛl ɔɔ, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdjɛ nyɛ mɛkana mɛ ɛbel ɛ ɛba.” <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Yɛ kabɛ mam ɔɔ, mɛ ke ɛ́ náá, motom djas di epɛɛ myɛl, ààmɛt nyɛ nɛ sa etsi di elu ɔ, motom tak sa ɛ́ náá, moma tak di moma mɛzɔ nyɛ baatɔ́ ɛba ɛ sis ɔɔ. Tin, motom aaba moma zebyenaa é ɛba ɔ, nyɛy baasa ɛ́ ɛzɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo dum nɛ tɛp ɛtuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />«Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bi naagwak dáa bɛ nake nɛ bɛbhaab binaka náá: “Sa wɔ ààgwakel nɛ mot, da wɔ ɛ́ tuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ bhii tak wɔ kadi ɛ́ ààsa sa wɔ nakɛk ɛ. Ye goka ɛ́ náá, wɔ sa sa wɔ kɛk é mis mɛ Ghɛŋ ɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Yɛ kabɛ mam ɔɔ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, sa mot ààtuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ, da nɔɔ gwoo dáa tyaasɛs, etɛɛ náá, penek ɛ́ pɛ bóó mɛkoozi mɛ Zɛɛb di ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />Sa mot ààtuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ nɛ bɔs, etɛɛ náá, bɔs ɛ́ di Zɛɛb di enyal nɛ mɛko mɛ ɔ. Sa mot ààtuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ nɛ din ɛ Yeluzalɛm, etɛɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ ghaada ɛ boo Mɛkoozi. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Sa wɔ ààtuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ, da wa lo'ɔ é ban, etɛɛ náá, wɔ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛswoola bhoo lo'ɔ náá, ye bhilal nɛghu ye pum. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Yɛ bɛ náá, wɔ eemyaal tɛp ɔɔ, kea “iyooo”. Yɛ kabɛ náá, wɔ eebyen ɔɔ, kea “hooo”, etɛɛ náá, ekɛla-ekɛla ee bot dyeebakɛl kɔ étɛp'enek dyeebadus ɛ́ pɛ daa Mbee mot.»<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo dum nɛ tɛp ɛbulal ɛ embee esesɛɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />«Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bi naagwak náá: “Mot ɛ tuu sɔ dis ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́ náá, nyɛ baatuuaa yɛ. Mot ɛ bwak wɔ ɛdjɛ ɔɔ, da wɔy ɛ́ baabwak nyɛ ɛdjɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Deenek, mam kalɛɛ bin ɛ náá: Sa mot ààbulal ɛbiyo nɛ ɛbiyo. Mot ɛ nyuu wɔ bɛɛz é ɛmuk pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ ɔɔ, baaka nyɛ yak kyee ɛmuk. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Mot ɛ di esaa wɔ nɛ etɛp étɛp nyɛ neenɔɔ kuwa yɔ ɔɔ, beta nyɛ, nyɛ baanɔɔ dɔɔ nɛ ndjookuwa yɔ. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Mot ɛ besal wɔ náá, wɔ kɛ nɛŋ wat ɔɔ, kɛa enɛŋ ebá. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Gwyena nɛ mot di ewaab wɔ sonok ɔ. Yɛ bɛ mot eenɔɔ sa yɔ ɔɔ, sa wɔ ààkabaakɛdu.»<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwyɛl nɛ bot ɛ mɛbhuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />«Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bi naagwak náá: “Ye goka ɛ́, wɔ kwyɛl sɔ'ɔ mot, da wɔ ɛ́ byen mot mɛbhuka mɔ.” <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Yɛ bɛ mam ɔɔ, mɛ kalɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, kwyɛlka bot ɛ mɛbhuka men. Djaalaka Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ bot ɛ di etiig bin ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ bi aadi bɔn Sɛɛg'en di pɛ tɔ gwoo ɔ, etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb ɛ di esa náá, gwyes kas kɔ bot djas, bɛmbee ɛ bot nɛ bɛtɛtɛ ɛ bot. Tyee wat, Zɛɛb sil bhi ɛ́, étɛp bot ɛ di sosoob ɔ, nɛ bot ɛ di ààbɛ sosoob ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Yɛ bɛ náá, bi zokwyɛl ɛ́ bot ɛ di ekwyɛl bin ɔɔ, étɛp yé bi di bun náá, bi ɛ́ waabela efute aadus pɛ ɛko ɛ? Dɔɔ nɛ bɛnɔŋel ɛ epata e lapo zobaakwyɛl ɛ́, bot ɛ di ekwyɛl bɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Yɛ bɛ náá, bi zoswos ɛ́ bɔn-nyɛɛg bin ɔɔ, bi bee tin ɛ́ náá, bi ɛpesa enɛm esa? Etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ membyak mɛ sis ɔ, bɔɔ pe zobaasa ɛ́ deenek! <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Dika nɛ mbɛɛ elyem dáa Sɛɛg'en di tɔ gwoo ɔ di nɛ mbɛɛ lyem ɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ɛgwyena nɛ bɛdjel ɛ bot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />«Bi ɛ́ kotiibal dum nɛ dáa bi di esa enɛm esa nɛ bot étɛp ɛduwal ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. Bi ɛ́ sa deenek é mis mɛ bot, étɛp bot djas neeke náá: “Biyɔ ɛ́ di bɛmbɛɛ ɛ bot” ɔɔ, bi aanàkwaabela efute yii Sɛɛg'en di tɔ gwoo aadjɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />Wɔ kwyɛl ɛdjɛ djel mot sonok ɔɔ, wɔ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛsa yɛ tɔ sɔ, sa mot ààgu. Nàsa dáa bot ɛ lualɛŋ di esa tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda nɛ é egba ɛ. Bɛ sa deenek ɛ étɛp bot needuwal bɛ. Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá: Mbi bot binɔk eezebela yɔbɔ efute. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Yɛ bɛ náá, mbɔ eghɛŋ bɔ ɛpedjɛ djel mot sonok ɔɔ, yɛ àànyɔ náá, mbɔ ɛmyɛl ɛ lɔ gu. <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />Etɛɛ náá, ye goka ɛ́ náá, sa wɔ djɛ mot ɛ, ye di sɔ. Tin, Sɛɛg'en, mot di egu dáa wɔ di ekwyee bot tɔ sɔ ɛ, nyɛ waadjɛ wɔ yɔ efute.»<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo dum nɛ mendjaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi ɛ́ di edjaala ɔɔ, nàdika dáa bot ɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si, bɛ dyeebakwyɛl ɛdjaala ɛ metetel tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda nɛ é bɛman, étɛp bot neebee bɛ. Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá: bot binɔk eezebela yɔbɔ efute. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Yɛ kabɛ wɔy ɔɔ, wɔ kwyɛl ɛdjaala Zɛɛb ɔɔ, nia tɔ dhɛŋ'ɔ, da wɔ ɛ́ diyal ɛbɛ. Bhii tak, da wɔ ɛ́ djaala nɛ Soog di tɔ di sɔ ɔ. Tin, Soog, mot di ebee esesɛɛ wɔ di esa tɔ sɔ ɛ, nyɛ waadjɛ wɔ efute.<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />É sok bi di edjaala ɛ, sa mot ààbasal ɛkpa ɛ wat esok nɛ esok gwyes dáa bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ. Bɔɔ gek ɛ́ náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waagwak bɛ, etɛɛ náá, bɛ nɛ bil mɛkpa ɛbuɛpe tɔ mendjaala mɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Sa mot ààbaŋa bɛ, etɛɛ náá, Sɛɛg'en nɛ gu sa elyem bin di ekwos ɛ, ɛsok nɛ bi nɛ waab nɛ nɛ. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Deenek, Gwakeka dáa bi di egoka nɛ ɛdjaala ɛ. Keka náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">“Zɛɛb Sɛɛg'es di tɔ gwoo ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">ye goka ɛ́ náá,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">din ɛ lɔ di Dɛɛ, ye guaa.<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />Ye goka ɛ Ɛyoŋ ɛ lɔ zyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:10">Beta náá, ɛkwosak ɛ lɔ sael kɔ bɔs,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:10">dáa ye di esael pɛ tɔ gwoo ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Djɛa bis mos edee di egoka nɛ nes ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Pela ɛbiyo ɛ bis zesa ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:12">etɛɛ náá, bisɔ pe, bis ɛpepel bot ɛ nazesa bis ɛbiyo ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Sa náá, bis nàkwyekwyɛ tɔ mɛbhowal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">é di'enek, pɛka bis é mɛmbɔ mɛ Mbee mot.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">[Etɛɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ wɔy ɛ di nɛ Mɛkoozi, nɛ mɛbwala, nɛ duma na kɔm-kɔm. <char style="sc">Amɛn</char>.]”<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />Guka náá: Bi ɛ́ pel ɛbiyo ɛ bot ɛ di etɔ́ nɛ ɛsa bin ɔ, Sɛɛg'en di pɛ tɔ gwoo ɔ, waabaapel yebɔ pe. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Tin, yɛ kabela náá, bi ààpel bɛsɔ bin ɔɔ, Sɛɛg'en di tɔ gwoo ɔ, aanàkwaabaapel ɛbiyo ɛ bi di esa ɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo dum nɛ tɛp ɛtsi ɛ edee étɛp mendjaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />«Yɛ bɛ náá, bi ɛpetsi edee étɛp mendjaala ɔɔ, sa mot ààdi nɛ bhwoob ghoŋ dáa bot ɛ di nɛ lualɛŋ ɔ. Bɛ lyaal bhwoob ghoŋ deenek ɛ, étɛp bot djas neegu náá, bɛ ɛpetsi edee. Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ náá: bot binɔk eezebela yɔbɔ efute. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Yɛ kabɛ wɔy ɔɔ, wɔ tsi edee ɔɔ, gwyiia bhwoob, da wɔ ɛ́ lɔɔb mul é lo, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />etɛɛ náá, bot needi ààgu náá, wɔ ɛpetsi edee. Tin, yɛ ɛ́ Soog mot di tɔ sɔ ɔ di egu, deenek Soog, mot di ebee esesɛɛ djas wɔ di esa tɔ sɔ ɛ, nyɛ waadjɛ wɔ efute.»<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekum pɛ daa Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />«Nàsaaka ɛdi ɛ́ nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ ekum é bɔs'ak. Ekum ee di náá, bɛsɛs nɛ emaa ɛ́ waapul ɛ. Ekum ee di náá, bot ɛ djii ɛ́ waakwak ɛbo ɛ ndjaa, da djii, nɔɔ, tɔ́ nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Kwomka ekum bin pɛ daa Zɛɛb. Penek, bot ɛ djii aanàkwaani kɛdjii yɛ, bɛsɛs nɛ emaa aanàkwaapul yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Etɛɛ náá, é di mot di ekwom esa bɛ ɔ, lyem'ɛ di ɛ́ tin.»<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lama nyel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />«Mis ɛ́ dáa lama nyel. Yɛ bɛ náá, mis mɔ ɛpenyaasok ɛnyɔɛpe ɔɔ, gua náá, nyel'ɔ djas ɛ́ tɔ selele. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Yɛ kabɛ náá, mis mɔ ɛpekpaŋ ɔɔ, nyel'ɔ djas ɛ́ tɔ ghooghom. Yɛ kabɛ náá, ngel di tɔ lɔ eezedim ɔɔ, tin, kwaa yenek mɛghomela aanɔŋel nɛ yé?»<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nɛghu epata, nɛghu Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />«Ye tok nɛ mot ngɔt aadi nɛ ghwyil ɛsa mɛsa mɛ ekukuma ebá. Yɛ bɛ deenek ɔɔ, nyɛ waabhina ngɔt, da nyɛ ɛ́ kwyɛl nwyak ngɔt, nɛghu nyɛ kaseya nɛ ngɔt ɔɔ, nyɛ waabyasal nwyak ngɔt. Bi tok nɛ ghwyil ɛsa mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb nɛ mɛsa mɛ epata é di wat.»<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />«Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ mɛ di elɛɛ nɛ nen náá: Nàbemka ba kɔ ɛsu ɛ tsik'en dum nɛ tɛp edee bi aadɛ ɛ, ààkoobɛ-bɛaak mɛnyel men dum nɛ ekaad bi aabɔt ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, tsik eedhaa edee, nyel eedhaa ekaad nɛ mɛtaŋ. Etsal é? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Beeka enen pɛ ɛko, bɛ ààbɛ epyeeb, ààbɔ́k edee di ewum tɔ epyeeb ɛ. Bɛ ààkwom edee tɔ mɛbhwaa nɛ kɔ etaa. Tin, dhi Sɛɛg'en di tɔ gwoo ɔ, di djɛ bɛ edee! Bi ààpadhaa enen nɛ boo mɛtaŋ é mis ɛ Zɛɛb é? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Yɛ bɛ náá, bi ɛpebem ba ɔɔ, ɛzɛ pak'en di nɛ ghwyil ɛbil ba ɛlu ɛ wat kɔ mɛlu mɛ tsik'ɛ?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />Étɛp yé bi di ebem ba kɔ ɛsu ɛ ekaad? Beeka dáa mɛzɛm di ekwyil nɛ ɛwyee tɔ pyeeb ɛ. Mɛzɛm mɛ tak ààsa mɛsa, ààlat ekaad. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Tin, betka mɛ lɛɛ bin náá, dɔɔ nɛ mɛkoozi Salomɔŋ, nɛ boo duu yɛ, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ mbɛɛ kaad nadi enyɔ dhaa zɛm wat tɔ kɔkɔ mɛzɛm menek ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Yɛ bɛ náá, Zɛɛb ɛpebét eka ee di tɔ dik mos, da djɛmɛn yɛ ɛ́ nɔŋaa, dikaa tɔ du ɔɔ, haaa gwyata nɛ biyɔ! Zɛɛb tok nɛ ghwyil ɛsa deenek nɛ lyem'ɛ met étɛp'en é? Ye nakoozodi náá, bi tok nɛ boo ɛmyaal nɛ nɛ!<verse eid="MAT 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />Nàbemka ba é ɛkeke náá: “Mena aadɛka yé? Mena aadɛka yaa mɛdii? Mena aabɔtka yé?” <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Yenek djas, yɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ membyak mɛ sis ɛ́ di ebwos esa binek mɛlu djas. Tin, Sɛɛg'en mot di tɔ gwoo ɔ nɛ gu náá, bi ɛ́ nɛ gwyes tak. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Pookosaaka sok Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ tsik tɔ epiki nyɛ di ewaab ɛ. Tin, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waadjɛ bin esa djas bi di nɛ gwyes tak ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Nàbemka ba nɛ etɛp aasael djɛmɛn ɛ, etɛɛ náá, etɛp e djɛmɛn aagwyɛ lo ɛ́ nyɛ ɛmet, dwoo nɛ dwoo ɛ́ nɛ yɛ ɛkwosak.»<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s1">Sa bi ààpɛ́ɛ bot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />«Sa bi ààpɛ́ɛ bot, deenek Zɛɛb aanàkwaapɛ́ɛ bin. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb aapɛ́ɛ bin ɛ dáa bi di epɛ́ɛ bɛsɔ bin ɛ. Nyɛ aalwoodal bhwaŋ'en ɛ dáa bi di elwoodal bhwaa bɛsɔ bin ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Étɛp yé wɔ gwyák kwyɛɛzyoŋ di tɔ dis ɛ mɔn-nyoog, wɔ kadi ɛ́ ààbee pɛk le di tɔ dis ɛ lɔ ɛ? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Wɔ aanàkwaake nɛ sɔ'ɔ mot náá: “Mɔn-nyaagam, beta mɛ dis mɔɔ kwyɛɛzyoŋ tɔ dis ɛ lɔ,” dhi wɔy ààbɛ ebee pɛk le di tɔ yɔ dis ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Wɔy mot mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si, pookodis sok pɛk le tɔ dis ɛ lɔ! Bhii tak ɛ wɔ waanyaasok, étɛp wɔ needis kwyɛɛzyoŋ di tɔ dis ɛ mɔn-nyoog ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />Nàdjɛka esa ee di dɛɛ ɛ nɛ bɛbhyɛ, ekaab náá, bɛ ɛ́ zɛkɛbula zɛduma wɔ é nyel nɛ mɛkwaala. Nàmwaska mɛvunga sok bhwoob bɛghwyee, ekaab náá, bɛ ɛ́ zɛkɛnyal yɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Waabka, saaka, diigka é ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />«Waabka, bi ɛ́ waadjɛaa, saaka, bi ɛ́ waabela, diigka ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa, bɛ waadii bin yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Yɛ ɛ́ deenek, mot ɛ waab sonok ɔɔ, nyɛ waadjɛaa. Mot ɛ saa sonok ɔɔ, nyɛ waabela. Mot ɛ diig ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaŋ ɔɔ, bɛ waadii nyɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Yɛ ɛ́ nɛ mot ngɔt pak'en di nɛ ghwyil ɛdjɛ mɔn'ɛ ɛkok bela náá, mɔn waab nyɛ ɛ́ mapa? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Nɛghu ɛzɛ di nɛ ghwyil ɛdjɛ mɔn nyɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bɛ ke deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, eYuda ààdɛ bɛnyɔ.</char></note>, yɛ bɛ náá, mɔn waab ɛ́ su ɔɔ? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Kwyii biyɔ, bɛmbee ɛ bot bi di ɛ, bi nɛ gu ɛdjɛ embɛɛ esonok nɛ bɔn bin, gwyata nɛ Sɛɛg'en di tɔ gwoo ɔ, nyɛ aanàdjɛ embɛɛ esonok nɛ mot aawaab ɔ!<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />Kanka ɛsa sok nɛ bɛsɔ bin esesɛɛ bi di ekwyɛl náá, bot sa bin yɛ ɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ mɛkana mɛ etsi e Moiiz nɛ yii bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb di elyo.»<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa na maad-maad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />«Nika tɔ ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa na maad-maad. Etɛɛ náá, ze di eniigal bot pɛ dɛl ɛ bot ɛ zewo ze ɔ, yɛ ààkɔɔla, ɛbɛ ɛ tak nɛ bɔk. Bɛtɛ nɛ bot dyeebakwyɛl ɛdhaŋ ɛ́ penek. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Tin, guka náá, ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa tak nɛ maad, bela náá, ze di edul bot pɛ ze tsik ɛ, ye nɛ pata. Yɛ ɛ étɛp tak ɛ bot ɛbuɛpe di ààdyeebadu yɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb yii mɛkɔŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />«Dika nɛ etsoŋ nɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb yii mɛkɔŋ. Bɛ zyɛ pɛ daa len ɛ́, nɛ ɛzaaba dáa mɔn bhata, ghuna bɛ ɛ́ eben, bɛ zosyel ɛ mya mɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Bi aagu bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb yii mɛkɔŋ tak ɛ́ nɛ mɛfulu mɔɔ. Etɛɛ náá, bum le vin ààbɔ́kaa tɔ mɛkpak mɛ mɛgɔk nɛghu bum fiigh kɔ le mɛgɔk. <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Etɛɛ náá, mbɛɛ le zodjɛ ɛ́ mbɛɛ bhum. Mbee le kadjɛ ɛ́ mbee bhum. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Mbɛɛ le tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdjɛ mbee bhum. Tyee wat nɛ mbee le, ye tok nɛ ghwyil djɛ mbɛɛ bhum. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Ele djas di ààdjɛ bhum ɛ, ye goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛkwyalaa, bhii tak da yɛ ɛ́ mwasaa tɔ du. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Deenek, bi aagu bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb yii mɛkɔŋ ɛ́ nɛ embee mɛfulu mɔɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛlɛɛ nɛ ɛsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />«Ye tok bot djas di djóo mɛ: “Ghɛŋ, Ghɛŋ!” ɔ, paani tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɔ. Bot aani ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ di esa ɛkwosak ɛ Saagam di tɔ gwoo ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />É dwoo epɛ́ɛ, bot ɛbuɛpe ɛ́ waake nɛ nam náá: “Ghɛŋ, Ghɛŋ”, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ din ɛ lɔ ɛ bis nadi bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb! Etsal é? Yɛ ɛ́ nɛ din ɛ lɔ ɛ bis nadi esesɔ embee esisim! Etsal é? Yɛ ɛ́ nɛ din ɛ lɔ ɛ bis nasa bɛtɛ nɛ endem e mɛbwala! Etsal é? <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Tin, mɛ waalɛɛ nɛ nɔɔ é mis mɛ bot náá: “Mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààgu bin. Duska é mis mam, tɔ́ka ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ nam, biyɔ, bot ɛ di esa embee esesɛɛ ɔ!”»<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mendjaa membá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />«Deenek, mot ɛ gwak etɛp ee mɛ di elii wak, da nyɛ ɛ́ kɛ tyee tak ɔɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ mot etsoŋ di esum ndjaŋ'ɛ kɔ ɛkok ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Bhi ɛ zɛnee ɛbuɛpe, tyee bhyoŋ natuula nɛ ghuu na lyel-lyel ɔ, yɛ nyuŋa é ndjaŋ'enek ɔɔ, yɛ aanàbik, etɛɛ náá, ndjaa tak nasumel ɛ́, ɛnyɔɛpe kɔ ɛkok. <verse eid="MAT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />Tin, mot di egwak mɛkpa mam, da nyɛ kadi ɛ́, ààkɛ tyee mɛkpa mɛ tak di elɛɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ dáa ndjemet mot di esum ndjaa kɔ bɔs bɛsyɛ, ààwyɛl epap kɔ ɛkok ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Tin, bhi ɛ kanee ɛbuɛpe ɔɔ, da bhyoŋ ɛ desal mɛdhii ɔɔ, ghuu na lyel-lyel ɛ zɛnyuŋa é epap e ndjaŋ'enek ɔ, epap e tak ɛ waabik syɛɛɛ é di tak wat.»<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eghɛŋ ɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Dáa Yezu nasilal ɛlyo bɛmɛlyo mɛ ɛ, mɛdhuu mɛ bot naadyeebadjoka dáa nyɛ nadi elelyo bot ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààlelyo bot dáa bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nalelyo ɛ, nyɛ nalelyo ɛ́, nɛ eghɛŋ e Zɛɛb.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛtsik dhiiti mot ɛbɛ́ ɛ zezam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Dáa Yezu nasul kɔ ɛtsok ɛ, zukamwaa nɛ mot naazɛdu nyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Wɔ gwaa, dhiiti mot nadi nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɛ zezam ɔ, zɛtiila pɛ daa lɛ. Nyɛ eezɛkwyit mɛboŋ si, zɛdjaala nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ! Mɛ nɛ gu náá: wɔ kwyɛl ɔɔ, wɔ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛtsik mɛ, nyel'am bula dɛɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Tin, Yezu eezɛsɛɛb mbɔ, mɛt nyɛ. Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɛ eekwyɛl, tsaka!» É di tak wat, wɔ gwaa, ɛbɛ́ ɛ zezam mot'enɔk zɛsi. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Bhii tak, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Gwaka mɛ ɛnyɔɛpe: Sa wɔ ààlɛɛ mot sa dhaa wak ɛ. Tɔ́a, kɛlyaal nyel pɛ daa ghaa-Zɛɛb, da wɔ ɛ́ kɛdjɛ esa e ɛkɛɛ ɛ Zɛɛb dáa Moiiz nalyo ɛ, étɛp wɔ neelyaal bot djas náá, wɔ eetsak ɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛtsik mot-mɛsa ɛ komanda esodja e Lɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Dáa Yezu nadi eni tɔ ghaada Kapɛlnaum ɛ, wɔ gwaa dhiiti boo kukuma tɔ lɔɔg esodja zɛtiila pɛ daa lɛ. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ Yezu náá, nyɛ zɛkwyee nyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, mot-mɛsa mam ngɔt ɛ́ ndjaasi pɛ ndjaŋ'am, nyɛ eezesɔɔb nyɛ ɛpebɛ́ ɛlyelɛpe.» <verse eid="MAT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Tin, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɛ ɛpetɔ́, kɛtsik nyɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />É di'enek, boo kukuma yenɔk eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, mam ɛ́ yam zɛ, wɔ neezɛni tɔ ndjaŋ'am. Ye goka ɛ́ náá, wɔ zolóo ɛkpa ɛ wat, étɛp mot-mɛsa mam neetsak. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Di mɛ di'aak, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ekukuma bam mɛ di egwak esesɛɛ mɛ di goka nɛ ɛsa ɛ nɛ nɔɔ. Pɛ si mɛko mam, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ esodja. Mɛ ke nɛ ngɔt náá: “Tɔ́ak” ɔɔ, nyɛ ɛpetɔ́. Mɛ ke nɛ nwyak náá: “Bulak” ɔɔ, nyɛ ɛpebula. Tin, mɛ ke nɛ mot-mɛsa mam: “Sa dáak” ɔɔ, nyɛ ɛpesa.» <verse eid="MAT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Dáa Yezu nagwak eyala e kukuma yenɔk ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ naadyeebamyaala. Tin, nyɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ bot ɛ nadi egyee nɛ nɛ ɔ náá: «Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, mɛ dinaa ààpabee kwaambi yak ɛdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb sok kɔ Yisalaɛl dáa yii mot'ak. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Betka mɛ lɛɛ bin náá, bot ɛbuɛpe ɛ́ waadus pɛ ɛbil ɛ dwoo nɛ pɛ ɛdjem ɛ dwoo. Bɛ waazyɛ, zɛdi kɔ mesa wat, bɛ nɛ bɔn ɛ Abalaam, Izak nɛ Zakɔɔb tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Tin, bot ɛ nagoka nɛ ɛdi ɛ́ bot ɛ ɛyoŋ ɛ tak ɔ, bɛ aadi ɛ́, mwasaa pɛ kel, tɔ ghooghom pɛ baadi edje mɛgwyɛ nɛ ɛkwaal ɛ mɛtsok ɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛke nɛ kukuma esodja binɔk náá: «Sika pɛ ndjaŋ'ɔ etɛɛ náá, kɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔ nɛ Zɛɛb, Zɛɛb eedjɛ wɔ sa lyem'ɔ di ekwos ɛ!» É di tak wat, ye nabɛ ɛ́, mot-mɛsa ɛ kukuma esodja binɔk naatsak.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eetsik bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ mɛbɛ́</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Yezu eezɛwyis, tɔ́ pɛ daa Pyɛɛd. Ghuna tsi ɛ Pyɛɛd yii moma nadi ɛ́ ndjaasi nɛ mɛkosa ɛkpaŋɛpe. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Nyɛ eezɛmɛt nyɛ é mbɔ, mɛkosa eezɛsi. É di tak wat, moma yenɔk eezɛwyɛl, nyɛ moo zɛbe bɛ.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Dáa dwoo nadi ye moo esila ɛ, wɔ gwaa bɛ zɛzyɛ nyɛ nɛ bot ɛ embee esisim nadi edhek ɔ. Dáa Yezu nadi elii kɔ membel menɔk ɛ, embee esisim nadi ewyis tɔ lɔɔ, tin, nyɛ naatsik dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ mɛbɛ́ djas. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Nyɛ nasa deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, esesɛɛ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Ezayi nalɛɛ ɛ́, neebela ɛsuk. Nyɛ nake ɛ́ náá: «Nyɛ naanɔɔ edjam bina nɛ mɛbɛ́ mena<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.17 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:4">Eza 53.4</ref></char></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bot ɛ di ekwyɛl ɛdu Yezu ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Bhii tak, dáa Yezu nabee ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi edu nyɛ ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá, bɛ sɛɛ dhaa pɛ yii kyiid boo soob na djato-djato. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Wɔ gwaa, dhiiti ghaa-mɛkana mɛ etsi zɛzyɛ pɛ daa lɛ. Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Lyoel, mɛ ɛpekwyɛl ɛdu ɛ wɔ é mɛze djas wɔ aadi etɔ́ ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Deenek Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Bɛbhɛk ɛ́ nɛ eku, enen ɛ́ nɛ mɛk. Yɛ kabɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɔɔ, nyɛ tok nɛ zeza di ɛdjaasi nɛ ɛwala.»<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Dhiiti mot ngɔt pak bɛdjekel bɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, ɛsok nɛ mɛ nɛ du wɔ, pookobet mɛ, mɛ pookokɛdel Saagam.» <verse eid="MAT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Tin, Yezu eebɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Dua mɛ, beta bot ɛ zegwyɛ ɔ, bɛ del myoŋ mɛ bot bɔɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛlyak ghuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Yezu eezɛni tɔ boo elɛɛd sama wat nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Ààbɔya deenek, kasɛka ɛ́, boo ghuu na lyel-lyel eezɛkan ɛpupal kɔ boo soob na djato-djato. Mɛpupal mɛ tak eezɛghɛɛ ɛbhyeeb ɛ mɛdii, zɛghɛɛg é elɛɛd. Ye kabela tin ɛ́, Yezu edja gɔ́. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Tin, bɛdjekel bɛ zokazɛtiila pɛ pak nyɛ nadi tɔ elɛɛd ɛ, bɛ eezɛdjem nyɛ nɛ etsim: «Ghɛŋ, tsika bis! Ɛsyee ɛ́ yak!» <verse eid="MAT 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />É di'enek, ye nabɛ ɛ́ Yezu naazɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Étɛp yé bi di nɛ kɛŋ? Ɛbwaalel ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb nɛ tɔɔl!» Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛwyɛl, zɛbhɛm ghuu, nɛ dii, nyɛ eezɛlyak ghuu. Nyɛy nɛ dii náá: «Sila ghulal'ɔ ye di gwyem.» Wɔ gwaa, ghuu zɛsila, bhwak moo tin kup. <verse eid="MAT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Bɔɔ djas nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ naadyeebadjoka. Tin, bɔɔ náá: «Nwyak ɛ́ nwyaa kwaambi mot di náá, dɔɔ nɛ ghuu nɛ boo soob na djato-djato ɛpegwak nyɛ?»<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛtsik bot ɛbá embee esisim nadi edhek ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Dáa Yezu nasɛɛ pɛ yii kyiid boo soob na djato-djato pɛ kyee dik bot ɛ Ghadhaala ɛ, wɔ gwaa bot ɛbá zɛtuula tɔ mɛvit, bɛ neezɛboma nɛ nɛ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ embee esisim nadi dhek ɔ, bɛ nadi ɛ́, nɛ mbee mɛnyan dhaa tyɛ, bot nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛdhaa é ngwoob mɛvit mɛ tak. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Bot binɔk moo tin etsim náá: «Bis sa wɔ yé, wɔy Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb? Wɔ zyɛ wak ɛ́ zɛzɛm bis, sonok ɛwala ɛ tak dinaa ààdjala?»<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Ba ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ di tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ boo ɛsaŋ ɛ bɛghwyee nadi egɔɔ tin ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Embee esisim eezɛdjaala nɛ Yezu, bɔɔ náá: «Wɔ kwyɛl ɛsɔ bis ɔɔ, kyeeda bis tɔ ɛsaŋ ɛ bɛghwyee bak.» <verse eid="MAT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Yezu eezɛmyaal, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá, bɛ tɔ́. Tin, wɔ gwaa embee esisim zɛwyis tɔ bot binɔk, zɛni tɔ ɛsaŋ ɛ bɛghwyee. Bhii tak, ɛsaa djas eezɛsul ɛtsok pɛ bɛ nadi ɛ́, kaab, kɛghaaga tɔ dii, diida. Bɔɔ djas si na bhɛɛɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Bot ɛ nadi ebaal ɛsaŋ ɛ bɛghwyee tak ɔ, zokazɛkaab, sik pɛ dɛl. Bɛ moo tin ebaŋa bot ɛ dɛl edjema bɛ bee penek dum nɛ bot ɛbá binɔk ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Tin, wɔ gwaa bot ɛ dɛl djas zokazɛwyis, kɛboma nɛ Yezu. Dáa bɛ naboma nɛ nɛ ɛ, bɛ naazɛdjaala nɛ Yezu náá, nyɛ dus kɔ kyee dik'ɔɔ.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu eetsik dhiiti mot nazesɔɔb nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />É di'enek, Yezu eezɛni tɔ elɛɛd, sɛɛ boo soob na djato-djato, sik pɛ dɛl. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Tin, bɛdhiiti bot zokazyɛ nɛ mot ngɔt nazesɔɔb nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɔ, byaala kɔ mwaala. Dáa Yezu nabee ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ bot ɛ nazyɛ nɛ mbel tak ɔ, nyɛ naazɛke nɛ mbel náá: «Sa mɛghaaz mɔn'am, mesyem mɔ eepelel!» <verse eid="MAT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Dáa bɛ nabee deenek ɛ́, bɛdhiiti bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi ɛ Moiiz nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ moo enyiŋela pak'ɔɔ náá: «Nwyak mot ɛpebyasal Zɛɛb!» <verse eid="MAT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />É di tak wat, ye nabɛ ɛ́, Yezu naagu esiiza bɔɔ. Nyɛ boozɛke náá: «Étɛp yé bi di nɛ mbee esiiza tɔ elyem bin deenek? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Ɛyé di elyel nɛ nen, ɛke ɛ́ nɛ mot ɛbɛ́ náá: “Mesyem mɔ eepelel” ohoo, nɛghu ɛke náá: “Wyɛla, da wɔ ɛ́ kɛ”? <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Ye goka ɛ́ bi gu náá, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛpel mesyem mɛ bot kɔ bɔs.» Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ mot zesɔɔb nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɔ náá: «Wyɛla, nɔŋa mwaala yɔ, da wɔ ɛ́ sik pɛ ndjaŋ'ɔ!» <verse eid="MAT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />É di'enek, mot'enɔk eezɛwyɛl, sik pɛ ndjaŋ'ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />É di'enek wat, dáa ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ nabee deenek ɛ́, bɛ naadyeebadjoka ɛlyelɛpe. Bhii tak, bɛ moo eduwal Zɛɛb dáa nyɛ nadjɛ mbi yenek mɛbwala nɛ bot ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛdjóo Matye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Yezu eezɛdus tin, dáa nyɛ nadi edhaŋ ɛ, nyɛ naazɛbee dhiiti mot, din ɛ lɛ ɛ́ Matye, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ ndiindel é di mɛsa mɛ. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́ nɔŋel epata e lapo. Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɛ: «Dua mɛ!» Matye eezɛwyɛl ngbat, bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛdu nyɛ. <figure style="fig" alt="Matthieu collecteur d’impôts à son lieu de travail" file="lb00309c.tif" size="col" loc="9.9" copy="Louise Bass" ref="9.9">Matye nɔŋel epata e lapo é di mɛsa mɛ</figure><verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Yezu bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ nadi edɛ edee pɛ ndjaŋ ɛ Matye. Wɔ gwaa, bɛtɛ nɛ bɛnɔŋel ɛ epata e lapo nɛ bot ɛ mesyem zokazɛlwood tin, zɛdɛ bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ djas kɔ mesa wat. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Dáa eFalizyɛ nabee deenek ɛ, bɛ naazɛdji bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Étɛp yé lyoel yen di edɛ edee é di wat bɛ nɛ bɛnɔŋel ɛ epata e lapo nɛ bot ɛ mbee dék?» <verse eid="MAT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Yezu eegwak dáa bɛ nadi elii ɛ, tin, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bot ɛ di nɛ mɛnyel ɛnyɔɛpe ɔ tok nɛ gwyes ngwomel bot nyɛ neegwom bɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ membel ɛ di nɛ gwyes mɛgwoma. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Tɔ́ka, kɛdjekeka ɛsuk ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb di eke náá: “Mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́ enɛm esa, ààkabɛ ebuwa e bɛtit<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.13 <char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Oze 6.6</ref></char></char></note>.” Etɛɛ náá, mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààzyɛ zɛsaa bot ɛ epiki. Mam nazyɛ ɛ́ zɛsaa bot ɛ di egu náá, bɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ mesyem ɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo ɛ Yezu dum nɛ tɛp ɛtsi edee étɛp mendjaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Dhiiti dwoo, bɛdjekel ɛ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot naazyɛ zɛdji Yezu náá: «Étɛp yé bisɔ nɛ eFalizyɛ di etsi edee étɛp mendjaala, dhi bɛdjekel bɔ di ààtsi edee étɛp mendjaala?» <verse eid="MAT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Wɔ gwaa, Yezu zɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi nakobee sok paa náá, bɛsɔ ɛ mwaaz di tɔ ghoŋ dwoo ɛba, dhi bɛ di lɔɔg wat nɛ mwaaz, mot paazyɛ, zɛba moma ɔ? Yenek ààsael! Deenek, ɛwala tak ɛpezyɛ, ɛwala ɛ di náá, mot zɛba moma ɔ waadisaa pak'ɔɔ. É di tak ɛ bɛ aatsi edee.<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />Ye tok nɛ mot aanyaa pes bes kaad étɛp ɛkoobal put kaad nɛ yɛ. Wɔ sa deenek ɔɔ, é sok wɔ aagwyii kaad tak ɛ, bes kaad ɛ́ waanyaa put kaad, da yɛ ɛ́ bek ɛlen ɛ tak. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Mɛnyok mɛ na bes ààwaaa tɔ bhɛɛb na mwa. Yɛ sɛɛ deenek ɔɔ, bhɛɛb ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛbel, da mɛnyok ɛ́ see, deenek bhɛɛb eepulel. Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ bɛ di lɛɛaa náá, yɛ ààgoka deenek, etɛɛ náá, mɛnyok mɛ na bes goka ɛ́ tɔ ebes e bhɛɛb.»<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eetsik dhiiti moma, da gomal ɛsyes ɛ Zayilus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Dáa Yezu nadi elii nɛ nɔɔ deenek ɛ́, wɔ gwaa dhiiti kukuma eYuda zɛzyɛ pɛ daa lɛ. Nyɛ eezɛkwyit mɛboŋ si mɛko mɛ. Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Ɛsyes ɛ lam ààlóo nɛ pɛka. Mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́, wɔ zɛkɛl mɛmbɔ kɔ lɛ étɛp nyɛ neegom!» <verse eid="MAT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Yezu eezɛwyɛl, ngbat, bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ, du nyɛ.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Dhiiti moma nadi ebɛ́ ɛbɛ́ ɛ zoob, ghiya nadi ekekɛk nyɛ ààbɛ nɛ ɛtsek. Ɛbɛ́ ɛ tak naaboya nɛ nɛ é di membu kam nɛ ebá. Moma tak zokazɛtiila pɛ bhii koŋ ɛ Yezu, nyɛ eezɛmɛt kyee ɛghɔ ɛ kaad ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Étɛp, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ eeke tɔ lyem'ɛ náá: «Mɛ zomɛt kaad'ɛ ɔɔ, mɛ ɛpetsak!» <verse eid="MAT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Tin, Yezu eezɛliig mis, gwyák nyɛ. Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Sa mɛghaaz ɛsyes ɛ lam! Ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔ nɛ Zɛɛb eetsik wɔ.» É di tak wat, moma yenɔk naazɛtsak.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛtɔ́ pɛ ndjaa kukuma eYuda e tak. Dáa bɛ nakum ɛ, bɛ kabela bot ɛ, ebwom ngɔmbi, zɛnɔɔ bak bot esa yɔbɔ ɛzɛm pɛ ndjaa tak étɛp ɛkoobal esesɛɛ, bɛ neetɔ́ ndela. <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />Tin, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Wyiska pɛ kel, etɛɛ náá, ɛsyes ɛlak ààpagwyɛ, nyɛ dja ɛ́ gɔ́.» É di'enek, bɛ moo tin eduk Yezu. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Dáa bɛ nawyisal ɛdhuu ɛ bot pɛ kel ɛ, Yezu eezɛni tɔ dhɛŋ, nyɛ eezɛmɛt nyɛ é mbɔ, wɔ gwaa ɛsyes ɛlenɔk zɛwyɛl. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Menduk mɛ tɛp'enek naakɛ kɔ kyee dik'enek djas.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eetsik bot ɛ edhim bɛbá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Dáa Yezu nadus tin ɛ, wɔ gwaa bot ɛ mɛbɛ́ mɛ edhim bɛbá zokazɛni edu nyɛ bhii koŋ nɛ etsim: «Mɔn Dhavid, geka bis ghoŋ!»<verse eid="MAT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Dáa Yezu nakum pɛ ndjaŋ ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bɛ na edhim binɔk zɛtiila pɛ daa lɛ. Yezu eezɛdji bɛ náá: «Bi eemyaal náá, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛsa sa bi di ewaab'enek é?» Bot binɔk eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Iyooo, Ghɛŋ! Wɔ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛsa.» <verse eid="MAT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Tin, Yezu eezɛkɛl bɛ mɛmbɔ kɔ mis. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Zɛɛb eedjɛ bin sa djala nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />É di tak wat, wɔ gwaa bɛ nyaasok. Yezu eezɛlu bɛ ɛlyelɛpe náá: «Gwakeka mɛ ɛnyɔɛpe: sa mot ngɔt ààgu sa sɛɛ wak ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Tin, bot binɔk katɔ́ ɛ́, elɛɛ tɔ kyee dik'enek djas esesɛɛ Yezu nasa ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛtsik dhiiti bubu mot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />É sok bɛ nadi ekwyɛl ɛtɔ́ ɛ, bɛdhiiti bot nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ eezyɛ Yezu nɛ mot ngɔt nadi bubu ɔ, etɛɛ náá, embee esisim nadi edhek nyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Dáa Yezu nasɔ embee esisim tak ɛ, é di tak wat mot'enɔk nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ moo elii. Tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́, ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi é di tak ɔ, moo tin edjoka. Bɔɔ náá: «Bis dinaa ààpakobee kɔkɔ mbi yak sonok tɔ Yisalaɛl.» <verse eid="MAT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Yɛ kabɛ eFalizyɛ ɔɔ, bɔɔ nake yɔbɔ ɛ́ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ kukuma embee esisim ɛ di edjɛ Yezu mɛbwala mɛ nyɛ di esɔ embee esisim nɛ yɛ ɛ!»<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu ɛ́ nɛ ghoŋ nɛ ɛdhuu ɛ bot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Yezu nadi ekɛ kɔ boo eghaada nɛ kɔ mɛl. Nyɛ nadi elelyo mɛdhuu mɛ bot tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda. Nyɛ nadi egoola bɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal dum nɛ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb. Nyɛ nadi etsik bot ɛ di nɛ epel ɔ, zɛnɔɔ bot ɛ nadi nɛ edjam ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́, ghoŋ naasa nyɛ ɛlyelɛpe dum nɛ ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ. Etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ tak nadi ɛ́, bɛ eezewak dáa mɛsaa mɛ ebhata di ààbɛ nɛ mbaalel ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Edee nɛ bu tɔ pyeeb, tin, bot ɛ ɛbɔ́k ààbu. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Ye goka ɛ́ bi djaala náá, nakuma pyeeb dhis bɛdhiiti bot ɛ mɛsa étɛp bɛ needis edee tɔ pyeeb.»<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s1">Bɛdjekel ɛ Yezu kam nɛ bɛbá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Yezu naazɛdjóo bɛdjekel bɛ kam nɛ bɛbá. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛdjɛ bɛ eghɛŋ ɛsɔ embee esisim nɛ ɛtsik ɛ́ bot ɛ mɛbɛ́, zɛnɔɔ bot ɛ nadi nɛ edjam ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Beeka min mɛ bot ɛ lwoma kam nɛ bɛbá tak é: Mot mɛkɛn ɛ́ Simɔŋ nagetaa din Pyɛɛd ɔ, nɛ dhyeeb Andele, Zak bɛ nɛ dhyeeb Zaŋ bɔɔ bɛbá nabɛ ɛ́ bɔn ɛ Zɛbɛdɛ, <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Filip nɛ Bhaatelemi, Toma zɛnɔɔ Matye nɔŋel epata e lapo, baazɛnɔɔ Zak mɔn Alfe, wɔ kabela ɛ́ Tade, <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Simɔŋ mot di tɔ ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi edjóoaa eZɛlɔt ɔ, zɛnɔɔ Yudas Iskaliɔt mot naka Yezu gha ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛsa mɛ bɛdjekel nalwomaa ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Yezu zokazɛlwom bɛdjekel bɛ kam nɛ bɛbá étɛp ɛsa mɛsa mɛ. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi ɛ́ kookyee mɛl mɛ bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ. Sa bi ààni pɛ tɔ eghaada e bot ɛ Samaali. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Bi goka nɛ ɛtɔ́ ɛ́, pɛ daa bot ɛ mbyak Yisalaɛl di dáa ebhata ee nazewo ze ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Ze ɛ ze, gheegoolaka nɛ bot náá: “Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ moo ɛ́ ɛkunaaɛpe!” <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Tsikeka bot ɛ mɛbɛ́, gomalka bot ɛ zegwyɛ ɔ, tsikeka bot mɛbɛ́ mɛ ezezam ezezam bɔɔ, sɔka embee esisim. Esa ee bi bela ààbɔm-bɔmak ɛ, djɛka bot yɛ yii toto. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Nànɔɔka elɔɔd, àànɔɔ epata, ààbaanɔɔ-nɔŋak dɔɔ nɛ meea étɛp ɛwa tɔ mengwyɛ da tɔ́ nɛ yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />Nànɔɔka mɛkoo mɛ di tɔ́aa nɛ yɛ mɛdjoŋ ɛ, nànɔɔka dhiiti kuwa, nànɔɔka edhiiti ekoko, nànɔɔka sek, étɛp ɛtɔ́ mɛdjoŋ nɛ yɛ, etɛɛ náá, mot di esa mɛsa ɔ goka ɛ́ nyɛ bela sa dek.<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />Bi ɛ kum kɔ dhiiti mɔɔ dɛl nɛghu kɔ ghaada ɔɔ, saaka mot di nɛ ghwyil ɛmyaal bin náá, bi sulal pɛ daa lɛ ɔ. Dika pɛ daa mot'enɔk, bi dus tin ɛ, yɛ bɛ bi moo twol kɔ dɛl ɛ tak ɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Bi ɛ́ ni tɔ ndjaa mot ɔɔ, keka náá: “Bis eeswos bin ooo.” <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Yɛ bɛ náá, bot ɛ ndjaa tak eemyaal bin ɔɔ, tin, egwyem bin di nɛ nɔɔ. Tin, bɛ pɛɛ náá, bi nàsulal tɔ mendjaa mɔɔ ɔɔ, betka egwyem bin sik nɛ nen. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Yɛ bɛ náá, kɔ dhiiti dɛl nɛghu tɔ dhiiti ndjaa, bɛ eepɛɛ náá, bi nàsulal ɔɔ, bɛ byen ɛgwak bin ɔɔ, wyiska yebɔ kɔ dɛl ɛ́ tak, nɛghu tɔ ndjaa tak, da bi ɛ́ kut piib mɛko men. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp etsɛɛtsɛ náá, dwoo Zɛɛb aazɛpɛ́ɛ bot ɛ, dɛl ɛlenek aapɛ́ɛaa ɛ́ ɛlyelɛpe dhaa-dhaŋak epɛ́ɛ bot ɛ ghaada Sodɔm nɛ yii Ghomɔɔd.»<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mezuk mɛ di ezyɛ pɛ sok ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />«Gwakeka! Mɛ kyeed bin tin ɛ́ dáa ebhata kuku eben. Dika nɛ etsoŋ dáa bɛnyɔ, da bi ɛ́ di bot ɛ edɛɛ dáa mɛgum. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Dika bɛtsoŋ ɛ bot, etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ́ waakɛpit bin sok bhwoob boo zɛɛga bɛtetɛp eYuda, bi ɛ́ waabiaa nɛ eghwyɛs tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam, bi ɛ́ waakɛtaŋal pɛ daa ekukuma nɛ bɛmɛkoozi, zɛnɔɔ pɛ daa bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, étɛp bi needi bɛtyaasɛs ɛ etɛp ee bi nazebee ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />É sok bɛ aatɔ́ nɛ nen sok bhwoob boo zɛɛga bɛtetɛp eYuda ɛ, sa mot ààbem ba étɛp mɛkpa aawyis tɔ enuub bin nɛ dáa bi aataŋal ɛ. Mɛkpa mɛ taŋal ɛ́ waadjɛaa bin é di'enek wat. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Etɛɛ náá, ye tok biyɔ aakalii tin. Yɛ ɛ́ Sisim Sɛɛg'en ɛ aataŋal é di'enek.»<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />«Bɔn-nyɛɛg ngɔt ɛ waakɛkael pak'ɔɔ é ɛsaŋ ɛ́ náá, mɔn-nyɛɛg'ɔɔ neegóaa, dɔɔ nɛ bɛsɛɛg ɛ bɔn aazobaasa ɛ́ deenek nɛ bɔn bɔɔ. Bɔn ɛ́ waapit bɛbyael bɔɔ, bɔɔ kɛmɛtaa, kwyɛ ndjɛ sɔs, góaa. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Bot djas ɛ́ waabhina bin, étɛp din ɛ lam. Tin, bot ɛ aawa zii kɛkum pɛ ɛsik ɔ, bɛ waabela tsik. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />É sok bi aadi kɔ dhiiti ghaada ɛ, bot ɛ ghaada tak ɛ di esa bin esa e ekokok nɛ etɛp ɛpes nɛ mezuk ɔɔ, kaabka, da bi ɛ́ tɔ́ pɛ dɛl ɛ sis. Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, bi aanàkwaasilal ɛkɛ kɔ mɛl mɛ di kɔ kyee dik Yisalaɛl ɔ djas, ɛsok nɛ náá, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot zyɛ.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />Ye tok nɛ djekel ngɔt di edhaa mot di elyo nyɛ ɔ. Ye tok nɛ mot-mɛsa di edhaa kukuma yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Djekel goka ɛ́, nyɛ di dáa lyoel yɛ, da mot-mɛsa ɛ́ di dáa kukuma yɛ. Kwyii nakuma mɛbyel ɛ́ koodjóoaa Bɛlzebul, “Aah” gwyata nɛ bot ɛ mɛbyel mɛ! Bɛ aazoleleeaa ɛ́ leeak.»<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mot bi di egoka nɛ ɛkaab ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />«Étɛp tak ɛ di náá, sa mot ààkaab bɛmbee ɛ bot binɔk. Dhiiti dwoo ɛ́ tak, dwoo di náá, esesɛɛ djas di syela ɛ́ waawyis é gwyɛ ɛ. Esesɛɛ djas di tɔ syaab ɛ waaguaa. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Tɛp mɛ di elɛɛ bin tɔ ghooghom ɛ, lɛɛka yɛ popoopwon é mwos dwoo. Etɛp ee bi nadi enyiiŋelaa tɔ ɛlɔ ɛ, tuudka yɛ ɛlyelɛpe kɔ emii e mendjaa. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Nàkaabka sa di egó epuud ɛ, etɛɛ náá, bɛ aanàkwaagó sisim. Bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛkaab ɛ Zɛɛb mot di nɛ ghwyil ɛgó sisim nɛ epuud tɔ du na kɔm-kɔm ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Tin, bɔɔ enen ebá tok wak ebɔmsaa nɛ ba mɔɔ falanga wat é? Bela náá, ngɔt pak'ɔɔ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛkwyit é bɔs, Sɛɛg'en ɛ di ààmyaal ɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Deenek, bhoo e elo bin ɛ́ elaŋa. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Sa mot ààdi nɛ bwoo, etɛɛ náá, é mis ɛ Zɛɛb, bi ɛ́ nɛ boo mɛtaŋ, dhaa bɔɔ enen!»<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛmyaal, nɛghu ɛbyen ɛ Yezu Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />«Mot aamyaal popoopwon é mis mɛ bot djas náá, nyɛ ɛ́ djekel'am ɔɔ, mam pe, mɛ waamyaal nyɛ é mis mɛ Saagam di tɔ gwoo ɔ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ ngbam. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Bela náá, mot aakɛla popoopwon é mis mɛ bot djas náá, nyɛ tok djekel'am ɔɔ, mam pe, mɛ waakɛla nyɛ é mis mɛ Saagam di tɔ gwoo ɔ náá, mɛ ààgu nyɛ!»<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu nabɛ ɛ́ ààzyɛ étɛp bot neegwakel, nyɛ nazyɛ ɛ́ zɛwa zyaala pak bot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />«Nàgekeka náá, mɛ nazyɛ kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɛ́, étɛp ɛzɛwa egwyem tɔ bot. Mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààzyɛ, zɛwa egwyem nɛ ɛgwakel tɔ bot. Mɛ nazyɛ ɛ́ zɛkus ɛghuub nɛ ɛzɛbɛk ɛ bot. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Mɛ nazyɛ ɛ́ zɛwa membɛk pak sɛɛg nɛ mɔn mɔɔ motom, pak nyɛɛg nɛ mɔn mɔɔ moma, pak nakɔla nɛ bhɛɛbel. <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Bot ɛ mɛbhuka men aadi ɛ́, bot ɛ mɛbyel men met. <verse eid="MAT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />Mot di ekwyɛl mot ngɔt pak sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg dhaa mɛ ɔɔ, mot tak ààkɔa nɛ nam. Mot di ekwyɛl mɔn'ɛ mɔɔ moma, nɛghu mɔn'ɛ mɔɔ motom dhaa mɛ ɔɔ, mot tak ààkɔa nɛ nam. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Mot ɛ di ààbɛp mɛlaaba mɛ, da nyɛ ɛ́ du mɛ ɔɔ, mot tak ààkɔa nɛ nam. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Mot aakwyɛl ɛkwyɛɛg tsik'ɛ dhaa mɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ waasu tsik'ɛ. Mot aakakwyɛl ɛsu tsik'ɛ étɛp ɛdu ɛ mɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ waabela tsik.»<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Efute</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />«Mot aamyaal náá, bi sulal tɔ ndjaŋ'ɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ myaal ɛ́ mam. Mot aamyaal mɛ tɔ ndjaŋ'ɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ myaal ɛ́ mot nadhis mɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Mot aamyaal ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb tɔ ndjaŋ'ɛ, da dil nyɛ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ, nyɛ waabela efute ee di egyee nɛ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. Mot di emyaal mot epiki, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ mot epiki ɔɔ, nyɛ waabela efute mot epiki di gyee nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, mot aadjɛ dhiiti ba mɔɔ djekel'am ngɔt ba mɔɔ bɛɛlɛ mɛdii, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ djekel'am ɔɔ, nyɛ waabela efute bɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s1">Bot ɛ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot nalwom ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Dáa Yezu nasilal ɛlyo bɛdjekel bɛ kam nɛ bɛbá ɛ, nyɛ eezɛdus tin, tɔ́ kɛlyo nɛ ɛkɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal pɛ eghaada kyee dik'enek.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Zaŋ Nduuel-bot, pɛ nyɛ nadi tɔ ndjaa membok ɛ, nyɛ naagwak menduk ɛ Mɛsia. Tin, nyɛ ɛ́ boolwom bɛdhiiti bɛdjekel bɛ, <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />bɛ kɛdji Yezu náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ wɔy ɛ di Mɛsia nabɛ náá, nyɛ ɛpezyɛ ohoo, nɛghu yɛ ɛ́ náá, ye baabwoodaa dhiiti baadi ezyɛ ɔ?» <verse eid="MAT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Kɛlɛɛka Zaŋ sa bi bee ɛ́ nɛ yii bi gwak nɛ mɛlɔ men ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />Bot ɛ edhim moo nyaasok. Bot ɛ di nɛ edjam ɔ moo kɛ ɛnyɔɛpe. Bot ɛ mɛbɛ́ mɛ ezezam eezetsak. Bɛ na endiila e mɛlɔ moo gwak, bot ɛ nazegwyɛ ɔ, bɛ eezegom. Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛpegoolel kɛkum pɛ daa bɛdjel ɛ bot. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Mɛnyɔ nɛ mot aadi ààkat ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɛ nɛ nam ɔ!»<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Bhii bɛdjekel ɛ Zaŋ nasik ɛ, Yezu moo tin elii nɛ zukamwaa nɛ mot nadi tin kɔ ɛsu ɛ Zaŋ ɔ. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi nakɛbee yé tɔ bal? Bi nakɛbee ɛ́ mɔɔ le ghwaazok edheegel nɛ pup é? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Haaa bi nakɛbee yé tɔ bal? Bi nakɛbee ɛ́ mot ngɔt nɛ vaŋ mbi bhet é? Bi nɛ gu náá, bot ɛ dyeebabɔt evaŋ ekaad ɔ, dyeebadi ɛ́ pɛ tɔ eboo mendjaa mɛ bɛmɛkoozi. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Bi nakɛbee yé? Bi nakɛbee ɛ́ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb é? Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, nyɛ eedhaa-dhaŋak ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Etɛɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ Zaŋ ɛ Ekwyala nalɛɛ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:10">“Ɛsok nɛ wɔ nɛ tɔ́, mɛ waalwom ngoola-ngoola yam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:10">nyɛ neekɛdii wɔ ze.”<verse eid="MAT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá: pɛ tɔ bot djas Zɛɛb nasa ɔ, ye tok nɛ mot dhaa Zaŋ Nduuel-bot. Saabɛgɔs ɛ́ náá, mot di mɔɔ dhyeeb tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ boo boo-mot nɛ Zaŋ. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Kɛkan membu mɛ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot nadi elyo bot tɔ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, kɛyaka nɛ ɛlu ɛ mos, ɛni ɛ́ tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ nɛ lyel. Bot ɛ di nɛ mɛghaaz ɔ di nɛ ghwyil ɛdɛk yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Kana nɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb djas, zɛnɔɔ etsi ɛ Moiiz, Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb naagoolel kɛkum membu mɛ ɛkwyil ɛ Zaŋ. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Bi ɛ kwyɛl ɛtiibal ɛnyɔɛpe ɔɔ, yɛ ɛ́ Zaŋ ɛ di Eli, ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nalookɛkaa náá, nyɛ waabula ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Yɛ bɛ náá, bi ɛ́ nɛ mɛlɔ mɛ ɛgwak ɔɔ, gwakeka yɛ ɛnyɔɛpe!<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />Mɛ gek bot ɛ membu mak nɛ bɛzɛ? Bɛ ɛ́ dáa zɛɛga bɔɔ dhyeeb mendiindil kɔ ɛbɛsɛɛ ɛ bot djas di di ɛ, da bɛdhiiti ɛ́ gheetsim kɔ bɛsɔ bɔɔ náá: <verse eid="MAT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />“Bis eebwom bin ngɔmbi, bi ààpabɔl. Bis eedjeeb bin mɛdjeeb mɛ ɛsyee, bi ààpadje!” <verse eid="MAT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Etɛɛ náá, Zaŋ eezyɛ, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ eetsi edee nɛ mɛnyok. Deenek, bot kake ɛ́ náá: “Yɛ ɛ́ embee esisim ɛ di esa nyɛ deenek!” <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot eezyɛ. Nyɛ ɛpedɛ yɛ edee, bi kake ɛ́ náá: “Beeka nwyak é? Na ghaa-dek nɛ mɛnyok. Nyɛ be mɛsɔ ɛ́ nɛ bɛnɔŋel ɛ epata e lapo dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ di nɛ mbee tsik ɔ!” Tin, etsoŋ e Zɛɛb nadi enyen tɔ mɛsa mɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eghaada di ebyen ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Tin, Yezu eezɛni nɛ mɛlyo mɛ ɛdul ɛ mɛlɔ mɛ bot ɛ eghaada ee nyɛ nasa bɛtɛ nɛ endem e mɛbwala ɔ, etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ eghaada tak nabɛ ɛ́ ààliig elyem bɔɔ. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛlɛɛ náá: <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />«Haaa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ nɔ, dɛl ɛ Koodazin, kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ nɔ, dɛl ɛ Bhɛtsaida! Etɛɛ náá, bɛtɛ nɛ endem e mɛbwala nasael pɛ yebɔ ɛ, yɛ ɛpedi ɛ́ náá, ye nasael ɛ́ pɛ ghaada Tiid nɛ yii Sidɔn ɔɔ, pe bot ɛ eghaada binɔk naaloobɔt kaad ɛpum, pe bɛ naazelɔɔba mɛsii, pe bɛ naaloozeliig elyem bɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Yɛ ɛ́ etɛp tak ɛ mɛ di elɛɛ nɛ nen náá, dwoo Zɛɛb aazɛpɛ́ɛ bot ɛ, yebɔ epɛ́ɛ ɛ́ waadhaa yii bot ɛ ghaada Tiid nɛ yii Sidɔn nɛ mɛlyel. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Yɛ kabɛ wɔy ɔɔ, dɛl Kapɛlnaum, wɔ gek ɛ́ náá, wɔ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛbyet tɔ́ pɛ tɔ gwoo? Wɔ waasilaa kɛkum pɛ dɛl ɛ edim e bot ɛ nazegwyɛ ɔ. Etɛɛ náá, endem e mɛbwala mɛ nasɛɛ penek ɛ, yɛ ɛpedi ɛ́ náá, ye naasɛɛ ɛ́ pɛ dɛl ɛ Sodɔm ɔɔ, pe dɛl ɛlenek dinaa tak dɔɔ nɛ mos. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ mɛ di elɛɛ bin náá, dwoo Zɛɛb aazɛpɛ́ɛ bot ɛ, epɛ́ɛ nyɛ aapɛ́ɛ bin ɛ, yɛ waadhaa yii bot ɛ kyee bɔs Sodɔm nɛ mɛlyel.»<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">«Dhaka pɛ daa lam, mɛ needjɛ bin ɛwala!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />É ghɛŋ tak, Yezu naazɛke náá: «Heee Saagam, Ghɛŋ gwoo nɛ bɔs, mɛ ɛpeghaapɛɛ wɔ, etɛɛ náá, esonok ee wɔ nasyel bɛtsoŋ ɛ bot nɛ bot ɛ di etselal ɔ, wɔ eelyaal yɛ nɛ bɔɔ dhyeeb. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Iyooo, Saagam, wɔ nakwyɛl ɛ́, ye sael deenek.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />Saagam naadjɛ mɛ esonok djas. Ye tok nɛ mot di egu Mɔn, yɛ di ààbɛ Sɛɛg ɔɔ. Deenek, ye tok nɛ mot di egu Sɛɛg, yɛ di ààbɛ Mɔn nɛghu mot Mɔn aakwyɛl ɛlyaal ɔɔ.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />Biyɔ, bot ɛ zewak étɛp ɛbɛp edil-dil mɛkɔm men ɔ, dhaka pɛ daa lam, mɛ needjɛ bin ɛwala. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Bɛpka kɔm etɛp bam. Betka náá, mɛ djɛ bin etsoŋ, etɛɛ náá, mam ɛ́ mot mɛsila nɛ ɛtela ɛ lyem. Tin, bi ɛ́ waabela di ɛwala biyɔ bɛmet. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Kɔm etɛp mɛ di edjɛ bin ɛ, yɛ ààdil, ɛbɛp ɛ lam mɛ di djóo bin náá, bi zɛbɛp ɛ, nɛ gwyaa.»<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo dum nɛ tɛp dwoo saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Dhiiti dwoo saba, Yezu nadi edhaa tɔ pyeeb kɔkɔ mbi bhek bhisa di edjóoaa ble ɛ. Tin, wɔ gwaa za zɛbe bɛdjekel bɛ, bɛ moo tin ebɔ́k mɛbhisa mɛ tak étɛp ɛdɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Dáa eFalizyɛ nabee deenek ɛ́, bɛ eezɛke nɛ Yezu náá: «Beea, bɛdjekel bɔ ɛpesa esesɛɛ di náá, yɛ ààpadjɛaa bɛ ze dwoo saba ɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Yezu zokazɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààlaa sa Dhavid nasa, é sok bɛ nɛ bot ɛ nadi egyee bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ nagwak za ɛ? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ nɛ bot ɛ lɔɔg'ɛ naani tɔ pɛt ɛbhɛŋ ɛ Zɛɛb, bɔɔ zokakɛdɛ emapa ee nakaŋaa Zɛɛb yɛ ɛ. Dhi ye di náá, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààgoka nɛ ɛdɛ emapa é tak. Etɛɛ náá, etsi bina lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, bot ɛ di egoka nɛ ɛdɛ emapa é tak ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ bɛghaa-Zɛɛb bɔɔ bɛmet. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Nɛghu bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààlaa tɔ etsi ɛ Moiiz náá, bɛghaa-Zɛɛb di esa mɛsa tɔ Ndjaa-ebuwa dwoo saba ɔ, bɛ ààduwal etsi e saba, bela náá, bɛ tok nɛ ndjɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak. <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Tin, betka mɛ lɛɛ bin náá, wak, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ sonok wat di edhaa Ndjaa-ebuwa nɛ mɛtaŋ! <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Bi ɛpedi egu ɛnyɔɛpe ɛsuk ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb di eke náá: “Mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́ enɛm esa, ààkabɛ ebuwa e bɛtit<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.7 <char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Oze 6.6</ref></char></char></note>” di ekwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɔɔ, pe bi ààpazyɛ zɛpit bot ɛ di ààgu tɛp ɔ gwyes. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Etɛɛ náá, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɛ́ di kukuma dwoo saba.»<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mot na sɔɔbela mbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛdus tin, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Tɔ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti mot ngɔt nadi nɛ sɔɔbela mbɔ ɔ. Ɛkwosak ɛ eFalizyɛ nabɛ ɛ́, Yezu bela ndjɛ é mis mɔɔ. Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ bɛ nadji nyɛ náá: «Etsi bina ɛpemyaal náá, mot tsikaa dwoo saba?» <verse eid="MAT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yɛ bɛ náá, mot ngɔt pak'en ɛ nɛ sim bhata ngɔt, nyɛ gwak náá, dwoo saba, sim bhata tak eekwyit tɔ guk na dim-dim ɔɔ, nyɛ aanàkwaatɔ́ kɛwyisal nyɛ tɔ guk tak é? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Dáa ye di náá, mot eedhaa bhata nɛ mɛtaŋ ɛ, tin, etsi lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, mena saka bot enɛm esa dwoo saba.» <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ mot nadi nɛ sɔɔbela mbɔ ɔ náá: «Sɛɛba mbɔ'ɔ.» É di tak wat, mbɔ mot'enɔk eezɛbula ɛnyɔɛpe, dáa yak dhiiti mbɔ. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Bhii tak, eFalizyɛ ɛ́ boozɛdus tin, tɔ́ yɔbɔ. Wɔ gwaa bɛ kɛsɛɛga é kwan, étɛp ɛdjek dáa bɛ aadjɛ nyɛ epɛ́ɛ e ɛsyee ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mot-mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb nasɛ́ɛ ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Dáa Yezu nagwak deenek ɛ́, nyɛ eezɛdus tin, wɔ gwaa zukamwaa nɛ mot zokadu nyɛ. Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zokazɛtsik membel djas. <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />Tin, nyɛ eezɛlyak bɛ ɛlyelɛpe náá, bɛ nàsa náá, bot gu mbi mot nyɛ nadi ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Nyɛ nasa deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, etɛp ee ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Ezayi nalɛɛ ɛ, ye neebela ɛsuk. Ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Ezayi nalɛɛ ɛ́ náá:<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />«Zɛɛb lɛɛ ɛ́ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">“Beea mot-mɛsa mam mɛ nasɛ́ɛ ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">mot mɛ di ekwyɛl ɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Lyem'am ɛ́ tɔ mɛmyaala kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Mɛ waawa Sisim'am tɔ lɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Tin, nyɛy ɛ́ aapagoola nɛ bot ɛ membyak djas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">epiki bam mɛ aadhis ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Nyɛ aanàkwaawaya nɛ bot.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:19">Nyɛ aanàkwaabiyo nɛ mot.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:19">Bi aanàkwaagwak gwood'ɛ é gba.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Nyɛ aanàkwaabwak-bwakak mɔɔ le ghwaazok</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">di náá yɛ eezenyaabel ɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">Nyɛ aanàkwaadimal mɔɔ ngel lama di esa náá,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">ye dim ɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">Nyɛ aasa deenek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">kɛkum dwoo epiki bɛ aanyen é mis mɛ bot ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Tin, bot djas di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:21">bɛ waawa ɛbwaalel ɛ lɔɔ kɔ lɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.21 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 42:1-4">Eza 42.1-4</ref></char></char></note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu sɔ embee esisim nɛ ghwyil zɛ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zokazyɛ Yezu nɛ dhiiti mot, mot tak nadi ɛ́ bubu nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɛ edhim. Yɛ ɛ́ embee esisim ɛ nasa mot tak deenek. Tin, Yezu eezɛtsik mot tak, nyɛ moo tin elii nɛ ɛnyaasok. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Mɛdhuu mɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ, naadyeebadjoka. Bɛ moo tin eke náá: «Wɔ ke ɛ́, nwyak tok Mɔn ɛ Dhavid é?» <verse eid="MAT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Dáa eFalizyɛ nagwak bot binɔk elii ɛ, bɛ boozɛke náá: «Mot tak sɔ embee esisim ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, Bɛlzebul kukuma embee esisim ɛ di edjɛ nyɛ kɔkɔ yak mbi mɛbwala mɛ nyɛ di esɔ embee esisim nɛ yɛ ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />É di'enek, Yezu nadi egu egeka e elyem bɔɔ, nyɛ boozɛlɛɛ nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Ɛyoŋ ɛ di náá, mɛsa mɛ bot ɛ tak ɛ mɛwɔ nɛ edho pak'ɔɔ ɔ, ɛsik ɛyoŋ ɛ tak ɛ́ ɛbel nɛ ɛwaazel. Bot tɔ ghaada wat nɛghu bot ɛ mɛbyel mɛ wat ɛ di nɛ mɛwɔ nɛ etuub pak'ɔɔ ɔ, yenek mɛbyel nɛ yenek ghaada aanàkwaapyet ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Yɛ bɛ náá, Satan moo sɔ sa di náá, yɛ ɛ́ yɛ Satan ɔɔ, bi ààbee náá, Satan kaduu tuub ɛ, bɛ nɛ nyel'ɛ met é? Tin, ɛyoŋ ɛ lɛ aakapyet dáa?<verse eid="MAT 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Yɛ bɛ náá, mɛ sɔ embee esisim ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛ Bɛlzebul ɔɔ, ɛzɛ di edjɛ bot bin ghwyil bɛ di esɔ embee esisim nɛ yɛ ɛ? Mɛ bee ɛ́ náá, yɛ ɛ́ bɔɔ bɛnakuma tak ɛ paalyaal bin náá, bi tok nɛ gham. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Sa di tsɛɛtsɛ ɛ́ náá, mɛ sɔ embee esisim ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛ Zɛɛb. Yenek djas kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́ náá, Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb moo ɛ́ wak nɛ nen é di wat.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />Ye tok nɛ mot di nɛ ghwyil ɛni tɔ ndjaa mot mɛnyan, da nyɛ ɛ́ nɔɔ esa e ndjaa mot tak, nyɛ di ààkɔl nyɛ mɛmbɔ nɛ mɛko ɔɔ. Yɛ ɛ́ bhis ɛkɔl nyɛ ɛ, nyɛ aakabela ghwyil ɛnɔɔ esa e ndjaŋ'ɛ djas, da nyɛ ɛ́ wyis, tɔ́ nɛ yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />Mot di ààdi pɛ yam kyee ɔ, ye lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, mot tak ɛ́ mot di ebhina mɛ ɔ. Tin, mot di ààkwyee mɛ é ɛsɛɛg ɛ́ bot ɔ, nyɛ waaz ɛ́ waazak. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ mɛ di elɛɛ bin náá, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛpel mesyem mɛ bot djas, ye nakoozodi ebyas nɛ embee esesɛɛ bɛ nasa Zɛɛb ɛ. Yɛ kabɛ náá, mot eebyasal Sisim na Dɛɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ aanàkwaapelaa. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Mot ɛ lii ɛbiyoɛpe nɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɔɔ, mesyem mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛpelaa. Tin, mot ɛ lii ɛbiyoɛpe nɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ ɔɔ, mesyem mɛ aanàkwaapelaa tɔ tsik mena dika mos'aak nɛghu tsik ɛbhis.»<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Le nɛ ebhum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />«Étɛp wɔ neebela mbɛɛ bhum, ye goka ɛ́, le pookokan ɛdi sok mbɛɛ le. Etɛɛ náá, le ɛ di nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɔɔ, bhum tak aabaazodi ɛ́ mɛbɛ́ nɛ mɛbɛ́, etɛɛ náá, le gwyakaa ɛ́ nɛ bhum di ekwyil é tak ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Mbyak mɛgel! Bi aakwak ɛlii embɛɛ etɛp dáa, bela náá bi ɛ́ bɛmbee ɛ bot? Etɛɛ náá, nuub dyeebawyisal ɛ́ etɛp ee zelwood tɔ lyem ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Mbɛɛ mot nɔɔ etɛtɛ etɛp ee nyɛ di elii ɛ́ tɔ ɛkwom ɛ embɛɛ esesɛɛ bɛ. Tyee wat nɛ mbee mot, nyɛ nɔɔ embee etɛp ee nyɛ di elii ɛ, tɔ ɛkwom ɛ embee esesɛɛ bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />Betka mɛ lɛɛ bin, sa di tsɛɛtsɛ ɛ́ náá, dwoo Zɛɛb aazɛpɛ́ɛ bot ɛ, bot ɛ́ waatyaa sok bhwoob bɛtetɛp étɛp mɛlee mɛ bɛ nadi elee bot ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Etɛɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ kɔ mɛkpa mɔ met ɛ wɔ aabela gham nɛghu ɛkwyɛ ndjɛ sɔs é mis ɛ Zɛɛb.»<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngwyeebel ndem mɛbwala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />É di'enek, bɛdhiiti bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ eFalizyɛ zokazɛdji Yezu náá: «Lyoel! Bis kwyɛl ɛ́ náá, wɔ lyaal bis dhiiti ndem mɛbwala.» <verse eid="MAT 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Étɛp yé di náá, bot ɛ di ewaab mos dhiiti ndem mɛbwala pɛ daa Zɛɛb ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ bɛmbee ɛ bot, bot ɛ di ààbɛ sosoob é mis ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ? Tin, Zɛɛb aazolyaal bɛ ɛ́ ndem wat. Yɛ aadi ɛ́ kɔkɔ mbi ndem ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Zonas nabee ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Yɛ ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ dáa ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Zonas nakpaa emwos elɛl nɛ epum elɛl tɔ mɔ boo su ɛ. Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aabaasa ɛ́ emwos elɛl nɛ epum elɛl tɔ bɔs. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Dwoo Zɛɛb aazɛpɛ́ɛ bot ɛ, bot ɛ ghaada Niniv ɛ́ waazyɛ, zɛtyaa sok bhwoob bot ɛ kɔkɔ mɛbyel mɛ di kɔ bɔs mos'aak étɛp ɛpit bɛ. Deenek, nyɛ waazɛkwyesal bɛ ndjɛ sɔs. Etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ ghaada Niniv naaliig elyem bɔɔ, bhii bɛ nazegwak mɛlyo ɛ Zonas ɛ. Ghuna yii di wak ɛ yɛ eedhaa-dhaŋak yɛ Zonas. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Dwoo Zɛɛb aazɛpɛ́ɛ bot ɛ, mɛkoozi mɛ moma mɛl mɛ di pɛ kyɛ bɔs ɛ́ waazyɛ, zɛtyaa sok bhwoob bot ɛ kɔkɔ mɛbyel mɛ di kɔ bɔs mos'aak étɛp ɛpit bɛ, deenek, nyɛ neekwyesal bɛ ndjɛ sɔs. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nadus ɛ́ pɛ edum e bɔs, étɛp ɛzɛgwak mbɛɛ mɛlyo mɛ etsoŋ e mɛkoozi Salomɔŋ. Ye nyɔ ɛ́, bi gu náá, mot di nenak wak'aak, nyɛ eedhaa Salomɔŋ!»<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛbula ɛ embee esisim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />«É sok mbee sisim di ewyis tɔ nyel mot ɛ, nyɛ katɔ́ ɛ́ pɛ kyee dik bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ, kɛsaa di nyɛ aakɛdi ɛ. É di nyɛ aakadi ààbela di nyɛ aadi ɔ, <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />nyɛ kake ɛ́ náá: “Mɛ pookosik pɛ ndjaŋ'am, ndjaa mɛ nawyis tɔ tak sok ɛ.” Tin, sika nyɛ aakasik ɛ, nyɛ aabela ndjaa tak ɛ́ toto, bɛ eezewaabal nɛ ɛkoobal yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Tin, nyɛ katɔ́ ɛ́ kɛnɔɔ edhiiti embee esisim bɛ na nyan-nyan bɛtɛn nɛ bɛbá di edhaa nyɛ nɛ embee mɛsa ɔ. Tin, bɔɔ djas kabula ɛ́ tɔ ndjaa tak, da be di tin. Deenek, tsik yenɔk mot eezɛpulel dhaa-dhaŋak yii nabɛ sok ɛ. Yɛ aadi ɛ́ deenek étɛp bɛmbee ɛ bot di mos'aak.»<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɔn-nyɛɛg ɛ Yezu bɛ nɛ nyɛɛg</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Yezu dinaa kuku ɛlii nɛ mɛdhuu mɛ bot, wɔ gwaa bɔn-nyɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg zɛkum é di nyɛ nadi ɔ. Bɛ eezɛtyaa pɛ kel. Tin, bɛ nadi ekwyɛl ɛlii nɛ nɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Dhiiti mot ɛ́ boozɛlɛɛ Yezu náá: «Beea, nyoog nɛ bɔn-nyoog ɛ́ pɛ kel, bɛ ɛpekwyɛl ɛlii nɛ nɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ mot'enɔk náá: «Nyaagam ɛ́ zɛ, bɔn-nyaagam kadi bɛzɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛlyo bɛdjekel bɛ nɛ djin. Nyɛy náá: «Beeka nyaagam, nɛ bɔn-nyaagam di wak é! <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Etɛɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ mot di esa ɛkwosak ɛ Saagam di tɔ gwoo ɔ, di mɔn-nyaagam, kɛl'am nɛ nyaagam.»<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s1">Kana sɔsel mɛbhek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Dwoo tak wat, Yezu nadus ɛ́ pɛ ndjaa nyɛ nadi ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛtɔ́, kɛdisi pɛ ɛboŋ ɛ boo soob na djato-djato. Tin, nyɛ moo zɛlyo bot. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Wɔ gwaa, zukamwaa nɛ mot zokazɛmaala é di tak. Dáa nyɛ nabee náá, zukamwaa nɛ mot naazɛsɛɛga tin ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛni tɔ dhiiti elɛɛd, nɔɔ nyel, disi. Nyɛ eezɛpus elɛɛd tɔ dii, ɛdhuu ɛ bot eezɛlik pɛ kyiid é ngwoob dii. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Mɛlyo mɛ nyɛ nalelyo bɛ ɛ nadyeebabu ɛ́ tɔ ekana. Tɔ ekana ee nyɛ nadi elyo bɛ nɛ yɛ ɛ, wat nabɛ ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ sɔsel mɛbhek. Tin, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Dhiiti dwoo mot ngɔt naatɔ́ pɛ pyeeb kɛsɔs bhek.<figure style="fig" alt="Parabole du semeur" file="lb00094c.tif" size="col" loc="13.3" copy="Louise Bass" ref="13.3">Sɔsel mɛbhek</figure> <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Dáa nyɛ nakadi emwam bhek tak ɛ, kyee wat nakwyit ɛ́ é gba. Wɔ gwaa enen zokazɛdɛ yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Yak kyee kakwyit ɛ́ kɔ bat ɛkok. Tin, ààkobɔya deenek, mɛbhek eezɛkwyil, etɛɛ náá, di tak nadi ɛ́ nɛ ba bɔs. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />É di gwyes na ghɛ-ghɛ nakakas ɛ, wɔ gwaa mɛbhek djas zɛsyee, etɛɛ náá, ekaŋal e tak nabɛ ɛ́ ààni tɔ bɔs ɛdimɛpe. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Yak pak mɛbhek nakakwyit ɛ́ tɔ engwyinini. Wɔ gwaa, engwyinini binek zokawyee, kala kɔ mɛbhek ààbɛ nɛ dáa mɛbhek wyee ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Tin, mɛbhek mɛ nakakwyit kɔ mbɛɛ bɔs ɛ, naakwyil ɛnyɔɛpe, wɔ gwaa, ye kwyil bhum. É kwos wat, bhum mɛkam-mɛlɛl (30), é yak, mɛkam-mɛtɛn nɛ wat (60), é yak tak, bhum dhet (100).» <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛke náá: «Yɛ bɛ náá, bi ɛ́ nɛ mɛlɔ mɛ ɛgwak ɔɔ, gwakeka ɛnyɔɛpe!»<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Étɛp yé Yezu di elii nɛ bot tɔ ekana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Tin, bɛdjekel eezɛtiila pɛ pak Yezu nadi ɛ́, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛdji nyɛ náá: «Étɛp yé wɔ di elii nɛ nɔɔ tɔ ekana?» <verse eid="MAT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Wɔ gwaa nyɛ zɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Biyɔ, bi eezedjɛaa etsoŋ ɛgu ɛsuk ɛ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ. Yɛ bɛ bɛsɔ bin ɔɔ, bɛ dinaa ààpamɛt ɛsuk ɛ tak. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Etɛɛ náá, mot aadi nɛ ba bim sonok ɔ, bɛ waabil nyɛ dhiiti, étɛp ye neebu. Tin, mot aakadi toto ààbɛ nɛ sonok ɔ, bɛ waadɛk nyɛ dɔɔ nɛ eghutu-ghutu nyɛ lik nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ mɛ di elii nɛ nɔɔ tɔ ekana. Etɛɛ náá, bɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛgwyák nɛ mis, ààbee. Bɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛgwak nɛ mɛlɔ, dhi bɛ di ààsiiza sa ye di ekwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ etɛp ee ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Ezayi nalɛɛ ɛ́ aabela ɛsuk. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ eeke náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">“Bi ɛ́ waagwak ɛnyɔɛpe, bi ɛ́ aanàkwaagu ɛsuk ɛ tɛp tak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">Bi ɛ́ waabee nɛ mis, bi aanàkwaasiiza ɛsuk ɛ tak.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ mbyak'ak nɛ kalyel elyem dhaa nyel.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">Bɛ nɛ kasa maa-ɛlɔ dhaa tyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">Bɛ eezedipal mis mɔɔ étɛp bɛ ɛ́ zɛkɛbee.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">Bɛ eediyal mɛlɔ mɔɔ, ye nàgwak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">Bɛ eezelu ɛtselal ɛ lɔɔ náá, ye nàgu sonok.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">Tin, bɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛbula,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">dum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb neetsik bɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.15 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Eza 6.9-10</ref></char></char></note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />«Yɛ kabɛ biyɔ bɛmet ɔɔ, mɛnyɔ nɛ nen, etɛɛ náá, mis men ɛpebee, mɛlɔ men ɛpegwak! <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá: Bɛtɛ nɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, bot ɛ epiki naadyeebakwos ɛbee nɛ ɛgwak sa bi di ebee nɛ gwak mos'aak. Saabɛgɔs nɛ nɔɔ ɛ́ náá, bɛ ààpabela mbɛɛ bhwoob ɛbee nɛ gwak sa bi di ebee mos'aak.»<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu moo elɛɛ ɛsuk ɛ kana sɔsel mɛbhek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />«Biyɔ, bot bak! Gwakeka ɛsuk ɛ kana sɔsel mɛbhek: <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Bɔs é ngwoob gba di bhek nakwyit ɔ, ye kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ́, bot ɛ nadi egwak etɛp Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb, bɛ kadi ɛ́, ààmɛt ɛsuk ɛ tak ɔ. Tin, Mbee Mot eetuula, nyɛ eezɛdɛk mɛbhek bɛaa tɔ elyem bɔɔ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Bɛdhiiti bot kadi ɛ́ dáa mɛbhek nakwyit kɔ bat ɛkok ɛ, é sok bɛ di egwak-gwakak Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, bɛ nɛ dyeebamyaala tɔ elyem bɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Tin, bɛ ààpakabet náá, mɛkpa mɛ tak pookoni bɛ tɔ ebhum elyem ɛnyɔɛpe. Bɛ kadi ɛ́, ààwa zii ɛbuɛpe tɔ ɛbaal ɛ mɛkpa mɛ tak. Tin, é ghɛŋ mezuk nɛ mɛbhowal aatuula bɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, ɛliig ɛ lɔɔ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ààbɔya. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Bɛdhiiti tɔ len gwak Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ dáa kyee mɛbhek nakwyit tɔ engwyinini ɛ. Bɛ nɛ gwak Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, ye kabela ɛ́ náá, bɛ nɛ wa lyem tɔ ɛsiiza esa e bɔs, mɛvu mɛ di ekɔɔ bot kɔ bɔs'ak ɛ, nɛ mbee esiiza tɔ elyem bɔɔ ɛ di enyal Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. Tin, mɛbhek mɛ tak kadi ɛ́, ààwum. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Bɛdhiiti bot kadi ɛ́ dáa mɛbhek mɛ nakwyit kɔ mbɛɛ bɔs ɛ. Bɛ ɛpegwak Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, myaal yɛ nɛ lyem wat, bɛ kakɛ ɛ́ dáa Zɛɛb kwyɛl ɛ. Tin, yɛ waawum ɛbuɛpe. Yak mɛkam-mɛlɛl (30), yak mɛkam-mɛtɛn nɛ wat (60), yak dhet (100).»<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kana mbee bhek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Yezu zokabaalɛɛ bɛdhiiti ekana sis: «Beeka dhiiti sonok di tyee Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ: Dhiiti mot ngɔt naabɛ embɛɛ mɛbhek tɔ pyeeb'ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />É pum, é sok bot ɛ dɛl djas nadi egɔ́ ɛ, wɔ gwaa dhiiti mot mɛbhuka mɛ zokazɛnɔɔ embee mɛbhek, bɛ yɛ pak mɛbhek mɛ nadi tɔ pyeeb ɛ, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ nyel sik. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Dáa mɛbhek nakawyee ɛ, yɛ eezɛwum, embee mɛbhek menek eebaazɛwyee yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Tin, bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ nakuma pyeeb tak ɛ́ bookɛlɛɛ nɛ kukuma yɔbɔ náá: “Ghɛŋ, wɔ nabɛ tɔ pyeeb'ɔ ɛ́ embɛɛ mɛbhek, etsal é? Haaa yak mbee bhek kadus paa?” <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: “Yɛ ɛ́ mot mɛbhuka ɛ sa esesɛɛ binek.” Bhii tak, bot ɛ mɛsa ɛ́ boozɛdji nyɛ náá: “Bis sa dáa, wɔ kwyɛl ɛ bis kɛdis embee mɛbhek menek é?” <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Nyɛ eebaazɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: “Hooo! Ààbɛ! Etɛɛ náá, bi ɛ kɛgu yɛ ɔɔ, bi ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛgu dɔɔ nɛ embɛɛ mɛbhek lɔɔg wat nɛ yiizaag. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Deenek, betka náá, mɛbhek menek djas wyee lɔɔg wat, kɛkum dwoo yɛ aakabɛ náá, bi moo kɛdis ɛ. Tin, mɛ waalɛɛ nɛ bot aakɛdis ɔ náá, bɛ pookokan sok ɛdis ɛ embee mɛbhek, da bɛ ɛ́ kɔl yɛ é di wat étɛp bɛ needik yɛ. Bhii tak ɛ bɛ aakasɛɛg embɛɛ mɛbhek, kwom kɔ taŋ'am.”»<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kana ba mɔɔ bhek na sikɛ-sikɛ bɛ di edjóo «mutaad» ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Wɔ gwaa, Yezu baazɛlɛɛ bɛ yak kana sis, nyɛy náá: «Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ dáa bhek le di edjɛ bhum di edjóoaa mutaad ɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bhek le di edjɛ bhum di edjóoaa mutaad ɛ </char><char style="ft" closed="false">le mutaad ɛ́ boo le di kwyil tɔ bɔk ɛ.</char></note>. Dhiiti mot naakɛbɛ yɛ pɛ tɔ pyeeb'ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Bhum mutaad ɛ́ bhek na sikɛ-sikɛ dhaa mɛbhek djas di ebɛaa kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɛ nɛ mɛtɔɔl. Tin, é ghɛŋ yɛ di ekwyil ɛ, ye nɛ bɔk dhaa ele e bok djas. Ye kadi ɛ́, ye moo le di náá, enen ɛpebatazɛlóo mɛk mɔɔ kɔ elɛɛ e tak.»<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kana leviid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Yezu zokabaazɛdjɛ bɛ dhiiti kana. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ, nɔŋel ɛ́ nɛ leviid moma di ewa tɔ boo ɛdham ɛ tsim nyɛ di epul étɛp nyɛ neesa mapa nɛ yɛ ɛ. Ba ɛwala bhii tak, tsim'enek djas aadi ɛ́, yɛ eezeghamta.»<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Etɛp ee Yezu nadi elelyo bot tɔ ekana ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Yezu nadyeebalelyo mɛdhuu mɛ bot etɛp binek djas ɛ́ pɛ tɔ ekana. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààdjɛ dhiiti mɛlyo, ààlɛɛ yɛ tɔ kana. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Nyɛ nasesa deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, sa bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nalɛɛ ɛ́ neebela ɛsuk. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb naake náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">«Mɛ waalii tɔ ekana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">Tin, mɛ waalɛɛ esa ee nadi syela kana bɔs nakusel ɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.35 <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 78:2">Mɛd 78.2</ref></char></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛlɛɛ ɛsuk ɛ kana mbee bhek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Bhii tak, Yezu zokazɛdus tɔ ɛdhuu ɛ bot, nyɛ eezɛsik, tɔ́ pɛ ndjaa. Tin, bɛdjekel ɛ́ boozɛzyɛ pɛ nyɛ nadi ɛ. Bhii tak, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Lɛɛa bis ɛsuk ɛ kana mbee bhek tɔ pyeeb.» <verse eid="MAT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />É di'enek, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛni elɛɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɛ di ebɛ embɛɛ mɛbhek. <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Pyeeb kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ́ mɛdhik djas di kɔ bɔs ɛ. Embɛɛ mɛbhek kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ́ bot ɛ di ekɛ dáa Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb di kwyɛl ɛ. Mbee bhek kalyaal ɛ́ bot ɛ Mbee Mot. <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />Mot mɛbhuka nazɛbɛ bhek ɔ, kadi ɛ́ dim mot mɛkɔŋ. Dwoo ɛkɛbɔ́k bhum kabɛ ɛ́ ɛsi ɛ bɔs<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.39 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ɛsi ɛ bɔs </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yɛ ɛ́ ɛwala ɛ di náá, bɔs ɛ́ waadum ɛ, esesɛɛ di mos'aak ɛ́ waasi. </char></note>. Bot ɛ mɛsa kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ́ efofop. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Dáa ye di náá, embee mɛbhek ɛ́ waatsaalaa étɛp ɛkɛmwasaa tɔ du ɛ, yɛ aabaazodi ɛ́ deenek é ɛsi ɛ bɔs. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɛ́ waalwom efofop bɛ, nyɛ waadis tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ lɛ bot djas di ezɛm ɛmyaal ɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg bɔɔ ɔ, zɛnɔɔ bot ɛ embee mɛsa. <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />Nyɛ waamwas bɛ tɔ boo du na kɔm-kɔm. Penek, bot ɛbuɛpe ɛ́ waadje mɛgwyɛ nɛ ɛkwaal ɛ mɛtsok. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Tin, bot ɛ epiki ɛ́ waakas tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Sɛɛg'ɔɔ dáa gwyes. Yɛ bɛ náá, bi ɛ́ nɛ mɛlɔ mɛ ɛgwak ɔɔ, gwakeka ɛnyɔɛpe.»<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛkwom ɛ epata di syela ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />«Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ́ dáa di ɛkwom ɛ epata di syela tɔ pyeeb ɛ. Dáa dhiiti mot nakabela yɛ ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boobaazɛsyel yɛ é di sis tɔ pyeeb'enek. É di'enek, nyɛ moo ɛ́ tɔ mɛmyaala, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ waakɛbɔmsa esa bɛ djas, étɛp nyɛ neezɛbɔm pyeeb tak.<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɔ, baanɔŋel ɛ́ nɛ mot di esaa esa e ghoŋ étɛp nyɛ neebɔmsa ɔ. Nyɛ dyeebasaŋ ɛ́ tɛtɛ esa e ghoŋ na nyenyɔ-nyɔ. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Yɛ kabɛ náá, nyɛ eebela yii na nyenyɔ-nyɔ dhaa bɛsɔ djas nɛ boo mɛtaŋ ɔɔ, nyɛ kakɛbɔmsa ɛ́ esa bɛ djas, étɛp nyɛ neezɛbɔm yiizaag na boo mɛtaŋ.»<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kana ɛwyet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />«Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ, baanɔŋel ɛ́ nɛ ɛwyet ɛ bɛ di ela tɔ dii ɛ. Ɛwyet ɛ tak dyeebamɛt ɛ́ ekɔkɔ bɛsu djas. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Tin, yɛ bɛ náá, ɛwyet eezelwood ɔɔ, bɛlael ɛ mɛwyet kadul yɛ ɛ́, zyɛ nɛ yɛ pɛ kyiid, da bɛ ɛ́ nɔɔ mɛnyel disi, étɛp ɛdis ɛ́ ebel bɛsu é ɛwyet ɛ tak. Tin, bɛ kabɛk bɛ edi ɛ́ bɛka, da bɛ ɛ́ nɔɔ bɛtɛtɛ, wa tɔ mɛbɔɔl, yɛ kabɛ bɛ na sikɛ-sikɛ nɛ embee tak ɔɔ, bɛ kamwas bɛ ɛ́ mwasa. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Ɛsi ɛ bɔs aadi ɛ́ deenek: Zɛɛb ɛ́ waadhis efofop bɛ, bɛ zɛwa mbɛk pak mbee bot nɛ bot ɛ epiki. <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />Etɛɛ náá, mbee bot ɛ́ waakɛmwasaa tɔ boo du na kɔm-kɔm. Tin, bot ɛbuɛpe waadje mɛgwyɛ nɛ ɛkwaal ɛ mɛtsok.»<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛvu mɛ na bes nɛ yii na mwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Yezu zokazɛdji bɛ náá: «Bi eemɛt ɛsuk ɛ etɛp binek é?» Bɔɔ náá: «Iyooo». <verse eid="MAT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Étɛp tak ɛ di náá: ghaa-mɛkana mɛ etsi djas di ekwos ɛdi djekel étɛp Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ dáa kuma mot di enɔɔ ɛkwom ɛ lɛ pɛ tɔ mɛvu mɛ na mwa zɛnɔɔ yii na bes ɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bot ɛ Nazalɛt ààmyaal Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Bhii Yezu nasilal ɛlyo bot tɔ ekana binek ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛnɔɔ nyel, tɔ́ yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />Nyɛ natɔ́ ɛ́ pɛ dɛl ɛ nyɛ nawyee kɔ tak ɛ. Nyɛ moo tin elyo bot tɔ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda. Tin, bot ɛ nadi egwak nyɛ ɔ, naadyeebadjoka ɛbuɛpe, bɛ moo tin eke náá: «Nyɛ kɛbela yak kwaambi etsoŋ nɛ mbi yak endem e mɛbwala paa? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Mɔn'ak tok wak mɔn salpande? Ye tok Maali di wak nyɛɛg é? Zak bɛ nɛ Zozɛf, nɛ Simɔŋ, zɛnɔɔ Zuud tok bɛdhyeeb é? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Haaa ye tok bɛkɛl mena nɛ bɛnɔɔ di mɛlu djas é di wat'aak é? Haaa nyɛ kɛbela yenek mɛbwala paa?» <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Nyɛ nabɛ nɛ nɔɔ ɛ́ ɛbɛk. É di'enek, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb dyeebaduwalaa ɛ́ pɛ kyee sis, ààbɛ pɛ kɔ dɛl ɛ nyɛ nabyel kɔ tak ɛ, nɛghu tɔ ndjaŋ'ɛ nɛ tɔ bil'ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Yezu nabɛ ɛ́ ààsa bɛtɛ nɛ endem e mɛbwala tin, étɛp mɛlyel mɛ elyem bɔɔ.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ɛsyee ɛ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />É ghɛŋ tak, Eelood mot nadi mɛkoozi kɔ Yeluzalɛm ɔ, zokagwak menduk ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot ɛ baagom-gomak é! Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ nyɛ di nɛ ghwyil ɛsa bɛtɛ nɛ yenek endem e mɛbwala.»<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ mɛkoozi Eelood naalwom náá, bɛ mɛt Zaŋ, da bɛ ɛ́ kɔl nyɛ nɛ eghwooz. Bhii tak, bɛ naakɛwa nyɛ é membok. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ étɛp Eeloodhiaad, mwaa tel Filip, <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />etɛɛ náá, Zaŋ naake nɛ Eelood náá: «Dum nɛ etsi ɛ Moiiz<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">etsi ɛ Moiiz </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mot nabɛ ɛ́ ààgoka nɛ ɛba mwaa mɔn nyɛɛg, mɔn nyɛɛg dinaa ààgwyɛ.</char></note>, yɛ ààgoka náá, wɔ dɛk Eeloodhiaad mwaa tel'ɔ!» <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Étɛp tak ɛ Eelood nakadi esaa dáa nyɛ aasa étɛp nyɛ neegó Zaŋ. Nyɛ nadi ekaab ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda, etɛɛ náá, bɔɔ djas nakeke ɛ́ náá, Zaŋ Nduuel-bot nabɛ ɛ́ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Tinaak, é dwoo ɛbyoŋ ɛ Eelood di eduwal ɛbyel ɛlɛɛ ɛ, ɛsyes ɛ Eeloodhiaad naabɔl é mis mɛ bɛdjoŋ ɛ nadjóoaa é ɛbyoŋ ɔ. Eelood naadyeebamyaala nɛ ko zɛŋ ɛsyes ɛ tak. <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />Tin, mɛkoozi Eelood ɛ́ booke nɛ ɛsyes ɛ mɔɔ moma yenɔk náá: «Myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ mam! Waaba esa ee lyem'ɔ kwyɛl ɛ djas, mɛ waadjɛ wɔ!» <verse eid="MAT 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Ɛsyes ɛlenɔk zokazɛwaab sa nyɛɛg nalɛɛ nyɛ ɛ. Nyɛy náá: «Mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́, wɔ djɛ mɛ nenak yak lo ɛ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot kɛla kɔ pɛt kongo na pyaaz!» <verse eid="MAT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Wɔ gwaa, ye sa Mɛkoozi Eelood nyel wɔyɔŋ nɛ ghoŋ. Tin, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkabɛ nɛ tyee nyɛ pɛɛ, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ naazetuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ mɛ é mis mɛ bɛdjoŋ. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛlɛɛ nɛ bot bɛ náá, bɛ djɛ nyɛ sa nyɛ waab ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Tin, nyɛ eezɛlwom dhiiti mot étɛp nyɛ neekɛtsaal lo ɛ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot pɛ nyɛ nadi tɔ membok ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zokazyɛ nɛ lo ɛ Zaŋ kɔ pɛt kongo na pyaaz, bɛ eezɛdjɛ ɛsyes ɛ mɔɔ moma yenɔk. Tin, ɛsyes ɛ tak ɛ́ boonɔɔ yɛ, kɛdjɛ nɛ nyɛɛg. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Tin, bɛdjekel ɛ Zaŋ ɛ́ boozɛnɔɔ muu'ɛ, kɛdel. Bhii tak, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛtɔ́ kɛbaŋa Yezu etɛp djas nadhaŋ ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eedjɛ bot bɛmil ɛtɛn edee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Dáa Yezu nagwak etɛp binek djas ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boodus tin, nyɛ eezɛni tɔ elɛɛd, tɔ́, kɛsaa di ɛwala pɛ bot aadi ààbee nyɛ ɛ. Ghuna ɛdhuu ɛ bot naagu ze nyɛ natɔ́ ɛ, wɔ gwaa, zukamwaa nɛ mot nadus pɛ mɛl mɛ nadi é mengwoob tin ɔ, zokazɛdu nyɛ nɛ mɛko mbaka-mbaka nɛ dii. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Dáa Yezu nasul tɔ elɛɛd ɛ, nyɛ kabee ɛ́ ɛdhuu ɛ bot binɔk, ye nabɛ ɛ́, ghoŋ naasa nyɛ ɛlyelɛpe. Nyɛ moo tin etsik membel mɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Dáa bɛ nabee náá, dwoo moo ɛ́ bikoko ɛ, bɛdjekel ɛ́ boozɛtiila pɛ daa lɛ. Bɔɔ nɛ nɛ náá: «Dwoo eezeleega, tɔ kakoŋ'ak, ye tok nɛ bɔɔ mɛl. Swaala bot bak étɛp bɛ neekɛsaa edee pɛ bɔɔ mɛl mɛ di é mengwoob'aak.» <verse eid="MAT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yɛ ààgoka náá, bɛ swaalaaa, djɛka bɛ edee biyɔ bɛmet!» <verse eid="MAT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Tin, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ Yezu náá: «Zuka nɛ sa bis di nɛ yɛ wak ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ etsim e emapa etɛn nɛ bɛsu ɛbá.»<verse eid="MAT 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Dhaka nɛ yɛ wak.» <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />É di'enek, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ mɛdhuu mɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ náá, bɛ disi mendiindil kɔ bɔɔ eka e na bes. Bhii tak, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛnɔɔ emapa etɛn nɛ bɛsu ɛbá binek, nyɛ eezɛben mis pɛ ɛko, ghaapɛɛ Zɛɛb. Nyɛ eezɛpyak emapa, nɔɔ, djɛ bɛdjekel bɛ. Bɛdjekel ɛ́ boozɛnɔɔ yɛ, kaa, djɛ ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Mot nɛ mot naadɛ, djil. Wɔ gwaa, bɛdjekel baabula nɛ mɛbhubhwak mɛ ebil e emapa nɛ bɛsu ɛ nalik ɛ, ye naalwoodal mɛbhwaa kam nɛ ebá. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Bot ɛ nadɛ emapa nɛ bɛsu binek ɔ, nabɛ ɛ́ tyee botom bɛmil ɛtɛn (5 000), ààkalaa mɛtaŋ mɛ boa nɛ bɔɔ dhyeeb.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛkɛ kɔ dii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Batsa bhii tak, Yezu eezɛlwom bɛdjekel bɛ náá, bɛ ni tɔ elɛɛd, tsaal, tɔ́ pɛ yii kyiid boo soob na djato-djato. Tin, nyɛ eezɛlik étɛp ɛswaal ɛ́ zukamwaa nɛ bot binɔk pɛ mendjaa mɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Bhii nyɛ nazeswaal bɛ ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boo zɛbyet kɔ ɛtsok étɛp ɛkɛdjaala Zɛɛb. Dáa dwoo nabɛ náá, yɛ eezesila ɛ, nyɛ nakalik tin ɛ́ nyɛ ɛmet. <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />Elɛɛd nabɛ ɛ́ ye moo ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ ɛboŋ. Wɔ gwaa, boo ghuu zɛpupal kɔ dii, tin, bhuuge moo tin enyuŋa é elɛɛd, etɛɛ náá, pup nadi ebulal bɛ elɛɛd pɛ bhis. <verse eid="MAT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Ɛwala ɛ mɛsik é pum, wɔ gwaa Yezu zɛsul kɔ dii, nyɛ moo tin edu bɛdjekel bɛ. Nyɛ nadi ekɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɛko mɛ kɔ dii. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Dáa bɛdjekel bɛ nabee nyɛ ekɛ kɔ dii ɛ, bwoo naasa bɛ ɛlyelɛpe. Bɔɔ náá: «Nwyak ɛ́ dim!» Bɛ moo nɛ bɛbebwol etsim. <verse eid="MAT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Batsa deenek, Yezu eezɛdjóo bɛ. Nyɛy náá: «Nàbemka ba, saka mɛghaaz, yɛ ɛ́ mam.»<verse eid="MAT 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Dáa Pyɛɛd nabee deenek ɛ́, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ Yezu náá: «Ghɛŋ, yɛ bɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ wɔy ɔɔ, kea náá, mɛ kɛ kɔ dii, zyɛ pɛ wɔ di'enek.» <verse eid="MAT 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Dha!» Tin, Pyɛɛd ɛ́ boozɛwyis tɔ elɛɛd, sul kɔ dii. É di'enek, Pyɛɛd moo ekɛ kɔ dii nɛ mɛko mɛ, etɔ́ pɛ kyee Yezu nadi ɛ́. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Tinaak, dáa nyɛ nabee náá, ghuu naalyel pyep ɛ, wɔ gwaa bwoo zɛsa nyɛ. É di tak wat, nyɛ moo diida tɔ dii, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛtsim ɛlyelɛpe náá: «Ghɛŋ, tsika mɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />É di tak wat, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛsɛɛb mbɔ, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zokamɛt Pyɛɛd, nyɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ nɛ náá: «Étɛp yé wɔ be mɛso? Ɛmyaal ɛ lɔ ààdyeebabɔk.» <verse eid="MAT 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Bhii tak, bɔɔ djas bɛbá eezɛgo tɔ boo elɛɛd. Tin, ghuu yenek eezɛsila. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />É di'enek, bɛdjekel ɛ nadi tɔ elɛɛd ɔ, zokazyɛ, zɛkwyit mɛboŋ si mɛko ɛ Yezu. Bɔɔ nɛ nɛ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, wɔ ɛ́ Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb!»<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsik membel pɛ kyee dik Ghenezalɛt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Bhii bɛ nasɛɛ dii ɛ, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛtɔ́ pɛ kyee dik Ghenezaalɛt. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Dáa bɛ nakum é di'enek ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bot ɛ dɛl ɛ tak zokazɛgwyak Yezu. Tin, lɛŋ ɛ ɛkum ɛ Yezu zokadjala mɛl djas, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zokazyɛ nɛ membel djas bɛ nadi nɛ nɔɔ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Bot ɛ tak ɛ́ boozɛdjaala nɛ Yezu náá, nyɛ bet membel djas, bɔɔ bɛmet zokee-keeak ɛlɔ ɛ ndjookuwa yɛ. Tin, bot djas namɛt nyɛ ɔ nabɛ ɛ́ bɛ naatsak.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s1">Etsi ee bɛbhaab nalik ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Dhiiti dwoo eFalizyɛ nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi naadus pɛ Yeluzalɛm zɛboma nɛ Yezu, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛdji nyɛ náá: <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />«Étɛp yé bɛdjekel bɔ di ààduwal etsi e bɛbhaab bina nalik ɛ? Etɛɛ náá, bɔɔ, bɛ ààgwyii mɛmbɔ, é ghɛŋ bɛ di edɛ edee ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Étɛp yé bi di ààkɛ dáa etsi e Zɛɛb di lɛɛ ɛ? Bi kwyɛl ɛkɛ ɛ́ dáa etsi e mbyak'en di elɛɛ ɛ! <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb ke ɛ́ náá: “Dila soog nɛ nyoog, mot ɛ di ekal sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg ɔɔ, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛsyee.” <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Yɛ kabɛ biyɔ ɔɔ, bi lyo bot ɛ́ náá, mot ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛlɛɛ nɛ sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg náá: “Esa ee mɛ waakwyee bin nɛ yɛ ɛ, mɛ eenɔɔ kɛdjɛ étɛp ɛtuud ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ yɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />Mot ɛ ke deenek ɔɔ, nyɛ tok nɛ gwyes ɛkwyee sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg. É di'enek, bot ɛbuɛpe ɛpesa náá, Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb zɛhoola, étɛp ɛsaŋ ɛ́ ɛduwal etsi bin biyɔ bɛmet. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Bot ɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si! Ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Ezayi nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ gham nɛ nyɛ nɛ ke náá:<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />“Bot ɛ mbyak'ak duwal mɛ ɛ́ duwela mɛkɔŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 15:8">elyem bɔɔ ɛ́ pɛ kyee sis.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Zɛɛga mendjaala mɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 15:9">yɛ ɛ́ yii toto é mis mam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 15:9">etɛɛ náá, mɛlyo mɛ bɛ di elyo ɛ́,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 15:9">yɛ ɛ́ mɛlyo mɛ epuud<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.9 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">Eza 29.13</ref></char></char></note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo dum nɛ esa ee di epul mot ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Wɔ gwaa, Yezu zokazɛdjóo ɛdhuu ɛ bot, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ bɔɔ djas náá: «Biyɔ djas, gwakeka mɛ, da bi ɛ́ mɛt sa mɛ di elii'aak: <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Ye tok sa mot di ewa tɔ nuub'ɛ di esa náá mot di nɛ edhuud é mis ɛ Zɛɛb. Yɛ ɛ́ sa wyis tɔ nuub ɛ di esa náá mot tak di nɛ edhuud é mis ɛ Zɛɛb.» <verse eid="MAT 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Tin, bɛdjekel ɛ́ boozyɛ, zɛlɛɛ Yezu náá: «Wɔ nɛ gu náá, etɛp ee wɔ lii'enek eedyeebakpaa eFalizyɛ tɔ lyem é?» <verse eid="MAT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛbhek djas di náá, ye tok Saagam di tɔ gwoo ɛ nabɛ ɛ́, yɛ aadi ɛ́ guaa.» <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke náá: «Betka bɛ, yɛ ɛ́ mot edhim ɛ di edul bɛsɔ bɔɔ bɛ na edhim. Tin, ye nyɔ ɛ́ bi gu náá: Yɛ bɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ mot edhim ɛ di edul sɔ mot edhim ze ɔɔ, ɛsik ɛ tak ɛ náá, bɔɔ djas bɛbá ɛ́ waadjoola tɔ guk.» <verse eid="MAT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Tin, Pyɛɛd ɛ́ boozɛke náá: «Lɛɛa bis sa ekana binek di ekwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza náá: «Dɔɔ nɛ biyɔ pe, bi tok nɛ etsoŋ ɛtiibal é? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Bi ààgu náá, esa djas mot di ewa tɔ nuub ɛ, dhaŋ ɛ́ tɔ mɔ yɛ. Bhii tak, ye kakɛwyis ɛ́ tɔ́ ɛbyeed é? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Sa di ewyis tɔ nuub mot ɛ, ye dus ɛ́ tɔ lyem, yɛ ɛ́ sa di edjɛ edhuud. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Etɛɛ náá, embee egeka dus ɛ́ tɔ lyem mot. Yɛ ɛ́ esiiza ɛ di elwom bot náá, bɛ gó bot, bɛ sa mɛzɔ, bɛ sa mɛpam, bɛ djii, nɛ ɛsu bɔn-nyɛɛg bɔɔ etɛp nɛ mɛbhekel. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Yenek ɛ́ esesɛɛ ee di epul ɛgwakel pak bot nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. Yɛ kabɛ tɛp ɛdɛ edee ààgwyii mɛmbɔ ɔɔ, yɛ aanàsa náá mot di nɛ edhuud é mis ɛ Zɛɛb.»<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndjoŋ moma eedum koŋ nɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Yezu zokadus tin, tɔ́ pɛ kyee mɛdhik mɛ eghaada Tiid nɛ Sidɔn. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Dhiiti moma dɛl ɛ Kanan nadidi kɔ kyee dik tak ɔ, zokazyɛ pɛ daa lɛ, nyɛ moo tin etsim náá: «Ghɛŋ, Mɔn ɛ Dhavid, geka mɛ ghoŋ, dhiiti kwaambi mbee sisim ɛpedhek mɔɔ ɛsyes ɛ lam, nyɛ tok ɛnyɔɛpe!» <verse eid="MAT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Tin, Yezu gwyem ààbis moma tak. Wɔ gwaa bɛdjekel bɛ zokazɛke nɛ Yezu náá: «Sɔa nyɛ, étɛp yé lookɛbok mos, nyɛ ɛpedu mena nɛ etsim!» <verse eid="MAT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />É di'enek, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza náá: «Mɛ nadhisaa ɛ́, kɔ ɛsu ɛ bot ɛ mbyak Yisalaɛl di náá, bɛ eezewo ze dáa bɔɔ ebhata ee di ààbɛ nɛ mbaalel ɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Tin, wɔ gwaa moma yenɔk zɛkwyit mɛboŋ si mɛko ɛ Yezu. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, kwyeea mɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Yɛ àànyɔ náá, bɔɔ bɛbhyɛ djɛaa emapa di náá, yɛ ɛ́ yii bɔn ɛ bot ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Wɔ gwaa moma yenɔk baazɛpesal náá: «Wɔ ɛ́ nɛ gham, Ghɛŋ! Tin, bɛbhyɛ aazodedɛ ɛ́ bɔɔ eghutu-ghutu e mapa dyeebakwyit é mesa kukuma yɔɔ ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Tin, Yezu eezɛke nɛ moma yenɔk náá: «Heee moma! Ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔ nɛ Zɛɛb nɛ bɔk. Étɛp tak ɛ, Zɛɛb waadjɛ wɔ sa lyem'ɔ di ekwos ɛ.» É di tak wat, wɔ gwaa mɔn zokatsak.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛtsik membel ɛbuɛpe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛdus tin, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ ɛboŋ ɛ boo soob na djato-djato e Ghalile. Nyɛ eezɛbyet kɔ mɔɔ ɛtsok, nɔɔ nyel, disi. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Bot mɛdhuu-mɛdhuu zokazyɛ nɛ bot ɛ edjam, bot ɛ edhim, eboka e bot, ebubu e bot, nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ membel. Bɛ eezɛsil bɛ sok bhwoob'ɛ. Tin, Yezu zokazɛtsik bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Ɛdhuu ɛ bot naadyeebadjoka dáa bɛ nadi ebee ebubu moo lii ɛ, bot ɛ edjam nɛ eboka moo kɛ ɛ, bot ɛ edhim moo nyaasok ɛ. Bɛ moo tin eduwal Zɛɛb Yisalaɛl.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛdjɛ bot bɛmil ɛná edee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Yezu eezɛdjóo bɛdjekel bɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Haaa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ ɛdhuu ɛ bot bak! Mena nɛ bɛnɔɔ moo mos ɛ́ mɛlu mɛlɛl é di wat. Bɛ tokapɛ nɛ edee e dek. Mɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛswaal bɛ pɛ mendjaa mɔɔ tɔ emɔ toto, bɛ waazuk, ze ɛ ze.» <verse eid="MAT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Tin, bɛdjekel bɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Mena aabela edee ee ɛdhuu ɛ bot bak djas aadɛ djil nɛ yɛ ɛ paa? Menabɛl ɛ́ dika kuku kakoŋ'aak?» <verse eid="MAT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Yezu eezɛdji bɛ náá: «Bi ɛ́ nɛ emapa edhen?» Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza náá: «Etɛn nɛ ebá nɛ ba bɔɔ bɛsu.» <verse eid="MAT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛlɛɛ nɛ ɛdhuu ɛ bot náá, bɛ disi é bɔs. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ emapa etɛn nɛ ebá nɛ bɛsu binek, nyɛ eezɛbulal bhɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb. E di'enek, nyɛ eezɛpyak yɛ ebil-ebil. Nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ yɛ náá, djɛ bɛdjekel bɛ, bɛ neekaa bot djas yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Mot nɛ mot naadɛ, djil. Bɛdjekel bula nɛ yii nabwak ɛ. Mɛbhubhwak naalwoodal bɛbhwaŋ ɛtɛn nɛ ebá. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Mɛtaŋ mɛ bot ɛ nadɛ ɔ, naakum botom bɛmil ɛná (4 000), ààlaa-laŋak boa nɛ bɔɔ dhyeeb. <verse eid="MAT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Bhii tak, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛswaal bot ɛ tak bɛ sik pɛ mendjaa mɔɔ. É di'enek wat, nyɛ eezɛni tɔ elɛɛd, bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ zokazɛtɔ́ pɛ kyee dik Maghadan.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s1">EFalizyɛ nɛ eSaduseɛ ɛpesaa dhiiti ndem mɛbwala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />EFalizyɛ nɛ eSaduseɛ naazyɛ pɛ daa Yezu étɛp ɛsaŋ ɛ ɛlóo ɛ nyɛ pɛ ɛko, da bwood nyɛ pɛ kyɛ. Bɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá, nyɛ lyaal bɛ dhiiti ndem mɛbwala di edus pɛ tɔ gwoo ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Yezu ɛ́ boo kabulal bɛ dáak: «Dwoo ɛ sila ɔɔ, bi ke ɛ́ náá: “Yɛ aadi ɛ́, mbɛɛ dwoo, etɛɛ náá, gwoo moo ɛ́ tɔɔbelaa.” <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Kɛɛŋ tɔ mɛlem, bi dyeebake ɛ́: “Bhi ɛ́ waanee mos, etɛɛ náá, gwoo ɛ́ tɔɔbelaa.” Bi ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛsiiza ɛnyɔɛpe endem ee di tɔ gwoo ɔ, ghuna bi ààgu ɛbɛk membi mɛ endem di edhaa mɛlu mak ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Biyɔ, bot ɛ mɛlu mak, biyɔ bɛmbee ɛ bot, bot ɛ di ààbɛ sosoob é mis ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, bi kasaŋ ɛ́ endem e mɛbwala. Yɛ aanàkwaadjɛaa bin dhiiti ndem, yɛ di ààbɛ yii nasael é ghɛŋ ɛ ngoolel Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Zonas ɛ.» Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛbet bɛ, zɛtɔ́.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Leviid e eFalizyɛ nɛ eSaduseɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />É di bɛdjekel nadhaa pɛ yii kyiid soob ɔ, bɛ eezɛdjisa ɛnɔŋ ɛ emapa. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Yezu ɛ́ boolɛɛ bɛ náá: «Dika nɛ etsoŋ, da bi ɛ́ kyee leviid e eFalizyɛ nɛ eSaduseɛ di nɛ yɛ ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Bɛdjekel moo tin enyiiŋela pak'ɔɔ náá: «Nyɛ lii deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, mena ààpanɔɔka emapa.» <verse eid="MAT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Yezu eezɛgu sa bɛ nadi enyiiŋela ɛ. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛdji bɛ náá: «Étɛp yé bi di elii pak'en: Yɛ ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, mena tok nɛ mapa? Dhatyee ɛbwaalel ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb di batsa ɛ! <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Bi dinaa ààpamɛt ɛsuk, bi tok nɛ ghwyil ɛtaala emapa etɛn mɛ nakaa botom bɛmil ɛtɛn yɛ ɛ, dɔɔ nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ mɛbhwaa bi nabula nɛ yɛ ɛ? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Bi tok nɛ ghwyil ɛtaala emapa etɛn nɛ ebá mɛ nakaa bot bɛmil ɛná (4 000) yɛ ɛ, nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ bɛbhwaŋ ɛ bi nabula nɛ yɛ ɛ? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Étɛp yé bi di ààgu náá, mɛ bɛ ɛ́ ààlii nɛ nen étɛp emapa, é sok mɛ lii nɛ nen ɛ? Mɛ ke ɛ́ náá: “Kyeeka leviid e eFalizyɛ nɛ eSaduseɛ”.»<verse eid="MAT 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />É di tak, bɛdjekel eezɛgu náá, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààke náá, bɛ kyee leviid di ewaaa tɔ emapa ɛ. Ghuna ye nabɛ ɛ́ mɛlyo mɛ eFalizyɛ nɛ eSaduseɛ.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pyɛɛd eezɛlɛɛ náá, Yezu ɛ́ Mɛsia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Yezu eezɛkum kɔ kyee bɔs Sezaale ɛ Filip. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛdji bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Bot ke dáa dum nɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot?» <verse eid="MAT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Bɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Bɛdhiiti ke ɛ́ náá, wɔ ɛ́ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot, bak náá, wɔ ɛ́ Eli. Bɛdhiiti kabaake ɛ́ náá, wɔ ɛ́ Zeelemi nɛghu dhiiti ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb.» <verse eid="MAT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Yezu ɛ́ boozɛdji bɛ náá: «Haaa! Biyɔ, bi ke náá, mam ɛ́ zɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Tin, Simɔŋ Pyɛɛd zɛbɔɔza náá: «Wɔ ɛ́ Mɛsia, Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb di nɛ tsik na kɔm-kɔm ɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɛnyɔ nɛ nɔ, Simɔŋ mɔn ɛ Zaŋ, etɛɛ náá, ye tok mot epuud zetel wɔ yenek etsɛɛtsɛ, gua náá yɛ ɛ́ Saagam mot di tɔ gwoo ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Yɛ bɛ mam ɔɔ, mɛ ɛpelɛɛ wɔ, wɔy Pyɛɛd wɔ ɛ́ ɛkok, kɔ ɛkok ɛ tak, mɛ aasum zɛɛga mendjaala mam. Ɛsyee aanàkwaakwak yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Mɛ waaboodjɛ wɔ bɛsap ɛ ndjaa Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ. Sa wɔ aalu kɔ bɔs ɛ, yɛ waaluel tɔ gwoo. Sa wɔ aadjɛ ze kɔ bɔs ɛ, ze ɛ́ waadjɛel tɔ gwoo.» <verse eid="MAT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛlu bɛdjekel bɛ náá, sa bɛ ààlɛɛ mot náá, nyɛ ɛ́ Mɛsia.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛlii dum ɛsyee ɛ lɛ nɛ ɛgom ɛ lɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />É di'enek, Yezu moo zɛlɛɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Ye goka ɛ́ náá, mɛ tɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm, étɛp mɛ neekɛzuk ɛbuɛpe é mɛmbɔ mɛ bɛpaa eYuda, bɛ nɛ eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, zɛnɔɔ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi. Bɛ waagó mɛ, bhii mɛlu mɛlɛl, mɛ waagom.» <verse eid="MAT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />É di'enek, Pyɛɛd eezɛdul nyɛ é ngwoob bɛ nɛ nɛ bɛbá, nyɛ moo edul nyɛ mɛlo: «Zɛɛb baal wɔ, Ghɛŋ! Yenek aanàkwaakosael.» <verse eid="MAT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />É di'enek, Yezu eezɛbhɛm nyɛ. Nyɛ nɛ Pyɛɛd náá: «Dusa! Tɔ́a ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ nam, Satan! Wɔ ɛ́ ɛbɛk é ze yam, etɛɛ náá, esiiza bɔ tok esiiza e Zɛɛb. Yɛ ɛ́ yii bot ɛ epuud!»<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Bhii tak, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Yɛ bɛ náá, mot ɛpekwyɛl ɛdu mɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ kat ɛkwyɛɛg ɛ nyel'ɛ, nyɛ bɛp mɛlaaba mɛ, da nyɛ ɛ́ du mɛ. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Etɛɛ náá, mot di ekwyɛl ɛtsik ɛ nyel'ɔ ɔ, nyɛ waasu nyel'ɛ. Ghuna mot aasu nyel'ɛ étɛp'am ɔ, nyɛ waabela yɛ! <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Yɛ ɛ́ tɛtɛ yé, wɔ bela mɛvu mɛ bɔs'ak djas, da wɔ ɛ́ su tsik na kɔm-kɔm? Yɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti sa mot aadjɛ étɛp ɛbɔm ɛ tsik'ɛ? Mam ààbee! <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aazyɛ tɔ duma Sɛɛg, bɛ nɛ efofop bɛ. É di'enek ɛ nyɛ aadjɛ mot nɛ mot efute mɛsa mɛ tyee nyɛ nadi ekɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, bɛdhiiti bot ɛ di wak ɔ, bɛ aanàkwaagwyɛ ɛsok nɛ bɛ nɛ bee Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ezyɛ tɔ Mɛkoozi mɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu eeswoola bhwoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Mɛlu mɛtɛn nɛ wat bhii tak, Yezu naanɔɔ Pyɛɛd, Zak nɛ Zaŋ mɔn-nyɛɛg ɛ Zak. Nyɛ naazɛtɔ́ nɛ nɔɔ kɔ vyɛɛg-vyɛɛg ɛtsok, é di tak bɛ nadi ɛ́ bɔɔ bɛmet. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />É di'enek, wɔ gwaa Yezu zɛswoola bhwoob é mis mɔɔ. Bhwoob'ɛ moo tin ɛkasɛpe dáa gwyes, ekaad bɛ moo ɛkasɛpe dáa dwoo. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />É di tak wat, bɛdjekel bɛ eezɛbee Moiiz nɛ Eli elɛɛ elɛŋ bɛ nɛ Yezu. <figure style="fig" alt="Les disciples ont vu Jésus entrain de causer avec Moise et Eli" file="41_Mat17.1-9_Transfiguration.tif" size="col" loc="17.3" copy="Gordon Thompson " ref="17.3">Bɛdjekel eebee Yezu elɛɛ elɛŋ bɛ nɛ Moiiz nɛ Eli</figure> <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Wɔ gwaa, Pyɛɛd zokazɛke nɛ Yezu náá: «Ghɛŋ, ye goka ɛ́ náá, mena di wak. Wɔ kwyɛl ɔɔ, mɛ ɛ́ sum epɛt elɛl: wat yɔ, dhiiti yɛ Moiiz, yak wat kadi ɛ́, yɛ Eli.» <verse eid="MAT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Dáa nyɛ nadi nyɛ dinaa elii ɛ, wɔ gwaa eguud na kas-kas zɛdipal bɛ. Bhii tak, gwood zokazɛgék náá: «Yenɔk ɛ́ mɔn'am mɛ dyeebakwyɛl ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ mɛ natɔ. Gwakeka nyɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />É di bɛdjekel nagwak gwood'enek ɛ, bwoo naazɛsa bɛ ɛlyelɛpe, wɔ gwaa bɛ zɛkwyit mɛboŋ mɔɔ, sum bhwoob si. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Yezu naazɛtiila pɛ daa lɔɔ, nyɛ eezɛmɛt bɛ. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Wyɛlka, nàdika nɛ bwoo.» <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Tin, bena bɛ nakaben mis ɛ, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkabee dhiiti mot bhii Yezu nyɛ ɛmet. <verse eid="MAT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Dáa bɛ nadi ewyeed ɛtsok ɛ, Yezu naazɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Sa mot ààlɛɛ mot esesɛɛ mɛbwala mɛ bi bee ɛ. Baalka yɛ kɛkum dwoo Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aagom bhis ɛsyee ɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Bhii tak, bɛdjekel naazɛdji Yezu náá: «Étɛp yé bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi dyeebake náá, Eli ɛ́ kwaaleezyɛ ɛsok?» <verse eid="MAT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Nyɛ naazɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ deenek. Eli ɛ́ di egoka nɛ ɛzyɛ sok étɛp ɛzɛkoobal etɛp djas. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Gwakeka, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá: Eli eezezyɛ, bot ààpagwyak nyɛ. Bɛ kasa nyɛ ɛ, dáa elyem bɔɔ di ekwyɛl ɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ deenek, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aazukaa kɔ ɛsu ɛlɔɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />É di'enek, bɛdjekel naazɛgu náá, nyɛ nalii nɛ nɔɔ ɛ́ dum nɛ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛtsik mɔn nadi nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɛ djem ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Dáa bɛ nakum é di ɛdhuu ɛ bot nadi ɔ, wɔ gwaa, mot ngɔt zokazyɛ é bhaaz ɛ Yezu, zɛkwyit mɛboŋ si mɛko mɛ. <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />Nyɛy náá: «Ghɛŋ, geka mɛ ghoŋ, mɔn'am ɛ́ ɛpezuk ɛbuɛpe nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɛ djem. É sok ye dyeebamɛt nyɛ ɛ, nyɛ nɛ ghaaga tɔ du, é dhiiti ɛwala, tɔ dii. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Mɛ naazyɛ nɛ nɛ pɛ daa bɛdjekel bɔ, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkwak ɛtsik nyɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />É di'enek, Yezu naazɛtsim ɛlyelɛpe, nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Biyɔ bɛmbee ɛ bot di ààdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ! Mɛlu mɛdhen kalik nɛ nam é ɛdi ɛ́ tɔ len? Baabela náá, mɛlu mɛdhen mɛ di egoka nɛ ɛmaad bin? Dhaka mɛ nɛ mɔn'enɔk wak.» <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Tin, wɔ gwaa Yezu zɛbhɛm mbee sisim. Mbee sisim tak naazɛwyis tɔ mɔn'enɔk. É di'enek wat, mɔn'enɔk naazɛtsak.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />É di'enek, bɛdjekel eezɛtiila é bhaaz ɛ Yezu nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet, bɛ eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Étɛp yé bisɔ nadi ààkwak ɛsɔ mbee sisim'enek?» <verse eid="MAT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Étɛp náá, ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb nɛ tɔɔl. Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá: Bi ɛpedi ɛ́ di nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛbɔkɛpe dáa bhek le mutaad ɔɔ, pe bi ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛke nɛ ɛtsok ɛlak náá: “Dusa wak, tɔ́ penek,” pe yɛ waadus. Tin, pe ye tok nɛ sa wat aadi nɛ ghwyil ɛdhaa bin. [ <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />Guka náá, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil mendjaala nɛ ɛtsi ɛ edee ɛ mbi yenek embee esisim aadus.]»<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eebaalii dum ɛsyee ɛ lɛ nɛ ɛgom ɛ lɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Dwoo wat, bɛdjekel eezɛdi é di wat pɛ Ghalile. Tin, Yezu eezɛlɛɛ bɛ náá: «Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɛ́ waakaaa é mɛmbɔ mɛ bot. <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />Bɛ waagó nyɛ, mɛlu mɛlɛl bhii tak, nyɛ waagom.» Tin, ghoŋ naazɛmɛt bɛdjekel dhaa nyel.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lapo Ndjaa-ebuwa ɛ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />É ghɛŋ Yezu nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ nakum pɛ ghaada Kapɛlnaum ɛ, bɛnɔŋel ɛ epata e lapo Ndjaa-ebuwa zokazyɛ pɛ kyee Pyɛɛd nadi ɛ́. Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛdji nyɛ náá: «Lyoel yen ààtuud lapo Ndjaa-ebuwa?» <verse eid="MAT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Pyɛɛd naazɛbɔɔza náá: «Heee, nyɛ nɛ tuud.» É ghɛŋ Pyɛɛd nani tɔ ndjaŋ ɛ, Yezu nadi ɛ́ mot mɛkɛn ɛlii. Nyɛy náá: «Wɔ gek dáa, Simɔŋ? Ɛzɛ di egoka nɛ ɛtuud lapo nɛghu edhiiti etuud pɛ daa bɛmɛkoozi mɛ bɔs'ak? Yɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ dɛl ohoo, nɛghu yɛ ɛ́ bɛdjoŋ?» <verse eid="MAT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Pyɛɛd ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ Yezu náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ bɛdjoŋ.» É di'enek, Yezu eezɛpesal náá: «Wɔ bee ɔɔ, bot ɛ dɛl ààgoka nɛ ɛtuud lapo. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Yɛ ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, mena ɛ́ zɛkɛdhusal bot binɔk. É di tak, tɔ́a pɛ boo soob na djato-djato. Lóoa ngwyep tɔ dii, nɔŋa su mɛkɛn wɔ aabela ɛ, da wɔ ɛ́ dii nuub'ɛ, wɔ waabela pata aagoka nɛ ɛtuud ɛ lapo yam nɛ yɔ ɛ. Nɔŋa yɛ, da wɔ ɛ́ tuud mena yenabɛl lapo.»<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s1">Yɛ ɛ́ ɛzɛ di dhil-mot tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />É ɛwala ɛlenek, bɛdjekel naazɛtiila é bhaaz ɛ Yezu, bɛ naazɛdji nyɛ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ ɛzɛ ɛ di boo-mot tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />É di'enek, wɔ gwaa Yezu zɛdjóo mɔɔ dhyeeb, zɛtel nyɛ kuku ɛbwak é mis mɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá: Bi ɛ́ di ààswoola mɛfulu men, da bi ɛ́ di dáa bɔɔ dhyeeb ɔɔ, bi aanàkwaani tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Boo-mot tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ mot di esil nyel'ɛ, da nyɛ ɛ́ di dáa mɔn'ak ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Mot ɛ be ɛnyɔɛpe mɔɔ dhyeeb dáa mɔn'ak kɔ ɛsu ɛ din ɛ lam ɔɔ, nyɛ be ɛ́ mam.»<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛdulaa mɛlɔ kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛkwyesal ɛ bot tɔ mesyem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />«Mot aakwyesal mɔn ngɔt tɔ sama bɔn zedum koŋ nɛ nam tɔ mesyem ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́ náá, bɛ tsel nyɛ boo ɛkok é tsuŋ. Bhii tak, da bɛ ɛ́ lóo nyɛ tɔ boo dii mɛsɔn, da nyɛ ɛ́ diida kɛkum pɛ si. <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Haaa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ bot ɛ di esa náá, bɔn-nyɛɛg bema mɛbɛk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bema mɛbɛk </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ, ɛsa mesyem. </char></note> ɔ. Ɛnyɔ náá, mɛbɛk di. Tin, haaa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ mot aadi ɛbɛk ɛ tak ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />Yɛ bɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ mbɔ'ɔ, nɛghu ko'ɔ ɛ́ di esa náá, wɔ gheekwyekwyɛ tɔ mesyem ɔɔ, tsaala yɛ, da wɔ ɛ́ mwas yɛ ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ nɔ. Ye goka ɛ́ náá, wɔ ni tɔ mbɛɛ tsik nɛ tsaala mbɔ, nɛghu tsaala ko, ààbɛ náá, wɔ baal mɛmbɔ mɛmbá nɛ mɛko mɛmbá, bhii tak, wɔ kakɛmwasaa ɛ́ tɔ du na kɔm-kɔm. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Yɛ bɛ náá, dis ɛ lɔ ɛ di esa náá, wɔ kwyɛ, tɔ mesyem ɔɔ, piida yɛ, da wɔ ɛ́ mwas yɛ ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ nɔ. Ye goka ɛ́ náá, wɔ ni tɔ mbɛɛ tsik nɛ tiila dis, ààbɛ náá, wɔ baal mis mɛmbá mɔ, bhii tak, wɔ kakɛmwasaa ɛ́ tɔ du na kɔm-kɔm.»<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kana bhata nabelaaa bhii nyɛ nazediib ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />«Bi ɛ́ koobaka! Sa mot ààbyasal mot ngɔt tɔ bɔn bak etɛɛ náá, efofop bɔɔ dyeebadi ɛ́, é di wat é mɛwala djas bɛ nɛ Saagam di pɛ tɔ gwoo ɔ. [ <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />Etɛɛ náá, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot nazyɛ ɛ́ zɛtsik bot ɛ nabɛ náá, bɛ eezediib ɔ.]<verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />Bi ke dáa? Pookogekeka náá, dhiiti mot ngɔt nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ ebhata dhet (100). Tin, ngɔt ɛ diib ɔɔ, nyɛ aanàkwaalik ebhata mɛkam-mɛtɛn nɛ mɛkam-mɛná nɛ etɛn nɛ ená (99) kɔ ɛtsok, étɛp nyɛ neekɛsaa ngɔt diib ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, nyɛ bela nyɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ waadi tɔ mɛmyaala ɛbuɛpe étɛp bhata wat'enɔk, dhaa ebhata mɛkam-mɛtɛn nɛ mɛkam-mɛná nɛ etɛn nɛ ená (99), nadi ààdiib ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Yɛ ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ Sɛɛg'en di tɔ gwoo ɔ. Nyɛ ààkwyɛl náá, mot ngɔt tɔ bɔn bɛ djas wo ze.»<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">É sok mɔn-nyoog di ekwyɛ ndjɛ sɔs ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />«Yɛ bɛ náá, mɔn-nyoog eesa wɔ ɛbiyo ɔɔ, tɔ́ kɛbee nyɛ wɔy wɔ ɛmet. Da wɔ ɛ́ kɛlyaal nyɛ ɛbiyo ɛ lɛ. Nyɛ gwak wɔ ɔɔ, tin, wɔ eekwak ɛbulal ɛ nyɛ é ze. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Yɛ kabɛ náá, nyɛ ààpagwak wɔ ɔɔ, djóoa dhiiti mot ngɔt nɛghu bot ɛbá. Dáa Ekwyala di elyaal náá: “Etɛp djas koobelaa ɛ́ é mis mɛ bɛtetɛp ɛbá nɛghu bɛlɛl<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.16 <char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Dɛt 19.15</ref></char></char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Tin, nyɛ byen ɛgwak bɛ ɔɔ, tɔ́ nɛ nɛ sok bhwoob bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala. Nyɛ byen ɛgwak bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala ɔɔ, tin, bi kabee nyɛ ɛ́ dáa mot di ààdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, dáa nɔŋel epata e lapo.<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />Mɛ ɛpelɛɛ bin, yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, etɛp djas bi aabyen wak kɔ bɔs ɛ, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waabyen yɛ tɔ gwoo. Etɛp djas bi aamyaal wak kɔ bɔs ɛ, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waamyaal yɛ tɔ gwoo.<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />Mɛ kabaalɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, wak kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs, bot ɛbá ɛ gwakel, da bɛ ɛ́ waab sa bɛ aakwyɛl ɛwaab tɔ mendjaala mɔɔ ɛ, Saagam di pɛ tɔ gwoo ɔ, nyɛ waadjɛ bɛ sa bɛ waab ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Etɛɛ náá, bot ɛbá nɛghu bot ɛlɛl ɛ sɛɛga kɔ ɛsu ɛ din ɛ lam ɔɔ, mɛ aadi ɛ́ tin pak'ɔɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kana mot-mɛsa di epɛɛ ɛpel ɛ́ mɔn-nyɛɛg ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Wɔ gwaa Pyɛɛd zokazyɛ pɛ pak Yezu nadi ɛ́. Tin, nyɛ boozɛdji nyɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, mɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛpel mɔn-nyaagam esok edhen, nyɛ sa mɛ ɛbiyo ɔɔ? Tyee esok etɛn nɛ ebá?» <verse eid="MAT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yezu naazɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Ààbɛ, mɛ ààpalɛɛ nɛ nɔ náá, ye di esok etɛn nɛ ebá. Mɛ lɛɛ wɔ ɛ́, ye di esok mɛkam-mɛtɛn nɛ mɛkam-mɛmbá (70), esok etɛn nɛ ebá.<verse eid="MAT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />Étɛp tak ɛ di náá, Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɔ nɔŋel ɛ, nɛ dhiiti mɛkoozi nadi ekwyɛl ɛkoobal etɛp bɛ nɛ bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ nakola epata bɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Tin, é ghɛŋ nyɛ nakan ɛdjóo ngɔt-ngɔt ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zokazyɛ nyɛ nɛ mot-mɛsa mɛ ngɔt nakola epata ɛbuɛpe ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Mot'enɔk nabɛ ɛ́, ààbɛ nɛ sa nyɛ aabulal epata binek nɛ yɛ. Kukuma yɛ ɛ́ boodjɛ ɛlee náá, nyɛy nɛ myɛl nɛ bɔn zɛnɔɔ esa bɛ djas bɔmsaaa, etɛp epata e tak neebulal kola nyɛ nadi nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Tin, mot-mɛsa menɔk eezɛkwyit mɛboŋ si sok bhwoob kukuma yɛ tak. Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: “Sila lyem, da wɔ ɛ́ gek mɛ ghoŋ. Mɛ waazɛbulal wɔ epata binek djas!”<figure style="fig" alt="Le serviteur demande pardon à son maître" file="DN00463b.tif" size="col" loc="18.26" copy="Darwin Dunham" ref="18.26">Mot-mɛsa ɛpewaab ɛpelak nɛ kukuma yɛ</figure> <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Kukuma yɛ zokazɛgek nyɛ ghoŋ, nyɛ eezɛpel nyɛ nɛ epata ee nyɛ nakola ɛ djas. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛbet nyɛ, nyɛ tɔ́.<verse eid="MAT 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />Dáa mot-mɛsa menɔk nawyis tin ɛ, nyɛ eezɛboma nɛ dhiiti mɔn-nyɛɛg nyɛy nakola nyɛ edhenye dhet (100) e epata. Nyɛ eezɛvyɛk gbak, mɛt nyɛ é tsuŋ, nyɛ moo tin esus nyɛ é tsuŋ ɛkɛɛ, nyɛ aagó nyɛ góak. Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: “Tuuda mɛ kola yam nenak!” <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Sɔ kwom zokazɛkwyit mɛboŋ si sok bhwoob'ɛ, nyɛ eedjaala nɛ nɛ náá: “Sila lyem, da wɔ ɛ́ gek mɛ ghoŋ. Bwooda batsa mɛ waatuud kola yɔ!” <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Wɔ gwaa nakuma epata zokapɛɛ. Tin, nyɛy zokakɛkɔɔl mɔn-nyɛɛg é membok é ɛbwood ɛ́ dwoo nyɛ aabulal epata bɛ ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Dáa bɛdhiiti bot ɛ mɛsa nabee deenek ɛ́, ye naakpaa bɛ tɔ elyem. Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛtɔ́, kɛlɛɛ kukuma yɔɔ etɛp djas dhaŋ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Tin, kukuma yɔɔ ɛ́ boozɛbaadjóo mot-mɛsa menɔk, nyɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ nɛ náá: “Wɔ ɛ́ mot-mɛsa mɛ di náá, wɔ ɛ́ nɛ mbee lyem! Mɛ bɛ mbembɛ ɛ́, mɛ eepel wɔ nɛ epata bam wɔ nakola ɛ, etɛɛ náá, wɔ bɛ ɛ́, wɔ eedjaala nɛ nam náá, mɛ bet wɔ. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Ye goka náá, wɔ gek mɔɔ sɔ'ɔ ghoŋ dáa mɛ gek wɔ ghoŋ ɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́, kukuma eezebiyo ɛlyelɛpe, nyɛ ɛ́ boolwom náá, bɛ mɛt mot-mɛsa menɔk. Nyɛ kɛsa mɛsa mɛ bhel kɛkum dwoo nyɛ aaboobulal kola yenek djas ɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Yezu eebaazɛke náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ Saagam di tɔ gwoo ɔ aasa nɛ nen, yɛ bɛ náá, mot nɛ mot ààpapel mɔn-nyɛɛg nɛ lyem wat ɔɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo ɛ Yezu dum nɛ tɛp ɛbel ɛ ɛba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Bhii Yezu nasilal ɛlyo bot pɛ kyee dik Ghalile ɛ, nyɛ naazɛtɔ́ pɛ kyee dik Yude, pɛ yii kyiid dii Yuldɛn. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Tin, zukamwaa nɛ mot baazɛdu nyɛ. Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zokatsik membel mɛ bɛ nazyɛ nɛ nɔɔ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />É di'enek bɛdhiiti eFalizyɛ zokazyɛ pɛ daa lɛ, étɛp bɛ neelóo nyɛ pɛ ɛko, bwood nyɛ pɛ kyɛ. Bɔɔ nɛ Yezu náá: «Etsi bina ɛpemyaal náá, mot pɛɛ myɛl kɔ ɛsu ɛ etɛp mbɛs é?» <verse eid="MAT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi ààlaa sa di kwyala tɔ Mɛkana ɛ Zɛɛb é? “É ghɛŋ Zɛɛb nakus bɔs ɛ, nyɛ nakus ɛ moma nɛ motom<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.4 <char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Mɛk 1.27</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 5:2">5.2</ref></char></char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Nyɛ eebaazɛbil náá: “Étɛp tak ɛ ye di náá, motom ɛ́ waalik sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg, étɛp nyɛ neekɛsɛɛga bɛ nɛ myɛl. Tin, bɔɔ bɛbá aakadi ɛ́, bɛ moo mot ngɔt. <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />É di'enek, bɛ tokapɛ bot ɛbá, bɛ aakadi ɛ́, bɛ moo mot ngɔt. Sa mot ààbɛk sa di náá, Zɛɛb eesɛɛg ɛ.”»<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />EFalizyɛ ɛ́ boo baadji nyɛ náá: «Étɛp yé Moiiz nalɛɛ náá, motom kwyal mɛkana mɛ ɛbel ɛ ɛba, nyɛ pɛɛ myɛl ɔɔ?» <verse eid="MAT 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Moiiz namyaal náá, bi pɛɛ bɛl bin ɛ́, étɛp mɛlyel mɛ elyem bin. Etɛɛ náá, é ɛkɛn ɛ bɔs, ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ deenek. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, motom ɛ pɛɛ myɛl, da nyɛ ɛ́ baakɛba dhiiti moma sis, ààbɛ náá, myɛl tak eesa ɛzɔ ɔɔ, tin, motom'enɔk eesa ɛzɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Tin, bɛdjekel eezɛke nɛ Yezu náá: «Yɛ bɛ náá, etɛp ɛba goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi ɛ́ deenek pak moma nɛ motom ɔɔ, ye nyɔ ɛ́ náá, mot di yɛ kɔ, ààba moma.» <verse eid="MAT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />É di'enek, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bot djas ààdyeebakwyɛl mbi mɛlyo mak. Tin, yɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb yii nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet Zɛɛb aadjɛ ghwyil ɔ aakwaakwak yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Yɛ ɛ́ nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ etɛp di elu náá, bot nàba ɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ nɛ bot ɛ nabyel náá, bɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛba yɔbɔ ɛ. Yɛ kabɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɔɔ, yɛ ɛ́ bɛsɔ bɔɔ bot ɛ aakwaasa náá, bɛ nàkwyɛl ɛba. Bɛdhiiti aadi ɛ́ ààba, étɛp Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ. Deenek yɛ bɛ náá, mot ɛpekwyɛl ɛmyaal mɛlyo mak ɔɔ, nyɛ myaal.»<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛsɛɛ bɔɔ dhyeeb mɛtel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Dhiiti dwoo, bot naazɛzyɛ Yezu nɛ bɔɔ dhyeeb étɛp nyɛ needjaala bɛ Zɛɛb nɛ ɛkɛl ɛ bɛ mɛmbɔ. Wɔ gwaa, bɛdjekel bɛ zokazɛbhɛm bot ɛ tak. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Dáa Yezu nabee deenek ɛ́, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ bɛdjekel náá: «Betka bɔɔ dhyeeb, bɛ zyɛ pɛ daa lam! Nàluka bɛ, etɛɛ náá, Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ yii mot di tyee bɔɔ ɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Tin, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛkɛl bɛ mɛmbɔ. Bhii nyɛ nakasilal ɛ, nyɛ boozɛnɔɔ nyel tɔ́.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɔɔ ngbaaz na ekum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Dáa bɛ nadi gba-gba é goŋ ɛ, dhiiti mot zokazyɛ pɛ daa Yezu, mot tak nɛ Yezu náá: «Lyoel! Mɛ goka nɛ ɛsa yaa tɛtɛ sonok étɛp mɛ neebela tsik na kɔm-kɔm?» <verse eid="MAT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Étɛp yé wɔ di edji mɛ mɛdjin dum nɛ sa di ɛnyɔɛpe ɛ? Yɛ ɛ́ Zɛɛb nyɛ ɛmet ɛ di tɛtɛ mot. Wɔ kwyɛl ɛni tɔ tsik na kɔm-kɔm ɔɔ, wɔ goka ɛ́ wɔ looba nɛ sa mɛtiŋ di elɛɛ ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Mot'enɔk eezɛdji Yezu náá: «Yaa mɛtiŋ?» Yezu ɛ́ boozɛlɛɛ nyɛ náá: «Sa wɔ ààgó mot. Sa wɔ ààsa mɛzɔ. Sa wɔ ààdjii sa mot. Sa wɔ ààlɛɛ elɛŋ e etsal dum nɛ mot. <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />Duwala soog nɛ nyoog. Kwyɛla sɔ'ɔ mot dáa wɔ di ekwyɛl nyel'ɔ met ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Ngbaaz'enɔk eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɛtiŋ menek djas mɛ nɛ duwal yɛ. Mɛ kabaasa yé?» <verse eid="MAT 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />É di'enek, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔ kwyɛl ɛdi tɔ epiki ɔɔ, tɔ́a kɛbɔmsa esa bɔ djas, da wɔ ɛ́ nɔɔ epata tak, djɛ bɛdjel ɛ bot. Tin, wɔ waabela mɛvu tɔ gwoo. Bhii tak, da wɔ ɛ́ zyɛ, zɛdu mɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Dáa ngbaaz'enɔk nagwak deenek ɛ́, kiyooo nyɛ eeliigel, sik yɛ, etɛɛ náá, ye naatek nyɛ nyel, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ ekum ɛbuɛpe.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛke nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá: Ɛkɔɔla náá, bot ɛ di nɛ mɛvu ɔ ni tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ! <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Mɛ baalɛɛ bin ɛ náá, ɛkɔɔla náá, boo yaaga bal dhaa tɔ ba mɔɔ ɛlen ɛ dhɔɔ. Yɛ kabɛ bɛkum ɛ bot ɔɔ, ɛni ɛ lɔɔ tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb eebaadhaa-dhaŋak ɛni ɛ yaaga tɔ ɛlen ɛ dhɔɔ nɛ mɛlyel.» <verse eid="MAT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Dáa bɛdjekel nagwak mɛkpa menek ɛ, bɛ naadyeebadjoka. Bhii tak, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛdji Yezu náá: «Yɛ bɛ deenek ɔɔ, ɛzɛ aabela tsik na kɔm-kɔm?» <verse eid="MAT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Yezu zokabɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Sa di náá, bot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛkwak ɛ, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waakwak yɛ, etɛɛ náá, ye tok nɛ sa Zɛɛb aadi ààkwak.» <verse eid="MAT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Wɔ gwaa, Pyɛɛd zɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Gwaka! Bis eezebet mɛze mes nɛ etɛp bis djas étɛp ɛdu ɛ wɔ. Yesɔ efute aakadi tin yé?» <verse eid="MAT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Tin, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ: «Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, é ghɛŋ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aadi kɔ bóó mɛkoozi mɛ nɛ duma tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ na bes ɛ, biyɔ, bot kam nɛ bɛbá namyaal ɛdu ɛ mɛ ɔ, bi aadi ɛ́, kɔ mɛbhóó mɛ mɛkoozi kam nɛ ebá, étɛp ɛpɛ́ɛ ɛ membyak kam nɛ ebá ɛ Yisalaɛl. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Bot ɛ di ebet mɛbhis mɔɔ, bɔn-nyɛɛg bɔɔ, nɛ bɛkɛl bɔɔ, zɛnɔɔ bɛsɛɛg bɔɔ nɛ bɛnyɛɛg bɔɔ, bɔn bɔɔ, zɛnɔɔ epyeeb bɔɔ étɛp'am ɔɔ, bɛ waabela bɛdhet nɛ bɛdhet kala kɔ yii. Bɛ waabela tsik na kɔm-kɔm. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Tin, ye kabela ɛ́ náá, bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ di mos pɛ sok lɔɔg ɔ, bɛ aakaswaala ɛ́ bot ɛ ɛbhis, bot ɛ di mos bot ɛ ɛbhis ɛ lɔɔg ɔ, bɛ aakaswaala ɛ́ bot ɛ sok.»<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s1">Kana bot ɛ mɛsa tɔ pyeeb vin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />«Beeka dhiiti sa di enɔŋel nɛ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ: Dhiiti kukuma naazɛwyis tɔ ghooghom mɛlem kɛsaa bot étɛp bɛ neekɛsa mɛsa tɔ pyeeb vin'ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ zokagwakel náá, efute bɔɔ aadi ɛ́, dáa bot di ezyɛ nɛ ɛfutaa sok ɛ, nɛghu dhenye wat tɔ ɛlu ɛ wat. Tin, nyɛ eezɛlwom bɛ, bɛ kɛsa mɛsa tɔ pyeeb vin'ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Nyɛ eebaazɛwyis é ɛwala etɛn nɛ ená yii mɛlem, wɔ gwaa nyɛ baazɛboma nɛ bɛdhiiti bot metetel kɔ ɛbɛsɛɛ ɛ dɛl, bɔɔ tin, ààbɛ nɛ mɛsa. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: “Biyɔ pe, tɔ́ka, kɛsaka mɛsa tɔ pyeeb vin'am, mɛ aadjɛ bin efute dáa ye di egoka ɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Tin, bot binɔk ɛ́ boozɛnɔɔ mɛnyel, tɔ́.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:5">Bhii tak, kukuma yenɔk naabaazyɛ kuku mwos dwoo dɔɔ nɛ é ɛwala elɛl yii bikoko. Nyɛ nabaazolii ɛ́ dáa nyɛ nazolii nɛ bot ɛsok ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Nyɛ eebaazɛwyis bikoko, dwoo eezesila. Tin, nyɛ ɛ́ boo baazɛboma nɛ yak ɛdhuu ɛ bot. Nyɛ eezɛdji bɛ náá: “Étɛp yé bi di wak, kana mɛlem, kɛyaka nɛ yak ɛwala, ààsa sonok?” <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Bot binɔk zokazɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ: “Yɛ ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, bis tok nɛ mɛsa mɛ ɛsa.” Bhii tak, nyɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ nɔɔ náá: “Dɔɔ nɛ biyɔ pe, tɔ́ka, kɛsaka mɛsa tɔ pyeeb vin'am.”<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />Dáa dwoo nakabɛ, ye moo bikoko ɛ, kukuma pyeeb vin ɛ́ booke nɛ mot nadi kɔ elo e bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ djas ɔ náá: “Djóoa bot ɛ mɛsa, da wɔ ɛ́ djɛ mot nɛ mot efute bɛ. Wɔ kan ɛ́ nɛ bot ɛ nadjóoaa ɛbhis ɔ, da wɔ ɛ́ kɛsilal nɛ bot ɛ́ nakanaa ɛdjóoaa sok ɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Tin, bot ɛ nakan mɛsa bikoko ɔ, zokazyɛ, zɛbela yɔbɔ efute e dhenye wat. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Dáa bot ɛsok nakazyɛ yɔbɔ ɛ, bɛ nagek tɔ elyem bɔɔ ɛ náá, bɛ waabela efute dhaa bot ɛ nakan bikoko ɔ. Tin, bɛ nazobaadjɛ bɛ ɛ́ efute e dhenye wat. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Beea bɛ nabee deenek ɛ́, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛni é byak kukuma pyeeb. <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />Bɔɔ náá: “Bot ɛ kan mɛsa nenak bikoko ɔ, bɛ zosa ɛ́ mɛsa é di ɛwala wat. Tin, wɔ kadjɛ bɛ efute ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ dáa wɔ djɛ bisɔ, bot ɛ kan mɛsa tɔ mɛlem ɔ, si kas-kas gwyes nɛ etuŋ, zɛnɔɔ mɛnyel na wɔyɔŋ ghwyil djas eezesi.”<verse eid="MAT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />Tin, kukuma ɛ́ boobɔɔza nɛ ngɔt pak'ɔɔ náá: “Mɔn-nyaagam, ye tok nɛ ɛbiyo mɛ sa. Tin, mena bɛ ààgwakel náá, wɔ sa mɛsa ɛ étɛp wɔ neebela etuud e dhenye wat, di egoka náá, ye djɛaa nɛ mot sa mɛsa mɛ dwoo wat ɔ, etsal é? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Nɔŋa pata yɔ, da wɔ ɛ́ tɔ́ yɔ, etɛɛ náá, mɛ neebaadjɛ nwyak mot kalik'aak dáa mɛ djɛ wɔy ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Mɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛbe esa bam dáa lyem'am di ekwyɛl ɛ? Étɛp yé wɔ di ebyen náá, mɛ sa enɛm esa?”»<verse eid="MAT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />É di'enek, Yezu ɛ́ bookabaazɛpesal náá: «Yɛ aadi ɛ́ deenek, bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ́ di bot ɛ ɛbhis ɛ lɔɔg ɔ, bɛ kaswaalaa ɛ́, bot ɛ pɛ sok lɔɔg. Bot ɛ pɛ sok'aak aaswaalaa ɛ́ bot ɛ pɛ bhis lɔɔg.»<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ye moo ɛ́ tyee esok elɛl Yezu di elɛɛ tɛp ɛsyee nɛ ɛgom ɛ lɛ ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Dáa Yezu nadi etɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm ɛ, nyɛ naazɛnɔɔ bɛdjekel kam nɛ bɛbá bɔɔ bɛmet. Tin, dáa bɛ nadi ekɛ ze ɛ ze ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛlɛɛ bɛdjekel náá: <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />«Gwakeka! Mena ɛpetɔ́ka pɛ Yeluzalɛm pɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aakaaa é mɛmbɔ mɛ eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi ɛ, étɛp bɛ needjɛ nyɛ epɛ́ɛ e ɛsyee ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />Bhii tak, bɛ waaka nyɛ é mɛmbɔ mɛ bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ. Bot binɔk ɛ́ waaduk nyɛ, bɛ waabem nyɛ é mɛlaaba, nyuu nyɛ nɛ eghwyɛs, gó nyɛ. Mɛlu mɛlɛl bhis ɛsyee ɛ lɛ, nyɛ waagom.»<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngwyeebel ɛ nyɛɛg ɛ Zak nɛ Zaŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Wɔ gwaa, mwaa Zɛbɛdɛ zokazyɛ nɛ bɔn bɛ bɛbá zɛbee Yezu. Dáa bɛ nakum é di Yezu nadi ɛ, nyɛ eezɛkwyit mɛboŋ sok bhwoob'ɛ étɛp nyɛ neewaab sonok pɛ daa lɛ. <verse eid="MAT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Yezu ɛ́ booke nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔ saa yé?» Moma tak ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ Yezu náá: «Beea bɔn bam bɛbá bak. Mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́, wɔ kɛk mɛ náá, bɛ bela duma di náá, ngɔt di pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ bɔ, nwyak ngɔt pɛ mbɔ ɛmyɛl ɛ lɔ, é sok waadi tɔ mɛkoozi mɔ ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Tin, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza náá: «Bi ààgu sa bi di ewaab ɛ. Bi ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛkwak ɛdɛ tɔ bɛɛlɛ mezuk mɛ mɛ aadɛ ɛ?» Bɛ eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Hɛɛɛ! Bis ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛdɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yezu eezɛke nɛ bɔn bɛ bɛbá náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ! Bi ɛ́ waadɛ tɔ bɛɛlɛ mezuk mam. Yɛ kabɛ dum nɛ tɛp ɛdi pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ bam nɛghu pɛ mbɔ ɛmyɛl ɛ lam ɔɔ, mam tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdjɛ bin edi tak. Etɛɛ náá, Saagam ɛ di egu bot ɛ nyɛ aadjɛ edi binek ɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Dáa bak bɛdjekel kam nalik ɛ, nagwak deenek ɛ́, ye nabɛ ɛ́, ye naakpaa bɛ elyem nɛ sa Zak bɛ nɛ Zaŋ nasa ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Bhii tak, Yezu ɛ́ bookazɛdjóo bɔɔ djas, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi kabɛ edjak náá, mɛsa mɛ ekukuma e membyak mɛ sis ɛ́ ɛzuk ɛ bot bɔɔ. Mɛsa mɛ bot ɛ di djóoaa eboo bot ɛ bɔs ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ ɛnyal bot ɛ di eduwal bɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Ghuna, yɛ ààgoka nɛ ɛsael deenek pak'en. Ye goka ɛ́ náá, ngɔt pak'en ɛ kwyɛl ɛdi boo-mot ɔɔ, nyɛ di mot-mɛsa mɛ bɛsɔ. <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />É di'enek, mot ɛ kwyɛl ɛdi pɛ sok bɛsɔ ɔɔ, nyɛ di kwom'en. <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Étɛp tak ɛ di náá, ɛzyɛ ɛ́ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ, etɛɛ náá, bot neesa nyɛ mɛsa. Nyɛ nazyɛ ɛ, étɛp ɛzɛdi mot-mɛsa mɛ bot, nɛ ɛzɛdjɛ bot tsik'ɛ nyɛ ɛmet tyee etuud étɛp ɛpɛk bɛtɛ nɛ bot.»<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eetsik bot ɛ edhim bɛbá pɛ Yeliko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Bhii bɛ nawyis kɔ dɛl ɛ Yeliko ɛ, zukamwaa nɛ mot naazɛdu Yezu. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Tin, bot ɛ edhim bɛbá nadidi é ngwoob gba ɔ, zokagwak menduk náá, Yezu ɛpedhaa tin. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛbo etsim náá: «Ghɛŋ, Mɔn ɛ Dhavid! Geka bis ghoŋ!» <verse eid="MAT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi edu Yezu ɔ, moo tin ebhɛm bɛ, étɛp bɛ needi gwyem. Wɔ gwaa bɛ zokabaaben ebhyeed bɔɔ ɛlyelɛpe náá: «Ghɛŋ, Mɔn ɛ Dhavid! Geka bis ghoŋ!» <verse eid="MAT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />É sok'enek, Yezu eezɛtyaa. Wɔ gwaa nyɛ zokadjóo bɛ. Nyɛ eezɛdji bɔɔ bɛbá náá: «Bi kwyɛl náá, mɛ sa bin yé?» <verse eid="MAT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Bot binɔk ɛ́ boopesal náá: «Ghɛŋ, bis kwyɛl ɛ́ náá, bis nyaasok.» <verse eid="MAT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Tin, Yezu zokazɛgek bɛ ghoŋ. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛkɛl bɛ mɛmbɔ kɔ mis. É di tak wat, mis mɔɔ eezɛbɛŋel, tin, bɛ eezɛdu nyɛ.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu eeni tɔ Yeluzalɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Dáa bɛ nadi, bɛ moo ekunaa nɛ Yeluzalɛm ɛ, bɛ moo é ngwoob dɛl ɛ bɛ di edjóo Bhɛtfaze, pɛ ɛtsok ɛ pyeeb oliv ɛ, Yezu eezɛlwom bɛdjekel bɛ bɛbá: <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Tɔ́ka kɔ dɛl ɛ di pɛ sok'enek. Tuula bi aatuula kɔ dɛl ɛ tak ɛ, bi ɛ́ waabela myɛl mɔɔ yaaga di edjóoaa an ɛ nɛ mɔɔ swooz tak kɔla é di wat. Tiika bɛ, da bi ɛ́ zyɛ mɛ nɛ nɔɔ wak.<verse eid="MAT 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Mot ɛ dji bin náá: “Bi tɔ́ nɛ nɔɔ wo” ɔɔ, lɛɛka nyɛ náá: “Yɛ ɛ́ Ghɛŋ ɛ di nɛ gwyes nɛ nɔɔ.” Tin, bɛ waaleedjɛ bin bak.»<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Esesɛɛ binek goka nɛ ɛsael, etɛɛ náá, etɛp ee di kwyala tɔ mɛkana mɛ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ neebela ɛsuk:<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />«Lɛɛka nɛ ɛsyes ɛ ghaada Siyɔŋ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">“Beea, mɛkoozi mɔ ɛpezyɛ pɛ daa lɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">Nyɛ zyɛ ɛ́ nɛ enɛm esa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">nyɛ ɛ́ ndiindel kɔ myɛl an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">Nyɛ zyɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ ɛbet,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">nyɛ ɛ́ ndiindel kɔ swooz an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">nyɛ ɛ́ ndiindel kɔ mɔɔ myɛl an<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.5 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zal 9.9</ref></char></char></note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Bhii tak, bɛdjekel eezɛtɔ́. Dáa bɛ nakakum é di tak ɛ, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛsa tyee Yezu nalɛɛ bɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛsik nɛ myɛl an, nɛ swooz an tak Yezu nawaab ɛ. Bɛ moo tin ezɛkɛl bɛ endjookuwa bɔɔ kɔ ekoŋ. Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛdisi kɔ lɔɔ.<figure style="fig" alt="L'anesse et l'anon" file="WA03893b.tif" size="span" loc="21.7" copy="Graham Wade" ref="21.7">Myɛl an nɛ mɔɔ swooz an</figure> <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />É di tak wat, bot ɛbuɛpe naabaazɛdja yɔbɔ endjookuwa gba-gba, bɛdhiiti nadi etsaal yɔbɔ ɛ́, ebhuuz e le étɛp ɛdja é gba. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Ngoŋ bot ɛ nadi ekɛ pɛ sok ɔ, nɛ bot ɛ nakabɛ pɛ bhis ɔ, moo tin ekyeeb: «<char style="sc">Hozana</char> nɛ Mɔn Dhavid! Duu nɛ Zɛɛb! Zɛɛb goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛsɛɛ mot di ezyɛ nɛ din ɛ Ghɛŋ ɔ mbɛɛ mɛtel! <char style="sc">Hozana</char> nɛ Zɛɛb pɛ tɔ gwoo!»<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Dáa Yezu nakani tɔ Yeluzalɛm ɛ, bot djas kɔ dɛl nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ moo nyaa-nyaa, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛdji: «Yenɔk ɛ́ nwyaa mot?» <verse eid="MAT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Mɛdhuu mɛ bot nadi ebɔɔza náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, Yezu mot dɛl Nazalɛt pɛ kyee dik Ghalile.»<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Bhii tak, Yezu naazɛni tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa. Deenek, nyɛ moo tin é sɔ bot ɛ nadi ebɔmsa esesɛɛ bɔɔ ɔ, nɛ bot ɛ nadi ebaabɔm-bɔmak nadi tin ɔ. Nyɛ naawaaz emesa ee bɛ nadi eswoola epata kɔ tak ɛ, nɛ mɛbhóó mɛ bot ɛ nadi ebɔmsa mɛghum ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛbaakaada bɛ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ kwyala tɔ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb náá: “Ndjaŋ'am aadjóoaa ɛ́, ndjaa mendjaala” Mɛ bee ɛ́ ɛkɛɛ, biyɔ, bi eezeliig yɛ, ye moo ɛ́ zɛɛga bot ɛ djii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.13 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Eza 56.7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Zel 7.11</ref></char></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />É di tak wat, bot ɛ nadi nɛ edhim ɔ, nɛ bot ɛ edjam, naazyɛ pɛ daa Yezu tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa, nyɛy zokatsik bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Tin, bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb naazɛkpaa elyem, é ghɛŋ bɛ nabee esesɛɛ binek djas Yezu nasa ɛ. Nɛ dáa bɔɔ dhyeeb nadi etsim tɔ Ndjaa-ebuwa náá: «Duu nɛ Mɔn Dhavid» ɛ! <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Bot binɔk ɛ́ boozɛdji Yezu náá: «Wɔ ɛpegwak dáa bɔɔ dhyeeb di eke'enek é?» Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Iyooo! Mɛ ɛpegwak. Bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààlaa tɔ Mɛkana ɛ Zɛɛb é di nakwyalaa náá: “Tɔ enuub e bɔɔ dhyeeb nɛ bɔɔ etɔlɔɔ, wɔ eelyaal dáa bis di egoka nɛ ɛduwal wɔ ɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.16 <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 8:3">Mɛd 8.3</ref></char></char></note>”?» <verse eid="MAT 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛwyis, tɔ́ pɛ dɛl ɛ Bhetani, pɛ bɛ nakɛdjaasi ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛkal le fiigh di ààdjɛ bhum ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Yak mɛlem, é ghɛŋ bɛ nadi esik pɛ boo dɛl ɛ, wɔ gwaa za zɛmɛt Yezu. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Nyɛ eezɛbee le fiigh é ngwoob gba. Tin, Yezu eezɛtiila si le tak étɛp nyɛ neebɔ́k bhum. Dáa nyɛ nakakum si le ɛ, nyɛ kabela ɛ́ eka nɛ eka, ààbɛ nɛ bhum. É di'enek, Yezu ɛ́ booke nɛ le tak náá: «Kana dwoo pan mos'ak, wɔ aanàkwaakabaawum!» É di tak wat, wɔ gwaa le syee. <verse eid="MAT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Dáa bɛdjekel nabee deenek ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ naadyeebadjoka, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛdji Yezu náá: «Étɛp yé le fiigh zosyee é di wat deenek?» <verse eid="MAT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá: Bi ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ, bi di ààsa mɛso ɔɔ, bi ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛsa esa e mɛbwala dhaa yii mɛ sa nɛ le fiigh'aak. Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, mot ɛ ke nɛ ɛtsok ɛlak: “Ghɛɛa nyel tin, dusa, kɛghaaga tɔ dii mɛsɔn” ɔɔ, yɛ ɛpesael. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Bi ɛ dum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ, esesɛɛ djas bi aawaab tɔ mendjaala ɛ, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waadjɛ bin.»<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛzɛ nadjɛ Yezu eghɛŋ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛni tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa, nyɛ moo tin elyo bot Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. Eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, nɛ bɛpaa ɛ eYuda zokazyɛ pɛ daa lɛ, zɛdji nyɛ náá: «Kɔ eghɛŋ e zɛ wɔ di esa esesɛɛ binek? Ɛzɛ nadjɛ wɔ eghɛŋ e ɛsa deenek?» <verse eid="MAT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bwoodka, mɛ pookodji bin kiya wat. Bi ɛ bɔɔza mɛ ɔɔ, yɛ ɛ́ mɛ aakalɛɛ bin kɔ eghɛŋ e zɛ mɛ di esa esesɛɛ bak. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Yɛ ɛ́ ɛzɛ nadhis Zaŋ, nyɛ zɛduu bot Zɛɛb? Ye nabɛ ɛ́ Zɛɛb ohoo, ye nabɛ ɛ́ mot?» É di'enek, bɛ moo tin esɔs pak'ɔɔ. Bɔɔ náá: «Mena ɛ keka nenak náá: “Yɛ ɛ́ Zɛɛb” ɔɔ, nyɛ waadji mena náá: “Étɛp yé bi nadi ààmyaal Zaŋ?” <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Mena ɛ kakeka nenak náá: “Yɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ nadhis nyɛ” ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́ náá, mena kaab ɛdhuu ɛ bot, etɛɛ náá, bɛ dyeebake ɛ́ náá, Zaŋ nabɛ ɛ́ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb.» <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ Yezu náá: «Bis ààgu.» Tin, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Dɔɔ nɛ mam pe, mɛ aanàkwaalɛɛ bin kɔ eghɛŋ e zɛ mɛ di esa esesɛɛ bak.»<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kana bɔn bá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />Yezu eebaazɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Kana yak kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ bin yé? Motom ngɔt nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bɔn bɛbá. Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ yii mɛgwyak náá: “Mɔn'am, é dwoo lak mos, tɔ́ kɛsa mɛsa tɔ pyeeb vin'am.” <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Nyɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ sɛɛg: “Hooo, mɛ aanàkwaatɔ́.” Ba ɛwala eezɛdhaa bhii tak, mɔn'enɔk eezɛdjɛ lyem mɛbɛ, tin, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ nyel, tɔ́ pɛ pyeeb vin sɛɛg nalwom nyɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Wɔ gwaa, sɛɛg'ɔɔ baazɛlwom nwyak dhiiti mɔn. Mɔn tak eezɛmyaal: “Iyooo, ghɛŋ mɛ waatɔ́.” Bhii tak, nyɛ kadi ɛ́, ààtɔ́. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Tin, tɔ bɔn binɔk bɛbá, ɛzɛ looba dum nɛ lwomel sɛɛg'ɔɔ?» Bɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ Yezu náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ mɔn mɛgwyak.» Tin, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, bɛnɔŋel ɛ epata e lapo nɛ boa ɛ mɛzɔ ɛ́ waaleeni tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb ɛsok nɛ nen. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Etɛɛ náá, Zaŋ Nduuel-bot nazyɛ ɛ́ zɛlyaal bin ze epiki, bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààmyaal nyɛ. Tin, bɛnɔŋel ɛ epata e lapo nɛ boa ɛ mɛzɔ naamyaal nyɛ. Bela náá, dáa bi naabee yɛ ɛ, bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààliig elyem bin, bi ààpakomyaal-myaalak nyɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kana bot ɛ mɛsa na mbee elyem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />«Gwakeka dhiiti kana. Mot ngɔt naabɛ pyeeb vin. Nyɛ eezɛpeeb pyeeb tak, pu guk tɔ ɛkok é di bɛ aadi esyal mɛdii mɛ bhum tak ɔ, baasum ndjaa, étɛp bot aadi ebaal pyeeb ɔ. É di tak, nyɛ eezɛdjɛ bot ɛ di egu mɛsa mɛ vin ɔ étɛp bɛ neesa mɛsa tɔ tak. Nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ nyel, tɔ́ mɛdjoŋ. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Tin, mbu epyeeb e tak di ewum ɛ, yɛ eezɛkum. Wɔ gwaa, nakuma pyeeb zokazɛlwom bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ pɛ daa bot ɛ nyɛ nalik bɛ nɛ pyeeb ɔ, étɛp bɛ needjɛ nyɛ yɛ pak vin bɛ bela ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Wɔ gwaa, bot ɛ nalik nɛ pyeeb ɔ, zokazɛmɛt bɛ, bɛ eezɛduma ngɔt é nyel nɛ mɛbin, bɛ eenɔɔ nwyak gó nyɛ, zɛnɔɔ nwyak tak, bɛ eezɛwus nyɛ nɛ mɛkok, gó nyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Bhii tak, nakuma pyeeb ɛ́ boozɛkyeed bot-mɛsa ɛbuɛpe dhaa bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ nyɛ nalwom sok ɔ pɛ pyeeb tak, bɛ nabaazosa nɛ nɔɔ ɛ́ deenek. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Bhii tak, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛlwom mɔn'ɛ met. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ geka náá: “Bot binɔk ɛ́ waamyaal nyɛ nɛ ɛdjɛ nyɛ duu, etɛɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ mɔn'ɛ met.” <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Dáa bot ɛ di esa mɛsa tɔ pyeeb'ɛ nabee mɔn'enɔk ɛ, bɔɔ náá: “Yaweee! Beeka mot aalik nɛ mɛvu mak djas ɔ! Djhookɛgóka nyɛ. Tin, mɛvu mak aakadi ɛ́, yenabɛlka.” <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛmɛt nyɛ, mwas nyɛ bhii pyeeb vin, bɛ eezɛgó nyɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />Yezu ɛ́ boozɛdji bɛ náá: «É di'enek, é sok nakuma pyeeb vin aakazyɛ ɛ, nyɛ goka nɛ ɛsa bot binɔk dáa?» <verse eid="MAT 21:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Yala yɔbɔ kabɛ ɛ́ náá: «Ye goka ɛ́, nakuma pyeeb gó bot ɛ nadi esa mɛsa tɔ pyeeb vin'ɛ ɔ, ààgek bɛ ghoŋ. Bhii tak, da nyɛ ɛ́ nɔɔ pyeeb'ɛ, djɛ nɛ bot ɛ sis, bot aazɛdjɛ nyɛ yɛ pak ɛkɛɛ é ɛwala di egoka nɛ ɛdjɛaa nyɛ ɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />É di'enek, Yezu ɛ́ booke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi dinaa ààpalaa mɛkpa mak tɔ Ekwyala e Zɛɛb é?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">“Ɛkok ɛ bɛsumel mwas ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">ye moo ɛ́ ɛkok ɛ di epyet ndjaŋ ɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Yɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛ Ghɛŋ ɛ nyɛ moo deenek. Ye tok tin mbyok é mis menaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.42 <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Mɛd 118.22-23</ref></char></char></note>!”»<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />Yezu eebaazɛkɛl náá: «Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, bi ɛ́ waadɛkaa Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb, étɛp ye needjɛaa nɛ bot ɛ mbyak aadi edjɛ bhum ɔ. [<verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Mot aaduma kɔ ɛkok ɛ tak ɔ, nyɛ waabik ekyes-ekyes. Yɛ kabɛ náá, ɛkok ɛ kakwyit kɔ mot ɔɔ, mot tak aatwaalel ɛ́ twaalela.]»<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Gwaka bɛ nagwak kana tak ɛ, eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, nɛ eFalizyɛ nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ eegu náá, Yezu nalii ɛ́ nɛ nɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛkan ɛsaa mɛpek étɛp bɛ neemɛt nyɛ. Bɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ bwoo ekaab mɛdhuu mɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ. Bot ɛ tak nake ɛ́ náá, Yezu ɛ́ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s1">Kana ɛbyoŋ ɛ ɛba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Yezu eebaazɛkan ɛlii nɛ bot tɔ kana. Nyɛy náá: <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />«Beeka sa di enɔŋel nɛ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ: Dhiiti mɛkoozi naazɛdjóo ɛbyoŋ étɛp ɛba ɛ mɔn. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Yɛ ɛ́ nyɛ kazɛlwom bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ, bɛ kɛdjóo bot étɛp ɛdɛ edee ɛbyoŋ ɛ ɛba. Tin, bot ɛ tak ààpakakwyɛl ɛzyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Bhii yenek, nyɛ eebaazɛlwom bɛdhiiti bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ é yak kɔkɔ nɛ bhaadal náá, bɛ kɛlɛɛ bot náá: “Edee moo ɛ́ ndjaaba. Mɛ eezetsak engɔmbɛ nɛ etaa bam na mɛdɛl. Esa djas moo ɛ́ koobela. Dha dɛka ɛbyoŋ.” <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Tin, bot ɛ nadjóoaa ɔ, ààkobis-bisak. Mot nɛ mot naaghɛɛ yɛ nyel, tɔ́ mɛze mɛ. Nwyak tɔ́ pɛ pyeeb'ɛ, nwyak tɔ́ pɛ nyɛ di ebɔmsa esa bɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />Bak bot zokazɛmɛt bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ kukuma yenɔk nalwom ɔ, duma bɛ é mɛnyel nɛ mɛbin, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛgó bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Mɛkoozi zokazɛkpaa lyem: nyɛ ɛ́ bookazɛlwom esodja bɛ, bɛ gó bot ɛ nagó bot bɛ ɔ. Bhii tak, da bɛ ɛ́ dik eghaada bɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />É di'enek, nyɛ eezɛlɛɛ bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ náá: “Edee e ɛbyoŋ ɛ ɛba moo ɛ́ koobela. Bot ɛ djóoaa bɛ zɛdɛ ɔ, ààkɔa nɛ ɛdɛ edee e tak. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Wyiska, da bi ɛ́ tɔ́ kɔ eboo egba. Djóoka mot djas bi aaboma nɛ nɔɔ ɔ, bɛ zɛdɛ edee e ɛbyoŋ ɛ ɛba.” <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Bot ɛ mɛsa zokazɛtɔ́ egba nɛ egba, kɛdjóo bot djas bɛ aaboma nɛ nɔɔ ɔ, bɛmbee ɛ bot nɛ bɛmbɛɛ ɛ bot. Tin, koo ndjaa bɛ nakoobal étɛp ɛbyoŋ ɛ naalwood “kpep”.<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />Tin, mɛkoozi eezɛni tɔ koo tak, étɛp nyɛ neekabee bot ɛ zyɛ zɛdɛ edee ɛbyoŋ ɔ. É di'enek, nyɛ kabee kuku bot ɛ́ dhiiti mot ààbɛ nɛ kaad di egoka nɛ ɛbɔtaa é mɛbyoŋ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Nyɛ ɛ́ boodji nyɛ náá: “Mɔɔ sɔ'am, wɔ ni wak dáa, wɔy ààbɛ nɛ kaad bot di egoka nɛ ɛbɔt étɛp ɛ ɛbyoŋ ɛ?” Tin, mot'enɔk kadi ɛ́, ààbɔɔza kiya mɛkoozi menɔk. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Tinaak, mɛkoozi eezɛlwom bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ náá: “Mɛtka mot'enɔk, da bi ɛ́ kɔl nyɛ mɛko nɛ mɛmbɔ. Bhii tak, da bi ɛ́ mwas nyɛ pɛ kel, tɔ ghooghom. Penek aadi ɛ́ mɛgwyɛ nɛ ɛkwaal ɛ mɛtsok.”»<verse eid="MAT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Yezu eebaazɛbil náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, bot ɛbuɛpe ɛ́ waadjóoaa. Tin, bot aasɛ́ɛaa ɔ, bɛ ààdyeebabu.»<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Efute e lapo nɛ mɛkoozi Sezaad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />EFalizyɛ zokakɛboma étɛp ɛdjek dáa bɛ di egoka nɛ ɛsa, bɛ neekwyesal Yezu nɛ mɛdjin étɛp nyɛ neebela ndjɛ kɔ mɛkpa mɛ met ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛkyeed bɛdhiiti bɛdjekel bɔɔ, nɛ bot ɛ zɛɛga ɛ mɛkoozi Eelood, bɛ zɛlɛɛ nɛ Yezu náá: «Lyoel, bis nɛ gu náá, etɛp ee wɔ di elɛɛ ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ etsɛɛtsɛ. Wɔ lyo bot ɛ́ epiki dáa mot di egoka nɛ ɛkɛ ɛ, dáa Zɛɛb di ekwyɛl ɛ. Wɔ ààbem ba nɛ mot, etɛɛ náá, wɔy ààdyeebagwyák sa bot di esa étɛp bɛ neetela mɛnyel ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Lɛɛa bis, tɔ yɔ egeka dáa wɔ di ebee ɛ: etsi bina lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, bot tuud lapo nɛ mɛkoozi Sezaad, Bis tuud ohoo, bis nàtuud?»<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Dáa Yezu nadi egu mbee mɛpek mɔɔ ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bot ɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si! Étɛp yé bi di ekwyɛl ɛwa mɛ tɔ mɛbhowal? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Pookolyaalka mɛ dhenye wat bot di etuud lapo nɛ yɛ ɛ, étɛp mɛ neebee.» Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛzyɛ nyɛ nɛ mɔɔ pata wat. <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Bhii tak, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛdji bɛ náá: «Kɔ ghwooz'ak, ye lulaa ɛbhwoob ɛ zɛ? Yɛ ɛ́ din ɛ zɛ di kwyala kɔ tak?» <verse eid="MAT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Bot binɔk eezɛbɔɔza nɛ Yezu náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ yɛ mɛkoozi Sezaad.» Tin, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Djɛka Sezaad sa di náá yɛ ɛ́ yɛ Sezaad ɛ, da bi ɛ́ djɛ Zɛɛb sa di náá, yɛ ɛ́ yɛ Zɛɛb ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Gwaka bɛ nagwak eyala ɛ Yezu deenek ɛ́, ye nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ naadyeebadjoka ɛlyelɛpe. Bhii tak, bɛ boozɛnɔɔ mɛnyel, tɔ́ yɔbɔ.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛdjin dum nɛ tɛp ɛgom bhis ɛsyee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Dwoo tak wat, bɛdhiiti eSaduseɛ zokazyɛ pɛ daa Yezu. ESaduseɛ ɛ́, bot ɛ di eke náá, bot aanàkwaagom bhis ɛsyee ɔ. Bɛ eezɛdji kiya, <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />bɔɔ nɛ Yezu náá: «Lyoel, mɛkana ɛ Moiiz lɛɛ ɛ́ náá: “Mot ɛ gwyɛ ààlik mɔn ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́ náá, dhyeeb mot lik ɔ, ba kus myɛl étɛp nyɛ neekwyiida tel gwyɛ ɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.24 <char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 25:5-6">Dɛt 25.5-6</ref></char></char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Bela tin, tɔ lɔɔg'es, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg bɛtɛn nɛ bɛbá. Mɔn mɛgwyak eezɛba moma, tin, nyɛ eezɛgwyɛ, ààlik mɔn. Nyɛ kalik kus myɛl nadi ààbɛ nɛ mɔn ɔ nɛ dhyeeb. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Mot na bhɔɔba mɔn mɛgwyak ɔ, kanɔɔ moma bhii koŋ'ɛ. Nyɛy eebaakpaa nɛ mɛsyee, gwyɛ, ààlik mɔn. Tyee wat nɛ mot elɛl. Tin, bɔɔ djas bɛtɛn nɛ bɛbá kadi ɛ́, ààbya nɛ moma yenɔk. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Bhis ɛsyee ɛ bɔɔ djas, moma eebaazɛkpaa nɛ mɛsyee, gwyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Dwoo bot aagom bhis ɛsyee ɛ, moma yenɔk tin aakadi mwaa zɛ pak bɔɔ bɛtɛn nɛ bɛbá? Etɛɛ náá, bɔɔ djas nabɛ ɛ́ botom bɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi ɛ́ tɔ ɛdjak, etɛɛ náá, bi ààsiiza ɛnyɔɛpe sa di kwyala tɔ Mɛkana ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. Baanɔɔ náá, bi ààgu ghwyil ɛ Zɛɛb! <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Etɛɛ náá, é ghɛŋ bot aagom bhis ɛsyee ɛ, botom aanàkwaakabaaba boa. Boa pe ààkwaani mɛba, etɛɛ náá, bot djas aakadi ɛ́, dáa efofop tɔ gwoo. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Dum nɛ tɛp ɛgom bhis ɛsyee, bi dinaa ààpalaa sa Zɛɛb lɛɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɛ? Nyɛ naake ɛ́: <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />“Yɛ ɛ́ mam, Zɛɛb ɛ Abalaam, nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ Izak, nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ Zakɔɔb<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.32 <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Ɛwy 3.6</ref></char></char></note>.”» Yezu eebaazɛke náá: «Zɛɛb tok Zɛɛb bot ɛ zegwyɛ ɔ. Nyɛ ɛ́ Zɛɛb bot ɛ di nɛ tsik ɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́, mɛlyo mɛ tak naadyeebakwyɛsa tɔ elyem e mɛdhuu mɛ bot ɛ nadi egwak nyɛ ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsi di edhaa etsi djas ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Dáa eFalizyɛ nagwak náá, Yezu naadiyal eSaduseɛ enuub ɛ, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛsɛɛga. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Dhiiti lyoel etsi e Zɛɛb naazɛkwyɛl ɛbowal Yezu. Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />«Lyoel, yaa tsi di edhaa etsi djas?»<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Yezu kabɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «“Wɔ goka ɛ́, wɔ kwyɛl Ghɛŋ Zɛɛb'ɔ, nɛ lyem'ɔ djas, nɛ sisim'ɔ djas, nɛ mɛtselal mɔ djas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.37 <char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Dɛt 6.5</ref></char></char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Yenek ɛ́ di boo tsi. Yɛ ɛ́ tsi di edhaa etsi djas ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Gwaka tsi di ebhɔɔba yii mɛkɛn ɛ: “Wɔ goka ɛ́, wɔ kwyɛl sɔ'ɔ mot dáa wɔ di ekwyɛl nyel'ɔ met ɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.39 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 19:18">Mɛs 19.18</ref></char></char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Etsi ɛ Moiiz djas nɛ mɛlyo mɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb pyet ɛ́ kɔ etsi binek ebá.»<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Klisto ɛ́ mɔn zɛ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Efalizyɛ nadi ɛ́, tɔ yɔbɔ zɛɛga. Yezu ɛ́ boozɛdji bɛ náá: <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />«Tɔ yebɔ egeka, Mɛsia ɛ́ zɛ?» Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Nyɛ ɛ́ dha ɛ mɛkoozi Dhavid.» <verse eid="MAT 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />É di'enek, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Ye nakosa dáa náá, Dhavid nɛ ghwyil Sisim na Dɛɛ djóo nyɛ “Ghɛŋ”? Etɛɛ náá, Dhavid naake náá:<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />“Ghɛŋ Zɛɛb nake nɛ Ghɛŋ'am ɛ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">Dha disi pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ bam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">Mɛ aalwom bot ɛ mɛbhuka mɔ lwoma bhel náá,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">bɛ zɛdhaa si mɛko mɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.44 <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Mɛd 110.1</ref></char></char></note>.”<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Yɛ bɛ náá, Dhavid nyɛ ɛmet naadjóo nyɛ “Ghɛŋ” ɔɔ, é yaa tyɛ Mɛsia aakabaadi dha'ɛ?»<verse eid="MAT 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Bɔɔ djas moo tin kup, ààbɛ nɛ ɛkpa ɛlóo bhis etɛp djas Yezu nalii ɛ. Kana dwoo ɛlenek, bɛ moo ekyee ɛdji ɛ nyɛ ekiya.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛdul bot mɛlɔ dum nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ eFalizyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Wɔ gwaa, Yezu zɛlii nɛ mɛdhuu mɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ, dɔɔ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛsa mɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ eFalizyɛ ɛ́ ɛlyo bot dum nɛ dáa etsi ɛ Moiiz di egoka nɛ ɛkɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛlooba nɛ nɔɔ, da bi ɛ́ sa esesɛɛ bɛ aalwom bin ɛ, djas. Yɛ kabɛ mɛfulu mɔɔ ɔɔ, sa mot ààsa dáa bɔɔ. Etɛɛ náá, bɛ ààsa esesɛɛ ee bɛ di elyo bot ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Bɛ ɛpekaŋal mɛkɔm mɛ na dil-dil di ɛlyelɛpe é ɛbɛp ɛ, bɛ kakɛl ɛ́ kɔ mɛbyak mɛ bot. É di'enek, bɛ kadi ɛ́, ààkwyɛl ɛkokee-keeak nɛ djin bɛ neekogek mɛdil mɛ mɛkɔm mɛ tak. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Bɛ sa esesɛɛ bɔɔ djas ɛ́, étɛp bɛ neetela mɛnyel. Deenek, yɛ kabɛ Ekwyala ee Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb bɛ di ebɛk é ebhata-bhwoob bɔɔ nɛ é mɛmbɔ mɔɔ ɔɔ, bɛ sa epɛk e tak ɛ́ ɛbɔkɛpe. Yɔbɔ ekel ee di lataa kɔ ekaad nɛ elɔbɔ bɔɔ ɛ nɛ dyeebadjaa dhaa tyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Tɔ mɛbyoŋ, bɛ dyeebakwyɛl ɛdisi ɛ́ kɔ mɛbhóó mɛ koobelaa étɛp bot ɛ duu ɔ. Yɛ kabɛ tɔ́ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda ɔɔ, <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />bɛ dyeebakwyɛl ɛ́ bot swos bɛ nɛ duu kɔ mɛbɛsɛɛ é edi ee bot di esɛɛga ɛbuɛpe ɔ. Bɛ kwyɛl ɛ́, bot djóo bɛ “Lyoel”.<verse eid="MAT 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Yɛ kabɛ biyɔ ɔɔ, nàkeka náá, bi djóoaa “Lyoel”, etɛɛ náá, biyɔ djas ɛ́ bɔn-nyɛɛg ngɔt. Bi ɛ́ nɛ lyoel ngɔt. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Sa mot ààdjóo mot kɔ bɔs'ak “Sɛɛg'es” etɛɛ náá, sɛɛg'en ɛ́ ngɔt, mot di pɛ tɔ gwoo ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Nàkwyɛlka náá, bot djóo bin “Kukuma” etɛɛ náá, kukuma yen ɛ́ ngɔt, Mɛsia. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Mot di boo-mot lɔɔg ɔ, ye goka ɛ́ nyɛ di tyee mot-mɛsa mɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Mot di eghɛɛ nyel tɔ bɛsɔ ɔ, nyɛ waasilaa. Mot di esil nyel tɔ bɛsɔ ɔ, nyɛ waabenaa.»<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu ɛpelyaal mɛkɔŋ mɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ eFalizyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />«Haaa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ nen, biyɔ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ eFalizyɛ, bot ɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si! Bi ɛpediyal bot ɛbɛ ɛ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɔ. Biyɔ bɛmet, bi aanàkwaani. Tin, bi ààkwyɛl náá, bot ɛ di ekwos ɛni ɔ, bɛ ni tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ tak.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 23:13">[<verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />Haaa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ nen, biyɔ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ eFalizyɛ, bot ɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si! Bi ɛpedɛk bɛkus ɛ boa esa bɔɔ djas. É di tak wat, bi nɛ kwyɛl ɛdul ɛ mendjaala na kpɔkɔlɔm, étɛp ɛtela mɛnyel tɔ bot. Étɛp tak ɛ di náá, bi aapɛ́ɛaa ɛ́ epɛ́ɛ wat di na lyel-lyel, ààbɛ nɛ ghoŋ ɛ!]<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />Haaa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ nen, biyɔ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ eFalizyɛ, bot ɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si! Bi nɛ tɔ́ mɛdjoŋ é edi djas kɔ bɔs nɛ kɔ eboo mɛdhii mɛ mɛsɔn, étɛp ɛsaa náá, mot ngɔt myaal ɛdjaala Zɛɛb eYuda. Tin, bi ɛ bela mot ɛ du bin ɔɔ, bi kaliig yiizaag mot ɛ, nyɛ di mot di egoka nɛ ɛkɛdyak tɔ du na kɔm-kɔm dhaa-dhaŋak biyɔ bɛmet.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />Haaa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ biyɔ bot ɛ edhim di edjɛɛd bot ɔ. Bi dyeebalɛɛ ɛ́ náá: “Mot ɛ tuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ kɔ Ndjaa-ebuwa ɔɔ, yɛ aanàsa sonok. Nyɛ katuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ kɔ lɔɔd di tɔ Ndjaa-ebuwa ɔɔ, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛsa sa nyɛ tuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Bi ɛ́ endjemet e bot, bot ɛ edhim! Ɛyé di edhaa mɛtaŋ tin, yɛ ɛ́ lɔɔd ohoo, Ndjaa-ebuwa di edjɛ lɔɔd edɛɛ ɔ?<verse eid="MAT 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Bi baalɛɛ ɛ́ náá: “Mot ɛ tuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ kɔ mesa-ebuwa ɔɔ, yɛ aanàsa sonok. Nyɛ katuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ kɔ buwa di kɔ mesa-ebuwa tak ɔɔ, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛsa sa nyɛ tuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Biyɔ bot ɛ edhim! Ɛyé di edhaa mɛtaŋ tin, esa e buwa ohoo, nɛghu mesa-ebuwa di esa náá, esa e buwa di tɔ edɛɛ ɛ? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Yɛ bɛ náá, mot eetuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ kɔ mesa-ebuwa ɔɔ, nyɛ tuwal yɛ ɛ́ kɔ mesa-ebuwa dɔɔ nɛ kɔ esa e buwa di ekaa kɔ mesa ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Mot ɛ di etuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ mɛ kɔ Ndjaa-ebuwa ɔɔ, nyɛ tuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ mɛ tak ɛ́ dɔɔ nɛ kɔ din ɛ Zɛɛb mot di tɔ ndjaa tak ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Mot di etuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ, da nyɛ ɛ́ nɔɔ gwoo dáa tyaasɛs ɔɔ, nyɛ tuwal yɛ ɛ́ kɔ bóó mɛkoozi ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ din ɛ Zɛɛb, mot di kɔ tak ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />Haaa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ nen, biyɔ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ eFalizyɛ, bot ɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si! Bi dyeebakwyɛl ɛ́ ɛtuud Zɛɛb nɛ ndyaal wat tɔ endyaal kam e nadjeebe nɛ eka e na mbɛɛ mɛnuub zɛnɔɔ aghomkɔtɔ. Tin, bi kadhuugal ɛ́ etɛtɛ mɛlyo mɛ di nɛ boo mɛsuk tɔ etsi ɛ. Mɛlyo mɛ tak ɛ́: epiki, enɛm esa, nɛ ɛkɛ dáa Zɛɛb di ekwyɛl ɛ. Yenek djas ɛ́ sa di egoka náá, bot du mɛlu djas nɛ zii, ààbet dhiiti sonok ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Biyɔ, bɛdjɛɛdel ɛ na edhim! Bi ɛpesyal mɛnyok men ekaab náá, ba mɔɔ kuŋ ɛ́ zɛkɛdhaa tɔ tak, ghuna bi ɛpemin boo yaaga bal!<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />Haaa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ nen, biyɔ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ eFalizyɛ, bot ɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si! Bi gwyii ɛ́ ekoŋ e ebɛɛlɛ nɛ ekoŋ e esaan. Tin, pɛ tɔ emɔ tak kadi ɛ́ tɔɔɔ nɛ esa e djii nɛ embee mɛkwosak men. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Biyɔ eFalizyɛ, bot ɛ edhim! Pookogwyiika sok tɔ mɔ bɛɛlɛ. Tin, pɛ koŋ tak ɛ́ waadi dɛɛ.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />Haaa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ nen, biyɔ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ eFalizyɛ, bot ɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si! Bi ɛ́ dáa mɛvit mɛ nasumaa ɛnyɔɛpe, da lɔɔbaa ɛpyaab ɛ. Enɛm e tak nyen ɛ́ pɛ kel é mis mɛ bot, ghuna tɔ tak, yɛ ɛ́ ɛbyok ɛ egwyes di ààbɛ nɛ tsik ɛ, nɛ membi mɛ dhiiti esonok di nɛ edhuud ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Yɛ ɛ́ dáa biyɔ, bot ɛ di ebee bin ɔ, bɛ ke ɛ́ náá, bi ɛ́ bot ɛ epiki. Ghuna pɛ tɔ len, yɛ ɛ́ tɔɔɔ nɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si, nɛ embee esesɛɛ.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />Haaa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ nen, biyɔ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ eFalizyɛ, bot ɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si! Bi ɛpesum embɛɛ mɛvit étɛp bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. Bi ɛpekoobal nɛ ɛsɔn ɛ́ mɛvit mɛ bot ɛ epiki. <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />Bi dyeebake ɛ́ náá: “Mena ɛpedi ɛ́ dika é ghɛŋ bɛbhaab binaka ɔɔ, pe mena nabɛ ɛ́ ààgwakel nɛ nɔɔ étɛp ɛgó ɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb.” <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Deenek, bi ɛpemyaal biyɔ bɛmet náá, bot ɛ nadi egó bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ nabɛ ɛ́ bɛbhaab bin. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Ɛbɛsɛɛ'enek tsabidibila, belaka, duka ko bɛbhaab bin nalik bin yɛ ɛ. Silalka mɛsa mɛ bɛ nakan ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Biyɔ bɛnyɔ, mbyak mɛgel! Bi aasa dáa étɛp bi needi ààbela feŋ du na kɔm-kɔm?<verse eid="MAT 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Gwakeka mɛ ɛnyɔɛpe: mɛ waadhis bin bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, bɛtsoŋ ɛ bot, nɛ bɛtɛtɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi. Bi ɛ́ waagó bɛdhiiti, bi ɛ́ waabem bɛdhiiti é mɛlaaba. Bi ɛ́ waanyuu bɛdhiiti nɛ eghwyɛs tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda men. Bi ɛ́ waadu bɛ nɛ swaka eghaada nɛ eghaada étɛp bi neegó bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Tinaak, guka náá, ɛbiyo djas bot di esa kɔ bot ɛ epiki kana dwoo ɛsyee ɛ Abhɛl mot epiki, kɛyaka nɛ yɛ Zakaali mɔn ɛ Bhaalaki bi nagó pak Di na Dɛɛ ɛ Ghɛŋ nɛ mesa-ebuwa ɔ, yɛ waabulelaa kɔ len. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, esesɛɛ binek djas kwyɛ kɔ elo e kɔkɔ bot ɛ mɛbyel mɛ bot ɛ dika mos'aak.»<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eedje kɔ ɛsu ɛ ghaada Yeluzalɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />«Yeluzalɛm! Yeluzalɛm wɔy mot di egó bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, wɔy mot di egó bot ɛ Zɛɛb, di edhis wɔ bak nɛ mɛkok ɔ. É sok edhen mɛ di ekwyɛl ɛsɛɛg bot ɛ di kɔ dɛl ɛ lɔ dáa nabwa-kuu di esɛɛg bɔn bɛ si mɛbhap mɛ ɛ, biyɔ ààkwyɛl! <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Deenek guka náá, ndjaŋ'en ɛ́ waalik wum! <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, bi aanàkabaabee mɛ, kana dwoo pan mos'ak, kɛyaka nɛ dwoo bi aake náá: “Mɛnyɔ nɛ mot aazyɛ nɛ din ɛ Ghɛŋ ɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.39 <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Mɛd 118.26</ref></char></char></note>!”»<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu eelɛɛ náá, Ndjaa-ebuwa ɛ́ waawaazel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Dáa Yezu nadi ewyis tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa ɛ, bɛdjekel eezɛtiila pɛ daa lɛ, étɛp bɛ neelyaal nyɛ zumal Ndjaa-ebuwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Tin, Yezu eezɛlii nɛ nɔɔ, nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi ɛpebee esa djas di tin ɛ? Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, yɛ aanàkabaalik é di yak ɛkok ɛ wat kɛla kɔ sɔ ɛkok é ndjaa bi di bee'aak. Etɛɛ náá, djas aadi ɛ́, bik, waazel, see é bɔs.»<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mezuk nɛ mɛtiiga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Yezu eezɛdisi kɔ ɛtsok ɛ pyeeb oliv, bɛdjekel eezɛtiila é ngwoob'ɛ. Bɔɔ nɛ nɛ náá: «Lɛɛa bis esesɛɛ binek aasael den? Lyaala bis endem e bis aagu náá, wɔ moo kɔ nɛ ɛbula nɛ náá, bɔs moo ɛ́ kɔ ɛsi ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Dika nɛ etsoŋ, sa mot ààkɔɔ bin. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Etɛɛ náá, bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ́ waazyɛ nɛ din ɛ lam. Bɛ waalɛɛ bin náá: “Yɛ ɛ́ mam ɛ di Klisto!” Bɛ waasa náá, bot ɛbuɛpe kat ɛdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Bi ɛ́ waagwak bot elii etɛp e mɛɛb é ngwoob'en nɛ menduk mɛ mɛɛb mɛ di pɛ ɛtseta ɛ. Sa mot ààbem ba etɛɛ náá, ye goka ɛ́, esesɛɛ binek sɛ́ɛ. Tin, guka náá, yenek tok mɛsi mɛ bɔs. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Dhiiti mbyak ɛ́ waaghɛɛ, kɛlumla dɛɛb nɛ yak mbyak. Dhiiti ɛyoŋ ɛ́ waakɛghɛɛ, kɛlumla dɛɛb nɛ yak ɛyoŋ. É bɛdhiiti edi, bɔs ɛ́ waakuu, pwom edee ɛ́ waani kɔ mɛl. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Mɛzel menek djas aadi ɛ́ dáa endem e mɛkɛn ɛsuula ɛbyel ɛ mɔn. <verse eid="MAT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />Bot ɛ́ waakɛpit bin, étɛp bi neezukaa. Tin bot ɛ́ waagó bin. Membyak djas ɛ́ waabhina bin kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />É sok'enek, bot ɛbuɛpe ɛ́ waakat ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. Bot ɛ́ waapitel pak'ɔɔ. Bɛdhiiti ɛ́ waabhina bɛsɔ bɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Bɛtɛ nɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb yii mɛkɔŋ ɛ́ waatuula, bɛ waakɔɔ bot ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Dáa ye di náá, embee esa ɛ́ waazɛdhaa tɔ elyem e bot ɛ, kwyɛl tɔ elyem e bot ɛbuɛpe ɛ́ waatyaala. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Tin, mot aakɛ nɛ ɛwa zii, kɛkum pɛ ɛsik ɔ, nyɛ waabela tsik. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Mbɛɛ Bhaadal dum nɛ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb aadi ɛ́ egoolel kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs nɛ tɔ membyak djas, étɛp bot djas di ààgu Zɛɛb ɔ neegwak yɛ. Bhii tak ɛ ɛsi ɛ bɔs aakakum.»<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Boo mezuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />«É ghɛŋ bi aabee “etɛp e ɛpes nɛ puluk”, yii ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Dhanyɛl nalɛɛ ɛ, yɛ eezebe di tɔ Di na Dɛɛ ɔ, ye goka ɛ́ bot ɛ di egu ɛlaa mɛkana ɔ tiibal ɛnyɔɛpe! <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />Étɛp tak ɛ di náá, bot aadi pɛ kyee dik Yude ɔ, kan kaab, tɔ́ pɛ tɔ mɛtsok. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Mot aadi kɔ mii ndjaŋ ɔ nàbaasul pɛ si zɛni tɔ ndjaa étɛp ɛkɛnɔɔ sonok. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Mot aadi tɔ pyeeb ɔ, nàbaasik pɛ dɛl, kɛnɔɔ ndjookuwa yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Haaa kpaa-ghoŋ dwoo lenek nɛ boa aadi nɛ mɛbum ɔ, zɛnɔɔ boa aadi nɛ bɔn edɛ mɛbel dwoo lɛɛg ɔ! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Djaalaka nɛ Zɛɛb étɛp, bi ɛ́ zɛkɛwyis ekaab é mbu kwol, nɛghu é dwoo saba! <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Etɛɛ náá, é ɛwala tak aadi ɛ́ ɛwala mezuk, mezuk mɛ wat di náá, ye dinaa ààpabeeaa, kana bɔs nakusel ɛ, kɛyaka nɛ dwoo pan mos'ak. Yɛ aanàkwaakabaabɛ nɛ mbi mezuk deenek. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Zɛɛb ɛpedi ààsa náá, mɛlu mɛ tak di ààdyeebabɔya ɔ, pe ye tok nɛ mot aatsak. Yɛ ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ bot ɛ nyɛ nazesɛ́ɛ ɔ, mɛlu mɛ mezuk menek di ba bim. <verse eid="MAT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />Dhiiti mot ɛ lɛɛ bin náá: “Beeka Mɛsia di wak é!” nɛghu nyɛ kalɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá: “Mɛsia ɛ́ poon!” ɔɔ, sa mot ààmyaal nyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Etɛɛ náá, bɛmɛsia mɛ etsal nɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb yii mɛkɔŋ ɛ́ waatuula ɛbuɛpe. Bɛ waasa etɛp e mɛbwala nɛ bɛmɛvyɛkɛlɛ ɛbuɛpe étɛp bɛ neekɔɔ bot, dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ Zɛɛb nazesɛ́ɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Gwakeka, mɛ dul bin mɛlɔ ɛsok nɛ esesɛɛ binek kum tɔ len.<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />Yɛ bɛ náá, bɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá: “Beeka, nyɛ ɛ́ pɛ tɔ bal!” ɔɔ, nàtɔ́ka. Nɛghu bɛ kalɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá: “Beeka, nyɛ eesɔwa wak!” Sa mot ààmyaal, nyɛ tok tin. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Dáa ngwyes bhi di ekas tɔ gwoo ɛ, dus pɛ ɛdjem ɛ dwoo, kɛtɔ́ pɛ ɛbil ɛ dwoo ɛ, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aazyɛ ɛ́ deenek. <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Enen ee di edjóoaa mɛbɛk <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mɛbɛk </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yɛ ɛ́ enen di edɛ epuud ɔ.</char></note> ɛ di ekii tɔ gwoo ɔ, keka náá, muu tit ɛ́ tin.»<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛbula ɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />«Ààbɔya batsa bhii ɛwala ɛ mezuk menek aadhaŋ ɛ, bi ɛ́ waabee náá, gwyes ɛ́ waagwyiid suuut, ngɔn aanàkabaakas, ekwyikwyen ɛ́ waadus tɔ gwoo, bil si, esa e mɛbwala djas di tɔ gwoo ɛ waadheegel. <verse eid="MAT 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Tin, ndem ɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɛ́ waanyen tɔ gwoo. Membyak djas di kɔ bɔs ɛ, yɛ aadi ɛ́, tɔ etsim nɛ mɛgwyɛ. Tin, bɛ waabee Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot esul tɔ eguud e gwoo nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ mɛbwala nɛ duma. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Boo tɔŋ ɛ́ waalɔɔel. Tin, nyɛ waalwom efofop pɛ é edum e bɔs djas, bɛ neekɛsɛɛg bot djas Zɛɛb nazesɛ́ɛ ɔ, kana pɛ yak edum e gwoo, kɛyaka nɛ pɛ yak edum.»<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo dum nɛ le fiigh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />«Nɔɔka etsoŋ nɛ kana yak, dum nɛ le fiigh. Yɛ bɛ náá, elɛɛ bɛ moo zɛbula ebes ɔɔ, eka moo baakwyil é tak ɔɔ, guka náá, mbu gwyes moo kunaa. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Yɛ ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ biyɔ, é sok bi aabee endem binek moo nyen ɛ, guka náá, ɛbula ɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot moo zɛkunaa. Nyɛ moo ɛ́ é ngwoob ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaŋ'en. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, bot ɛ kɔkɔ membu mak aanàkwaagwyɛ djas esonok bak ààsael. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Gwoo nɛ bɔs ɛ́ waadum, yɛ kabɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ, yɛ aalik ɛ́ kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm.»<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zɛɛb nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet ɛ́ di egu ɛwala ɛ mɛsik mɛ bɔs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />«Yɛ kabɛ dum nɛ dwoo nɛ ɛwala ɛ esesɛɛ binek aasael ɛ, ye tok nɛ mot ngɔt di egu, ààkobɛ-bɛak efofop tɔ gwoo, dɔɔ nɛ Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb pe ààgu dwoo tak. Yɛ ɛ́ Sɛɛg nyɛ ɛmet ɛ di gu. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Ɛbula ɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aadi ɛ́, dáa sa nasael é ghɛŋ ɛ Noe ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Etɛɛ náá, é ghɛŋ tak, ɛsok nɛ boo bhyoŋ nɛ zyɛ, bot nadi ɛ́, tɔ mɛmyaala, edɛ edee, edɛ mɛnyok, eba boa, ekyeed mɛsyes mɔɔ é mɛba, kɛkum dwoo Noe nani tɔ mɛsuwa ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />Bot nabɛ ɛ́ ààbis, kɛkum dwoo boo bhyoŋ nazɛsilal bɔɔ djas na bhɛɛɛ ɛ. Yɛ aabaadi ɛ́, deenek dwoo Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aabula ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />É ghɛŋ tak ɛ́ di náá, bot ɛbá ɛ́ waadi tɔ pyeeb, ngɔt ɛ́ waanɔŋaa, nwyak ngɔt ɛ́ waalik. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Boa ɛbá ɛ́ waadi edum bhum tɔ bwak wat, ngɔt ɛ́ waanɔŋaa, nwyak ngɔt ɛ́ waalik.<verse eid="MAT 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Dika nɛ etsoŋ! Bɛɛka mis etɛɛ náá, bi ààgu dwoo Ghɛŋ'en aaboobula ɛ́. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Gwakeka sa mɛ di elɛɛ ɛ, yɛ bɛ náá, nakuma ndjaŋ ɛpedi egu ɛwala ɛ pum mot djii aazyɛ zɛdjii tɔ ndjaŋ'ɛ ɔɔ, pe nyɛ aanàkwaadja gɔ́, étɛp nyɛ neelu mot djii yenɔk, nyɛ nàni tɔ ndjaŋ'ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Yɛ ɛ́ mɛ di elɛɛ bin náá, bi bɛɛ mis, nàpeebaka, etɛɛ náá, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aatuula ɛ́ é ɛwala bi aadi ààgek náá nyɛ aatuula ɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mot-mɛsa na sosoob nɛ etsoŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />«Ɛzɛ di mot-mɛsa na sosoob nɛ etsoŋ? Yɛ ɛ́ mot-mɛsa kukuma yɛ djɛ nyɛ mɛsa mɛ ɛbaal ɛ bɛsɔ nɛ ɛdjɛ bɛ edee bɔɔ é ɛwala bɛ di egoka nɛ ɛdɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Mɛnyɔ nɛ mot-mɛsa menɔk, mot kukuma yɛ aabula zɛbela nyɛ, nyɛy esa mɛsa mɛ menek ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá: kukuma yenɔk ɛ́ waadjɛ mot-mɛsa menɔk esa bɛ djas nyɛ baal. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Yɛ di mbee mot-mɛsa ɔ, nyɛ aake náá: “Kukuma aanàkwaaleebula.” <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />Deenek, nyɛ aadi ɛ́ ezuk bɛsɔ di esa mɛsa bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ ɔ, nɛ ɛkɛdedɛ bɛmɛnyok bɛ nɛ bot ɛ zegel mɛnyel mɔɔ tɔ mɛnyok ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />Tin, kukuma yɛ aabula ɛ́ é dwoo nyɛ aadi epel náá, nyɛ aanàkwaazyɛ ɛ, é ɛwala mot-mɛsa di ààgu ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Kukuma yenɔk ɛ́ waasɔ mot-mɛsa menɔk. Da nyɛ ɛ́ lyaal nyɛ kyet bɛ di esa nɛ bot ɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si ɛ. Bhii tak, nyɛ ɛ́ zɛzyegal nyɛ pɛ kel pɛ bot ɛ di edje mɛgwyɛ nɛ ɛkwaal ɛ mɛtsok di ɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s1">Kana mɛsyes kam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />«Ɛni tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ́ aadi ɛ́, dáa kana mɛsyes kam nanɔɔ elama bɔɔ, wyis, étɛp bɛ neekɛboma nɛ motom di zɛsa ɛba ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Bɛtɛn pak'ɔɔ nadi ɛ́ endjemet e mɛsyes. Bak bɛtɛn kadi ɛ́ bɛtsoŋ ɛ bɔɔ boa. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Endjemet e mɛsyes menɔk nanɔɔ yɔbɔ elama ɛ́, àànɔɔ petelɔy, nɛ gu yii di tɔ elama ɛ́ waasi. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Yɛ kabɛ mɛsyes mɛ nadi bɛtsoŋ ɔɔ, bhii bɛ nanɔɔ elama ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ naatɔ́ nɛ yak bim petelɔy bɛ nakwom ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Tin, motom kadi ɛ́, ààleetuula. Gɔ́ naazɛsa bɔɔ mɛsyes menɔk, wɔ gwaa, bɔɔ djas zɛkpaa nɛ egɔ́ djaasi.<verse eid="MAT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />É di'enek, wɔ gwaa, boo tuud zokazɛgék kuku ɛgha ɛ pum náá: “Beeka motom ɛba! Kɛbomaka nɛ nɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Tin mɛsyes kam menɔk ɛ́ boozɛdjem, bɛ moo tin ekoobal elama bɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Tin, mɛsyes mɛ nadi endjemet ɔ naazɛke nɛ bɛtsoŋ náá: “Bi ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛbɛk bis ba petelɔy, etɛɛ náá, elama bis ɛpedim.” <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Mɛsyes mɛ nadi bɛtsoŋ ɔ ɛ́ boobɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: “Hooo, ààbɛ! Etɛɛ náá, bim bis di nɛ yɛ ɛ, yɛ aanàkwaadjala menabɛlka djas. Ye nyɔ ɛ́, bi kɛbɔm yebɔ tɔ djando.” <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Tin, endjemet e bɔɔ mɛsyes menɔk eezɛtɔ́, kɛbɔm yɔbɔ petelɔy. Bhii koŋ'ɔɔ, motom ɛba eezɛkum, nyɛ zokanɔŋ ɛ́ bɛtɛn nadi bɛtsoŋ ɔ. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛni nɛ nɔɔ tɔ ndjaa nakoobelaa étɛp ɛba ɛ. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛkɔɔl ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa nɛ ɛngoŋ. <verse eid="MAT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />Bhii ba ɛwala kadhaŋ ɛ, bɛdhiiti bɔɔ mɛsyes menɔk eezɛbula, bɛ moo tin etsim náá: “Ghɛŋ, Ghɛŋ diia bis ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa!” <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Motom ɛba eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: “Mɛ lɛɛ bin nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ ɛ́ náá, mɛ ààgu bin.”» <verse eid="MAT 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Bhii tak, Yezu eebaazɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bɛɛka mis, nàdjaka egɔ́. Dika nɛ etsoŋ etɛɛ náá, bi ààgu dwoo nɛ ɛwala ɛ tak.»<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kana bot ɛ mɛsa bɛlɛl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />«Yɛ aadi ɛ́, dáa dhiiti motom nadi ekwyɛl ɛtɔ́ mɛdjoŋ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛdjóo bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ, da lik bɛ nɛ esa ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛnɔɔ mɛdhɛɛb mɛ lɔɔd ɛtɛn, djɛ mot mɛkɛn. Mot nabɔɔba ɔ, nyɛ kadjɛ nyɛ ɛ́ mɛdhɛɛb mɛ elɔɔd ebá. Mot nazyɛ bhii mot bhɔɔba ɔ, nyɛ kadjɛ nyɛy ɛ́ ɛdhɛɛb lɔɔd wat. Nyɛ zokadjɛ mot nɛ mot ɛ sa di edjala nɛ ghwyil'ɛ ɛ, bhii tak nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Mot-mɛsa nabela mɛdhɛɛb mɛ lɔɔd ɛtɛn eezɛtɔ́ yɛ kɛliig mɛmbɔ nɛ lɔɔd'enek. Wɔ gwaa nyɛ baazɛbela mɛdhɛɛb mɛ lɔɔd ɛtɛn kɔ yii nyɛ nadjɛaa sok ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Yɛ ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ mot nabela mɛdhɛɛb mɛmbá ɔ, nyɛ nabaasa yɛ ɛ́ dáa mot ɛsok nasa ɛ. Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ baabela mɛdhɛɛb mɛ lɔɔd mɛmbá kɔ yii nyɛ nalikaa nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Mot nabela ɛdhɛɛb ɛ lɔɔd wat ɔ, nyɛ naatɔ́ kɛpu bɔs, da nɔɔ yɛ, syel epata e kukuma yɛ pɛ tɔ bɔs.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />Bɛtɛ nɛ mɛlu bhii tak, kukuma bot ɛ mɛsa menɔk eezɛbula. Bhii tak nyɛ moo zɛdji bɛ dáa bɛ nadi ebe lɔɔd nyɛ nalik bɛ nɛ yɛ bhii koŋ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Mot-mɛsa na mɛdhɛɛb mɛtɛn ɛ́ boozɛlyaal yɛ mɛdhɛɛb mɛtɛn mɛ nyɛ nabaabela ɛ. Nyɛy nɛ kukuma yɛ náá: “Ghɛŋ, wɔ nadjɛ mɛ ɛ́ mɛdhɛɛb mɛ lɔɔd mɛtɛn. Beea dhiiti mɛdhɛɛb mɛ lɔɔd mɛtɛn mɛ mɛ baabela ɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Kukuma yɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ nɛ náá: “Ɛnyɔɛpe! Wɔ ɛ́ mbɛɛ mot-mɛsa nɛ esosoob. Wɔ eesa embɛɛ mɛsa nɛ sa dem. Mɛ waadjɛ wɔ yii di bu ɛ. Dha myaala é di wat nɛ nam.” <verse eid="MAT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />Mot-mɛsa nabela mɛdhɛɛb mɛ lɔɔd ebá ɔ, baazyɛ yɛ. Nyɛy náá: “Ghɛŋ, wɔ nadjɛ mɛ ɛ́ mɛdhɛɛb mɛ lɔɔd mɛmbá. Mam eebaabela yak mɛdhɛɛb mɛmbá kɔ tak. Beea yɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />Tin, kukuma yɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: “Ɛnyɔɛpe! Wɔ ɛ́ mbɛɛ mot-mɛsa nɛ esosoob. Wɔ eesa embɛɛ mɛsa nɛ sa dem. Mɛ waadjɛ wɔ yii di bu ɛ. Dha myaala é di wat nɛ nam.”<verse eid="MAT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />Bhii tak, mot nabela ɛdhɛɛb ɛ wat ɔ, nyɛ eezɛzyɛ é yɛ sok. Nyɛ nɛ kukuma náá: “Ghɛŋ, mɛ nɛ gu náá, wɔy nɛ goo lo dhaa nyel. Wɔ dyeebakɛnɔɔ edee ɛ́ tɔ epyeeb ee wɔ di ààbɛ ɛ. Wɔ nɛ dyeebakɛbɔ́k bhum ele baa, tɔ pyeeb wɔ nadi ààbɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ mɛ gwak bwoo, mɛ ɛ́ bookɛsyel lɔɔd'ɔ tɔ bɔs. Beea lɔɔd'ɔ, nɔŋa yɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />É di'enek, kukuma yɛ ɛ́ boobɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: “Mbee mot-mɛsa, tsak-bel. Wɔ ke ɛ́ náá, wɔ nɛ gu náá, mam dyeebakɛnɔɔ edee ɛ́ tɔ pyeeb mɛ di ààmwam bhek ɛ, mam nɛ kɛbɔ́k bhum ele baa, tɔ pyeeb mɛ nadi ààbɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Gwaka mɛ, wɔ di àànɔɔ epata bam, kɛwa tɔ eboo mendjaa mɛ di ebaal epata e bot ɛ, étɛp yé? Wɔy ɛpedi ɛ́ di tsoŋ mot ɔɔ, pe bula mɛ kabula ɛ, mɛ kazɛbela ɛ́ dhiiti epata eezekala kɔ yii mɛ nalik ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Dɛkeka nyɛ ɛdhɛɛb ɛ lɔɔd'enek, da bi ɛ́ djɛ mot di nɛ mɛdhɛɛb kam ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Etɛɛ náá, mot aadi nɛ ba bim sonok ɔ, bɛ waabil nyɛ dhiiti, étɛp ye neebu. Tin, mot aakadi toto ààbɛ nɛ sonok ɔ, bɛ waadɛk nyɛ dɔɔ nɛ eghutu-ghutu nyɛ lik nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Yɛ kabɛ mbee mot-mɛsa mak ɔɔ, zyeegalka nyɛ pɛ kel, tɔ ghooghom, tɔ di mɛgwyɛ nɛ di ɛkwaal ɛ mɛtsok.”»<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dáa bot aapɛ́ɛaa é ɛsi ɛ bɔs ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />«É sok Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aazyɛ tɔ duma yɛ bɛ nɛ efofop bɛ djas ɛ, nyɛ waazɛdisi kɔ bóó mɛkoozi mɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Membyak djas di kɔ bɔs ɛ́ waazɛsɛɛga sok bhwoob'ɛ, bhii tak nyɛ waawa mbɛk pak bot dáa mbaalel mɛsaa di ewa mbɛk pak ebhata nɛ etaŋ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Nyɛ waanɛɛg ebhata pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ, etaa pɛ mbɔ ɛmyɛl. <verse eid="MAT 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Tin, mɛkoozi ɛ́ waalɛɛ nɛ bot aadi pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ ɔ náá: “Biyɔ, bot ɛ Saagam zesɛɛ mɛtel ɔ, dhaka pɛ kak. Dha nika tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb naloozekoobal bin yɛ ɛ, é sok nyɛ nadi ekus bɔs ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Etɛɛ náá, za naasa mɛ, bi naadjɛ mɛ edee. Mɛ naagwak gwyes mɛdii, bi naadjɛ mɛ mɛdii. Mɛ nadi ɛ́ ndjoŋ, bi naamyaal mɛ tɔ mendjaa men dáa mɔn-nyɛɛg'en. <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />Mɛ nadi ɛ́ ben toto, bi naabét mɛ. Mɛ naabɛ́, bi naagwom mɛ. Mɛ naani membok, bi naazyɛ zɛbee mɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />Deenek bot ɛ nakɛ tɔ epiki ɔ waabɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: “Ghɛŋ! Yaa dwoo bis nabee wɔ nɛ za, da bis ɛ́ djɛ wɔ edee? Yaa dwoo wɔ nadi nɛ gwyes mɛdii, da bis ɛ́ djɛ wɔ mɛdii? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Yaa dwoo wɔ nadi ndjoŋ, da bis ɛ́ djɛ wɔ di tɔ mendjaa mes? Yaa dwoo wɔ nadi ben toto, da bis ɛ́ bét wɔ? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Yaa dwoo wɔ nadi ebɛ́, da bis ɛ́ zyɛ, zɛgwyák wɔ? Yaa dwoo wɔ nadi é membok, da bis ɛ́ zyɛ zɛbee wɔ?” <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Mɛkoozi kabɔɔza ɛ́ náá: “Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, esonok djas bi di esa nɛ mot mɛsik tɔ bɔn-nyaagam ɛ, bi sa embɛɛ esa binek ɛ́ nɛ nam.”<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />Bhii tak, kukuma ɛ́ waake nɛ bot aadi pɛ mbɔ ɛmyɛl ɔ náá: “Duska mɛ é mis. Tɔ́ka ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ nam, biyɔ, bot ɛ Zɛɛb zelek ɛbiyoɛpe ɔ. Tɔ́ka tɔ du di ààdim ɛ. Ye nakoobelaa ɛ́, étɛp dim mot mɛkɔŋ bɛ nɛ efofop bɛ! <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Etɛɛ náá, mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ za, bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààdjɛ mɛ edee. Mɛ naagwak gwyes mɛdii, bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààdjɛ mɛ mɛdii. <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Mɛ nadi ɛ́ ndjoŋ, bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààdjɛ mɛ di tɔ mendjaa men. Mɛ nadi ɛ́ ben toto, bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààbét mɛ kaad. Mɛ nadi ebɛ́, bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààgwom mɛ. Mɛ naani mbok, bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààzɛgwyak mɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛbɔɔza náá: “Ghɛŋ, yaa dwoo bis nabee wɔ nɛ za, nɛ gwyes mɛdii, nɛ nɛghu ndjoŋ? Yaa dwoo bis nabee wɔ ben toto, wɔy ebɛ́, nɛghu wɔy é membok, da bis ɛ́ kadi ààkwyee wɔ?” <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Kukuma ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: “Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, esok djas bi nadi ààsa esonok binek nɛ mot mɛsik tɔ bɔn-nyaagam ɛ, bi nadi ààsa yɛ ɛ nɛ nam.” <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Bɛ waatɔ́, kɛbee mezuk na kɔm-kɔm. Yɛ kabɛ bot ɛ epiki ɔɔ, bɛ waabela tsik na kɔm-kɔm.»<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s1">Zɛɛga ekukuma eegwakel étɛp ɛgó ɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Bhii Yezu nasilal mɛlyo mɛ djas ɛ́, nyɛ naazɛke nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />«Bi nɛ gu náá, ye kalik ɛ́ mɛlu mɛmbá, etɛɛ náá, ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak neesael. Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɛ́ waakaaa, étɛp nyɛ neekɛbemaa kɔ mɛlaaba.»<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Tin, eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nɛ bɛpaa eYuda naazɛsɛɛga tɔ ndjaa mɛkoozi Kayif, mot nadi boo ghaa-Zɛɛb ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />Wɔ gwaa, bɔɔ djas zokazɛgwakel náá, bɛ mɛt Yezu tɔ syaab, bhii tak, da bɛ ɛ́ gó nyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Bɛ nadi eke ɛ́ náá: «Sa mena ààmɛtka nyɛ dwoo ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak, ekaab náá, bot ɛ́ zɛkɛkpaa elyem, da bɛ ɛ́ sa ɛzɛm.»<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dhiiti moma eezɛso Yezu mɛnanas kɔ lo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Dáa Yezu nadi pɛ Bhetani tɔ ndjaŋ ɛ Simɔŋ mot na ɛbɛ́ ɛ zezam ɛ, <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />wɔ gwaa, dhiiti moma zɛni tɔ ndjaa tak, zeza nɛ di Yezu nadi ɛ. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́, nɛ bɛɛb nasael nɛ ɛkok ɛ albat ɛ, tɔɔɔ nɛ mɛnanas na boo mɛtaŋ. Moma tak zokazɛso mɛnanas menek kɔ lo ɛ Yezu é sok bɛ nadi kɔ mesa ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Dáa bɛdjekel bɛ nabee deenek ɛ́, ye nabɛ ɛ́, ye naakpaa bɛ elyem. Bɔɔ náá: «Yak ɛ́ yaa kwaambi puluk? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Ɛnyɔ náá, bɛ bɔmsa mɛnanas mɛ tak nɛ boo mɛtaŋ, da nɔɔ epata e tak, djɛ nɛ bɛdjel ɛ bot!»<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́ Yezu naagu sa bɛ nadi enyiŋela pak'ɔɔ ɛ. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Betka moma yak gwyem. Étɛp yé bi di ezɛm nyɛ? Sa nyɛ sa kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Yɛ bɛ étɛp bɛdjel ɛ bot ɔɔ, bi nɛ bɛnɔɔ ɛ́ aakwaazodi mɛlu djas é di wat. Yɛ kabɛ mam ɔɔ, bi aanàkwaakabaadi sama nɛ nam mɛlu djas. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Moma yak so mɛnanas é nyel'am ɛ́, étɛp nyɛ neekan ɛkoobal nyel'am é dwoo mɛdela mam. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, é edi djas Mbɛɛ Bhaadal aadi egoolaaa kɔ bɔs ɛ, tseŋa moma yak ɛ́ waakaadaaa mɛdhik nɛ mɛdhik. Tin, bot ɛ́ waataala enɛm esa nyɛ sa kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam ɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yudas eezɛka Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Tinaak, djekel ngɔt tɔ bɛdjekel kam nɛ bɛbá ɛ Yezu, nadi edjóoaa Yudas Iskaliɔt ɔ, zokazɛtɔ́ pɛ daa eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb. <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />Nyɛ eezɛdji bɛ náá: «Mam ɛ ka bin Yezu ɔɔ, bi kadjɛ mɛ yé é di tak?» Tin, wɔ gwaa bot ɛ tak zɛwyisal epata mɛkam-mɛlɛl (30) nɔɔ laa, bhii tak bɛ eezɛdjɛ nyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Kana tin, Yudas nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ moo esaa mɛpek étɛp nyɛ neeka bɛ Yezu.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eezɛdɛ ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />É dwoo mɛkɛn mɛ ɛbyoŋ ɛ emapa di ààbɛ nɛ leviid ɛ, bɛdjekel ɛ Yezu eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Wɔ kwyɛl náá, bis kɛkoobal wɔ di mena aakɛdɛka edee e ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak ɛ wo?» <verse eid="MAT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Tin, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Tɔ́ka pɛ dɛl, pɛ daa dhiiti mot, da bi ɛ́ lɛɛ nyɛ náá: “Lyoel ke ɛ́ náá: Ɛwala ɛ lam eezekum. Mam nɛ bɛdjekel bam aadɛ ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak'ak ɛ pɛ tɔ ndjaŋ'ɔ.”» <verse eid="MAT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Tin, bɛdjekel ɛ́ bookɛsa dáa Yezu nalɛɛ bɛ ɛ. Bɔɔ zokazɛkoobal nɛ ɛdjaab ɛ edee ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Dáa dwoo nakabɛ, ye moo bikoko ɛ, Yezu eezɛdisi kɔ mesa bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ kam nɛ bɛbá. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Dáa bɛ nadi kɔ mesa edɛ ɛ, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke náá: «Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, mot ngɔt pak'en ɛ́ waaka mɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Bɛdjekel djas moo tin nɛ ghoŋ tɔ elyem, bhii tak, ngɔt-ngɔt moo tin ezɛdji nyɛ: «Ghɛŋ, yɛ ɛ́ mam é?» <verse eid="MAT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ mot duu mbɔ tɔ saan wat bis nɛ nɛ ɔ aakwaaka mɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɛ́ waagwyɛ dáa Ekwyala di elɛɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ ɛ. Tinaak, haaa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ mot aakɛka nyɛ é mɛmbɔ mɛ bɛmbee ɛ bot ɔ. Ye nabɛ ààgoka náá, mbi mot deenek byel-byelak!» <verse eid="MAT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Yudas, mot nadi ekɛka nyɛ ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ boodji náá: «Lyoel, ye kabɛ ɛ́ mam é?» Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ wɔ ɛmet ɛ ke deenek.»<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Dáa bɛ nadi edɛ kɔ mesa ɛ, wɔ gwaa Yezu zɛnɔɔ mapa. Nyɛ eezɛghaapɛɛ Zɛɛb, bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛpyak mapa tak, nɔɔ, djɛ bɛdjekel bɛ. Nyɛy náá: «Nɔɔka yɛ, da bi ɛ́ dɛ, etɛɛ náá, yak ɛ́ nyel'am.» <verse eid="MAT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ bɛɛlɛ nadi nɛ vin tɔ tak ɛ, nyɛ eezɛbaazɛghaapɛɛ Zɛɛb, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Nɔɔka yɛ, da bi ɛ́ dɛ biyɔ djas, <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />etɛɛ náá, yak ɛ́ ghiya yam. Yɛ ɛ́ ghiya ɛbhɛŋ ɛ Zɛɛb nasee étɛp bot ɛbuɛpe étɛp mesyem mɛ bot neepelel ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, kana dwoo pan mos'aak, mɛ aanàkabaadɛ mɛnyok mɛ vin, kɛkum dwoo mɛ aakabaakɛdɛ mɛnyok mɛ na bes menabɛlka tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Saagam ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Tin, wɔ gwaa bɛ zɛduwal Zɛɛb tɔ mɛdjeeb. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛnɔɔ mɛnyel, tɔ́ pɛ ɛtsok ɛ pyeeb oliv.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛlɛɛ nɛ Pyɛɛd náá, nyɛ waaswonal nyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Tin, Yezu zokake nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «É pum'ak mos, biyɔ djas ɛ́ waakat ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ nam, etɛɛ náá, Ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ́ náá: “Mɛ waagó mbaalel ebhata. Tin, ɛsaa djas ɛ́ waawyɛɛza na ghwyiiiŋ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.31 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Zal 13.7</ref></char></char></note>.”» <verse eid="MAT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Yezu eebaazɛbil ɛkpa náá: «Bhis ɛgom ɛ lam, mɛ waatɔ́, kɛbwood bin pɛ Ghalile.» <verse eid="MAT 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Pyɛɛd zokake nɛ nɛ náá: «Yɛ bɛ náá, bot djas ɛ́ waakaab wɔ ɔɔ, mam aanàkwaakaab wɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Tinaak, Yezu kabɔɔza nɛ nɛ ɛ́ náá: «Gwaka, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, é pum'ak mos, ɛsok nɛ kuu nɛ kɔk, yɛ aakabela ɛ́, wɔ eezelɛɛ nɛ bot esok elɛl náá, wɔ ààgu mɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Pyɛɛd eezɛbɔɔza nɛ Yezu náá: «Mɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛke nɛ bot náá, mɛ ààgu wɔ, ye nakoozobɛ ɛsyee, mɛ ɛpemyaal náá, menabɛl bɛbá gwyɛ.» É di'enek, ye nabɛ tin ɛ́, bɛdjekel djas moo ɛkpa wat.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eekɛdjaala Zɛɛb pɛ Ghetsemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Bhis yenek, Yezu bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ naazɛkum pɛ di di edjóoaa Ghetsemani ɛ. É di tak, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Likeka wak, mɛ pookotiila poon, kɛdjaala Zɛɛb.» <figure style="fig" alt="Jésus réveile les disciples" file="WA03914b.tif" size="span" loc="26.36" copy="Graham Wade" ref="26.36">Yezu ɛpedjem bɛdjekel</figure> <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Tin, nyɛ kanɔŋ ɛ́ Pyɛɛd, nɛ bɔn Zɛbɛdɛ bɛbá, tɔ́ nɛ nɔɔ. É di'enek, ye nabɛ ɛ́, kɛŋ nɛ ghoŋ nadi ɛ́ ye moo esa nyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Sisim'am ɛ́ tɔ ghoŋ, saa-saŋak náá mɛ gwyɛ. Likeka wak, dika ndjem sama nɛ nam.» <verse eid="MAT 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛtiila batsa pɛ sok, zɛkwyit mɛboŋ bhwoob si na ghɔkɔ, nyɛ moo tin edjaala nɛ Zɛɛb náá: «Saagam, wɔ kwyɛl ɔɔ, wɔ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛdis bɛɛlɛ mezuk mak sok bhwoob'am. Ye goka ɛ́ djas sael tɔ ɛkwosak ɛ lɔ, ààkabɛ yam ɛkwosak.» <verse eid="MAT 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛsik, tɔ́ pɛ nyɛ lik bɛdjekel bɛ bɛlɛl binɔk ɛ, nyɛ kazɛbela bɛ ɛ́ é gɔ́. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ Pyɛɛd náá: «Deenek, bi eedja gɔ́! Bi ààpakodi-diak mis membek sama nɛ nam é ɛwala wat é? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Dika ndjem, djaalaka Zɛɛb, etɛɛ náá, bi ɛ́ zɛkɛkwyɛ tɔ mɛbhowal. Sisim ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛlooba, kabela ɛ́ náá, epuud nɛ sa elɛtɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Yak kɔkɔ, tyee esok ebá nyɛ eebaazɛsik pɛ pak nyɛ nadi sok ɛ, nyɛ kadjaala Zɛɛb é sok tak ɛ́ dáak: «Saagam, yɛ ààkosael náá, bɛɛlɛ mezuk mak dhaa, mam ààdɛ yɛ, ye goka ɛ́ náá, ɛkwosak ɛ lɔ sael.» <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Yezu eebaazɛbula pɛ nyɛ nalik bɛdjekel bɛ ɛ, nyɛ kabaazobela bɛ ɛ́ é egɔ́, etɛɛ náá, mis mɔɔ nadi ɛ́ ɛdilɛpe. <verse eid="MAT 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Yak sok, Yezu eebaazɛlik bɛ, zɛbaasik, nyɛ eezɛtseta nɛ nɔɔ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́, ɛtɔ́ ɛ lɛ tyee esok elɛl nyɛ nadi etetɔ́ kɛdjaala dáa nyɛ nadjedjaala sok ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Tin, Yezu eezɛbula pɛ bɛdjekel bɛ nadi ɛ́, nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi dinaa é egɔ́? Bi ɛpewala? Guka náá, ɛwala Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot di eka mɛ é mɛmbɔ mɛ bot ɛ mesyem ɛ eezedjala. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Wyɛlka, ghɛɛka mɛnyel, mena tɔ́ka, etɛɛ náá, mot ka mɛ é mɛmbɔ mɛ bot binɔk ɔ, nyɛ moo ɛ́ ɛkunaaɛpe nɛ nena.»<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛmɛtaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Yezu dinaa ààpakosilal ɛlii deenek é, Yudas, ngɔt tɔ bɛdjekel bɛ kam nɛ bɛbá eezɛtuula nɛ boo ɛdhuu ɛ bot nɛ epɛl nɛ ebhil e ele é mɛmbɔ. Eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, nɛ bɛpaa ɛ eYuda ɛ́ nalwom bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Kabela tin ɛ́, Yudas, mot naka bɛ Yezu gha ɔ naazelyaal bɛ geka, bɛ aagwyak Yezu nɛ yɛ ɛ: «Bi zobee ɛ́, mot mɛ aakɛbeedal ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ nyɛy, mɛtka nyɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Batsa deenek, Yudas eezɛtuula, nyɛ eezɛtiila pɛ daa Yezu, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɛ eeswos wɔ, Lyoel!» Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛbeedal nyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />É di tak, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɛn sɔ'am! Lela ɛsa sa wɔ zyɛzɛsa ɛ.» Bhii tak, bot ɛ nazyɛ bɛ nɛ Yudas ɔ, ɛboozɛmɛt Yezu.<verse eid="MAT 26:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Tin, wɔ gwaa ngɔt pak bot ɛ nadi bɛ nɛ Yezu ɔ, zokawaal pɛl, tsaal ɛlɔ mot-mɛsa ɛ boo ghaa-Zɛɛb. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Yezu eezɛke nɛ mot'enɔk náá: «Nɔŋa pɛl'ɔ, da wɔ ɛ́ bulal tɔ pɛp, etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ di egó bɛsɔ bɔɔ bot nɛ epɛl ɔ, bɛ aabaazogwyɛ ɛ́ nɛ pɛl. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Wɔ ààgu náá, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛdjóo Saagam, nyɛ zɛkwyee mɛ? É di tak wat, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛdhis mɛ ɛdhuu ɛ esodja efofop ɛbuɛpe kum-kumak mɛdhuu kam nɛ bɛbá. <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Mɛ sa deenek ɔɔ, etɛp ee di tɔ Ekwyala aakasael dáa? Etɛɛ náá, Ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, ye goka ɛ́ etɛp binek sael deenek.»<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛke nɛ ɛdhuu ɛ bot náá: «Ye goka nɛ nen ɛ́ náá, bi zyɛ nɛ epɛl nɛ ebhil e ele étɛp bi neezɛmɛt mɛ tyee náá, mɛ ɛ́ mot ɛzɛm é? Dhi mɛlu djas mɛ di ndiindel tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa é lelyo, biyɔ ààmɛt mɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Esesɛɛ binek sael ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, etɛp ee nakwyalaa tɔ mɛkana mɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb dum nɛ nam ɛ́ neebela ɛsuk.» Tinaak, bɛdjekel djas ɛ́ boo zɛghuma nɛ ekaab tɔ́ yɔɔ.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu sok bhwoob bot ɛ boo kwan eYuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Bot ɛ namɛt Yezu ɔ eezɛtɔ́ nɛ nɛ pɛ daa Kayif, mot nadi boo ghaa-Zɛɛb ɔ, é di bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi, nɛ bɛpaa ɛ eYuda nakɛsɛɛga ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Pyɛɛd nadi edu bɛ, nyɛy ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ nɔɔ, batakɛni tɔ ɛbɛsɛɛ ɛ ndjaŋ ɛ boo ghaa-Zɛɛb. Nyɛy zokani tɔ ɛbɛsɛɛ, nɔɔ nyel, disi bɛ nɛ bot ɛ di ebaal ndjaa tak ɔ, étɛp nyɛ neebee dáa tɛp tak aakɛsik ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 26:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, nɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɛ boo kwan eYuda nadi esaa dhiiti esua-esua étɛp bɛ needjɛ Yezu epɛ́ɛ e ɛsyee. <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />Ye nakoozodi náá, bot ɛbuɛpe nadi ezezyɛ zɛpit nyɛ nɛ etɛp esua-esua, tin, bɛ nakadi ɛ́, ààbela sonok. É di tak, wɔ gwaa, bot ɛbá zokazyɛ zɛpit nyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />Bɔɔ náá: «Mot tak naake náá: “Mɛ waabwak Ndjaa-ebuwa e Zɛɛb, da mɛ ɛ́ sum yɛ tɔ mɛlu mɛlɛl.”»<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Tin, boo ghaa-Zɛɛb eezɛwyɛl, zɛdji Yezu náá: «Tɔ mɛpita mɛ bot bak zɛpit wɔ'aak, wɔ ààkataŋal yɔ é?» <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Yezu nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɔɔza nyɛ. Boo ghaa-Zɛɛb eebaazɛdji nyɛ náá: «Tuwala myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ mɔ nɛ din ɛ Zɛɛb Mɛkaake. Lɛɛa bis tsɛɛtsɛ tyee mwaado, lɛɛa bis nɛghu wɔy ɛ́ di Mɛsia Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb!» <verse eid="MAT 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Tin, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ wɔy, wɔ ɛ́ met ɛ ke deenek! Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, kana ɛwala mena dika'aak, bi ɛ́ waabee Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ndiindel pɛ kyee mbɔ eghɛŋ ɛ Zɛɛb Mɛkaake. Bi ɛ́ waabee nyɛ ezyɛ kɔ eguud tɔ gwoo.»<verse eid="MAT 26:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />É di'enek, wɔ gwaa, boo ghaa-Zɛɛb zɛnyaa ekaad bɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke náá: «Nyɛ eelee Zɛɛb! Mena tokapɛ nɛ gwyes náá, mot zɛlɛɛ mena sa nyɛ di esa ɛ! Bi eegwak ebyas ee nyɛ byasal Zɛɛb ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Biyɔ kake dáa?» Bɔɔ djas eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ndjɛ, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛsyee.» <verse eid="MAT 26:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛsɛɛ nyɛ mɛtel é bhwoob, bɛ moo tu nyɛ nɛ ekutupo. Bɛdhiiti bot moo tin epak nyɛ mɛbhɛɛz. <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />Bɔɔ nɛ nɛ náá: «Naŋa! Wɔy Mɛsia, yɛ ɛzɛ myak wɔ?»<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pyɛɛd eezɛkɛla Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Pyɛɛd nadi ɛ́ ndiindel pɛ kel tɔ ɛbɛsɛɛ. Dhiiti moma nadi esa mɛsa tɔ ndjaa boo ghaa-Zɛɛb ɔ, zokazɛtiila pɛ daa lɛ. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔy pe, wɔ nadi ɛ́, bi nɛ Yezu, mot Ghalile yenɔk.» <verse eid="MAT 26:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Wɔ gwaa, Pyɛɛd zɛswonal. Nyɛy náá: «Mɛ ààgu sa wɔ di ekwyɛl ɛlii'enek.» <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Bhii tak, Pyɛɛd eezɛswoola di tɔ peeb ɛbɛsɛɛ, tɔ́ kɛtyaa pɛ ɛniel. Tin, wɔ gwaa dhiiti moma mɛsa baazɛgwyak nyɛ. Moma tak eezɛlɛɛ nɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ náá: «Mot'ak nadi ɛ́, bɛ nɛ Yezu, mot Nazalɛt.» <verse eid="MAT 26:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Tin, wɔ gwaa Pyɛɛd baazɛkɛla Yezu kɛla sis, nyɛ eetuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ nɛ din ɛ Zɛɛb náá: «Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, mɛ ààgu mot'enɔk.»<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Bhii tak, bot ɛ nadi é di'enek bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ eezɛtiila pɛ Pyɛɛd nadi ɛ́, bɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ! Wɔ ɛ́ mot'ɔɔ, etɛɛ náá, ɛlii ɛ lɔ ɛpelyaal pɛ kyee dɛl wɔ dus ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />É di'enek, Pyɛɛd eezɛben gwood, kɛla. Nyɛ ɛ́ bookalal: «Mam ààgu mot bi di eke'enɔk!» Batsa deenek, kuu ɛsok eezɛkɔk. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Tin, Pyɛɛd eezɛtaala sa Yezu nalɛɛ nyɛ ɛ: «Ɛsok nɛ kuu nɛ kɔk, yɛ aabela ɛ́, wɔ eezelɛɛ nɛ bot esok elɛl náá, wɔ ààgu mɛ». É di'enek, Pyɛɛd eezɛwyis, tɔ́, nyɛ moo tin edje ɛbuɛpe.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s1">Bɛ eezɛtɔ́ nɛ Yezu sok bhwoob ɛ Pilat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Tɔ mɛlem kɛɛŋ, eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, nɛ bɛpaa ɛ eYuda zokazɛsɛɛga. Tɔ zɛɛga tak, bɛ nagwakel ɛ́ náá, bɛ neegó Yezu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Bɛ eezɛmɛt nyɛ, kɔl nyɛ mɛmbɔ, zɛnɔɔ nyɛ, tɔ́ nɛ nɛ pɛ daa Pilat mot nadi kukuma dɛl ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛsyee ɛ Yudas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Dáa Yudas, mot naka nyɛ gha nagwak náá, Yezu naapɛ́ɛaa étɛp nyɛ neekɛgóaa ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ naadyeebadjɛ lyem mɛbɛ. Tin, nyɛ ɛ́ bookanɔɔ efalanga mɛkam-mɛlɛl e epata ee eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, nɛ bɛpaa ɛ eYuda nadjɛ nyɛ ɛ, nyɛ eekɛbulal yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛlɛɛ nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛ eekwyɛ ndjɛ! Mɛ eemyaal náá, mɛ eeka mot baa gwyes nyɛ góaa!» Bot binɔk ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Yenek ààkagwyák bisɔ, ye gwyák ɛ́ wɔy.» <verse eid="MAT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Wɔ gwaa Yudas zokanɔɔ epata binek, mwas tɔ Ndjaa-ebuwa. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́, kɛtiŋal kel é tsuŋ yeeda.<verse eid="MAT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Bot ɛ nadi kɔ eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb ɔ ɛ́ boozɛtek epata binek. Bɔɔ náá: «Etsi bina lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, mbi epata dáak ààgoka nɛ ɛbaakɛkwomaa tɔ di epata di ekwomaa tɔ Ndjaa-ebuwa ɔ. Etɛɛ náá, yenek moo ɛ́ epata e ghiya.» <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Bhii bɛ nazegwakel ɛ, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛnɔɔ epata binek, kɛbɔm pyeeb mɛel mɛbhe mɛ dyak. Bɛ nabɔm yɛ ɛ́ étɛp ye needi, di mɛvit mɛ bɛdjoŋ. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Étɛp tak ɛ, bɛ naget pyeeb tak «pyeeb ghiya», kɛkum dɔɔ nɛ dwoo pan mos'ak. <verse eid="MAT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Djas yenek nasael ɛ́ dáa ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Zeelemi nalɛɛ ɛ́: «Bɛ eenɔɔ bɔɔ efalanga mɛkam-mɛlɛl epata binek, mɛtaŋ mɛ bot ɛ Yisalaɛl nazetiŋal kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />Tin, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛnɔɔ epata e tak, bɔm yɛ nɛ pyeeb ɛ mɛel mɛbhe mɛ dyak, dáa Ghɛŋ nalɛɛ mɛ ɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.10 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 11:12-13">Zal 11.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 18:2-3">Zel 18.2-3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 19:1-2">19.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:6-15">32.6-15</ref> </char></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu sok bhwoob ɛ Pilat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Yezu eezɛpɛ́ɛaa pɛ daa kukuma. Pilat eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Wɔ ɛ́ mɛkoozi mɛ eYuda?» Tin, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ dáa wɔy, wɔ ɛmet ke'enek!» <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Bhii tak, dáa eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, nɛ bɛpaa ɛ eYuda nakadi esu nyɛ zukamwaa nɛ etɛp ɛ, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Pilat eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔ ààgwak mɛpita mɛ bɛ di epit wɔ yenek é?» <verse eid="MAT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Tinaak, Yezu kadi ɛ́ ààbɔɔza bɛ ɛkpa wat. Kukuma naadyeebadjoka nɛ dáa Yezu nadi gwyem, ààbɛɛ nuub ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛ eezɛpɛ́ɛ Yezu epɛ́ɛ e ɛsyee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />É ghɛŋ mɛbyoŋ mɛ ePak djas, kukuma eLoma nabebɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɛfulu mɛ ɛpel ɛ mot membok ngɔt yii ɛdhuu ɛ bot aasɛ́ɛ ɔ, da nyɛ ɛ́ wyiselaa é membok. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />É di tak, tɔ membok, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti ngék mot membok. Din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Yezu Bhaalabhas. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Pilat naazɛdji ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nasɛɛga tin ɔ náá: «Bi kwyɛl náá, mɛ bet bin zɛ? Yezu Bhaalabhas ohoo, Yezu mot di djóoaa Klisto ɔ?» <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Tin, Pilat nadi egu náá, Yezu namɛtaa ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ mbee lyem nɛ nɛ.<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Dáa Pilat nadi kɔ bóó epɛ́ɛ bɛ ɛ, myɛl zokadhis nyɛ bhaadal náá: «Sa wɔ ààsa mot epiki yenɔk ɛbiyo, etɛɛ náá, mɛ eedyeebazuk é pum'ak mos tɔ dhyam kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />É di'enek, eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, nɛ bɛpaa ɛ eYuda moo tin ebesal ɛdhuu ɛ bot, bɛ lɛɛ nɛ Pilat náá, nyɛ wyisal bɛ Bhaalabhas, da bɛ ɛ́ gó Yezu. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Wɔ gwaa, kukuma Pilat baazɛdji bɛ náá: «Tɔ bot ɛbá bak, bi kwyɛl náá, mɛ bet bin nwyaa?» Ɛdhuu ɛ bot binɔk kabulal ɛ́ náá: «Bhaalabhas.» <verse eid="MAT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilat ɛ́ boozɛbaadji bɛ náá: «Mɛ sa dáa nɛ Yezu di djóoaa Klisto ɔ?» Bɛ kabɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Bemka nyɛ é mɛlaaba!» <verse eid="MAT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Pilat eebaadji bɛ náá: «Yaa etɛp e ɛbiyo nyɛ sa?» Wɔ gwaa, bɛ baazɛtsim ɛlyelɛpe: «Bema nyɛ kɔ mɛlaaba!»<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Dáa Pilat nabee náá, bot nadi enenal ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛnɔɔ mɛdii, gwyii mɛmbɔ mɛ é mis mɛ ɛdhuu ɛ bot binɔk, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Tɛp ɛsyee ɛ mot'ak ààkagwyák mɛ. Ye kagwyák ɛ́ biyɔ bɛmet!» <verse eid="MAT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ zokazɛbɔɔza náá: «Beta náá, esesɛɛ binek djas kwyɛ kɔ elo bis nɛ kɔ elo e bɔn bis!» <verse eid="MAT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Tin, Pilat ɛ́ boozɛwyisal bɛ Bhaalabhas, é di'enek nyɛ eezɛlwom bɛ, bɛ nyuu Yezu nɛ eghwyɛs, bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛdjɛ bɛ Yezu, étɛp bɛ neekɛbem nyɛ é mɛlaaba.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esodja ɛpeduk Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Esodja ɛ Pilat zokatɔ́ nɛ Yezu tɔ ɛbɛsɛɛ pɛ daa kukuma, é di'enek, bɛ eezɛwa nyɛ kuku ɛbwak. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Bɛ eezɛsɔ nyɛ ekaad nyɛ nabɔt ɛ, bhii tak bɛ eezɛbét nyɛ ndjookuwa na tɔɔbelaa. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Tin, bɛ eezɛnɔɔ kel mɛgɔk, pyeed nyɛ kɔtɔ mɛkoozi nɛ yɛ. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ sɔm nyɛ yɛ ɛ é lo, bɛ eezɛsɛk nyɛ mɔɔ le ghwaazok é mbɔ eghɛŋ bɛ. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛkwyit mɛboŋ sok bhwoob'ɛ, bɛ moo tin eduk nyɛ. Bɔɔ nɛ nɛ náá: «Bis eeswos wɔ, mɛkoozi mɛ eYuda!» <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Bɛ moo tin esɛɛ nyɛ mɛtel é mis. Bɛ eezɛnɔɔ mɔɔ le ghwaazok, bɛ moo tin enyuu nyɛ nɛ yɛ é lo. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Bhii bɛ nasilal ɛduk nyɛ ɛlyelɛpe ɛ, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛdis nyɛ ndjookuwa bɛ nazebét nyɛ ɛ́, bɛ eebaazɛbét nyɛ ekaad ee nyɛ nadi nɛ yɛ sok ɛ. Bhii tak bɛ eezɛtɔ́ nɛ nɛ, étɛp bɛ neekɛbem nyɛ é mɛlaaba.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eebemaa kɔ mɛlaaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />É ghɛŋ bɛ nadi ewyis kɔ dɛl ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛboma nɛ dhiiti mot dɛl Silɛn. Din ɛ mot tak nabɛ ɛ́ Simɔŋ. Tin, esodja ɛ́ boolwom nyɛ nɛ bhel náá, nyɛ kwyee Yezu é ɛbɛp ɛ mɛlaaba.<figure style="fig" alt="Jésus sur la croix" file="lb00324c.tif" size="col" loc="27.36" copy="Louise Bass" ref="27.32">Yezu kɔ mɛlaaba</figure><verse eid="MAT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Tin, bɛ eezɛkum é di bɛ nadi edjóo, Ghologhota ɔ. Din ɛ tak kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ: «Di Bhoobo Lo.» <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />É di'enek, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛdjɛ Yezu mɛnyok puuza nɛ dhiiti sonok mɛnyan na gwyee-gwyee. Bhii nyɛ nabowal ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛpɛɛ ɛdɛ yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛbem nyɛ é mɛlaaba. Bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ ɛ́ boozɛkaa ekaad bɛ, bhii bɛ nasa ɛgwyeeg étɛp bɛ neesɛ́ɛ mot aanɔɔ ekaad e tak ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛdisi tin ebaal Yezu.<verse eid="MAT 27:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Bɛ nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ eekwyal kɔ lo'ɛ, kɔ ɛko ɛ mɛlaaba mɛsɔ mɛ nyɛ nagóaa étɛp tak ɛ. Ye nakwyalaa ɛ́ náá: <char style="sc">«Nwyak ɛ́ Yezu, mɛkoozi mɛ eYuda.»</char> <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Bɛdhiiti bot ɛ ɛzɛm nɛ etuub bɛbá naabemaa é yɔbɔ mɛlaaba dwoo tak wat, ngɔt pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ ɛ Yezu, nwyak tak pɛ mbɔ ɛmyɛl ɛ lɛ.<verse eid="MAT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Bot ɛ nadi edhaa tin ɔ, bɛ nadi elee nyɛ, nɛ ɛsyaal elo. <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />Bɔɔ nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔy mot di ekwyɛl ɛwaaz kok Ndjaa-ebuwa, da bhii tak, wɔ ɛ́ baasum yɛ tɔ mɛlu mɛlɛl ɔ, tsika nyel'ɔ wɔ ɛmet. Yɛ bɛ náá, wɔ ɛ́ Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ, sula kɔ mɛlaaba!»<verse eid="MAT 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Dɔɔ nɛ eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi, zɛnɔɔ bɛpaa ɛ eYuda moo tin eduk nyɛ. Bɔɔ nɛ nɛ náá: <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />«Nyɛ ɛpetsik bot ɛ sis, nyɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛtsik nyel'ɛ ɛmet é! Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ di mɛkoozi mɛ Yisalaɛl é? Nyɛ pookokasul kɔ mɛlaaba étɛp mena needumka koŋ nɛ nɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Nyɛ naadyeebadum koŋ'ɛ nɛ Zɛɛb, nyɛy batake náá: “Mɛ ɛ́ Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb”. Tin, yɛ bɛ náá, Zɛɛb nɛ kwyɛl nyɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ katsik nyɛ é di'enek nenak!» <verse eid="MAT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Bot ɛ ɛzɛm ɛ nadi mbema é mengwoob ɛ Yezu ɔ, moo tin ebaalee nyɛ pe mɛkpa mɛ wat tyee bot ɛ ɛsok nadi elee nyɛ ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛsyee ɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Dáa ye nakum kuku mwos ɛ, wɔ gwaa, ɛgwyitok zɛgwyiidela kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs djas, mɛghomela menek naabɔya mɛwala mɛlɛl. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Tin, é ɛwala ɛ tak wat, wɔ gwaa Yezu zɛbo tsim: <char style="sc">Eli, Eli, lama sabatani</char>? Ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́ náá: «Zɛɛb Saagam, Zɛɛb Saagam! Étɛp yé wɔ bet mɛ mam mɛ ɛmet deenek<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.46 <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 22:2">Mɛd 22.2</ref></char></char></note>?» <verse eid="MAT 27:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Bɛdhiiti bot pak bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ, zokagwak dáa Yezu nadi elii ɛ. Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ bɛsɔ bɔɔ náá: «Gwakeka! Nyɛ ɛpedjóo Eli!» <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Tin, mot ngɔt pak'ɔɔ eezɛwyis kaab, kɛnɔɔ pes kaad, zɛkɔl é bil le ghwaazok, duu tɔ mɛnyok mɛ na bwaaz-bwaaz, nyɛ eesɛɛb Yezu yɛ ɛ, nyɛ needɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Tin, wɔ gwaa bɛdhiiti bot zokake náá: «Bwooda, mena pookobeeka nɛghu Eli ɛ́ waazyɛ, zɛtsik nyɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 27:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Bhis yenek, wɔ gwaa, Yezu baazɛbo boo tsim, bhii tak nyɛ zɛsil eswos.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />É di'enek wat, wɔ gwaa boo lɛmbɛ na pip-pip nadi tɔ Di na Dɛɛ, di ebɛk dhɛŋ nɛ koo tɔ Ndjaa-ebuwa ɔ, zokanyɛɛ kuku tak, kan pɛ ɛko, kɛkum pɛ si. <figure style="fig" alt="Le large habit qui était dans le lieu Saint s’est déchiré" file="lb00265c.tif" size="span" loc="27.51" copy="Louise Bass" ref="27.51">Boo lɛmbɛ na pip-pip nadi tɔ Di na Dɛɛ ɛ eenyɛɛ</figure></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:51">Bɔs dheegel, mɛkok bel, <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />mɛvit diiel. Wɔ gwaa, bot ɛbuɛpe nagwyɛ bɔɔ edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ zokagom. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Bɔɔ zokawyis tɔ mɛvit, bhis ɛgom ɛ Yezu, bɔɔ zokani tɔ Yeluzalɛm, dɛl ɛ na dɛɛ ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ bot ɛbuɛpe nabee bɛ.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Kukuma lɔɔg esodja nɛ esodja ee nadi tin ebaal Yezu ɔ naabee dáa bɔs nadheegel ɛ, dɔɔ nɛ edjema djas nasael tin ɛ. Boo bwoo naazɛsa bɛ ɛlyelɛpe, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛke náá: «Tsɛɛtsɛ, mot'ak nabɛ ɛ́ Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb.»<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Bɛtɛ nɛ boa nadi ɛ́ tin, bɔɔ ebee ɛtsetaɛpe sa nasɛɛ ɛ. Boa tak nadidi ɛ́, bɛ nɛ Yezu, kana pɛ Ghalile. Mɛsa mɔɔ nabɛ ɛ́ ɛkwyee ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Pak boa ɛ tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́: Maali, moma dɛl Makdala, Maali nyɛɛg ɛ Zak bɛ nɛ Zozɛf, zɛnɔɔ nyɛɛg bɔn ɛ Zɛbɛdɛ.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muu ɛ Yezu eekɛwaaa tɔ ɛvit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Dáa ye nabɛ dwoo moo bikoko ɛ, dhiiti kuma mot dɛl Aelimate zokazyɛ, din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Zozɛf. Nyɛ nabaabɛ ɛ́ ngɔt tɔ bɛdjekel ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zokatɔ́ pɛ daa kukuma Pilat, kɛwaab muu ɛ Yezu. Tin, Pilat ɛ́ booke náá, bɛ djɛ nyɛ muu ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Tin, Zozɛf ɛ́ boozɛnɔɔ bheeza wat na puu, pil muu ɛ Yezu tɔ tak. <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zokanɔɔ muu tak, kɛwa yɛ tɔ ɛvit ɛ nyɛ nabwak tɔ bat ɛkok ɛ. Nyɛ ɛ́ bookabiŋal boo ɛkok ɛ bɛ nasa étɛp bɛ neediyal ɛvit ɛ tak nɛ yɛ ɛ. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ nyel, sik, tɔ́ pɛ ndjaŋ'ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Tin, kabela ɛ́, Maali, moma dɛl ɛ Makdala nɛ nwyak Maali nadi ebee di bɛ nawa muu ɛ Yezu ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esodja nadi ebaal ɛvit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Ɛlu ɛwat bhii tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ dwoo saba. Eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nɛ eFalizyɛ zokazɛtɔ́ kɛsɛɛga pɛ daa Pilat. <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />Bɔɔ nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, ye bɛ ɛ́ bis eetaala náá, na-ghaa mɛkɔŋ menɔk, é ghɛŋ nyɛ nadi, nyɛ dinaa nɛ tsik ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ naalɛɛ náá: “É ghɛŋ mɛ aagwyɛ ɛ, mɛlu mɛlɛl bhii tak, mɛ waagom.” <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Ye goka ɛ́, wɔ lwom bot náá, bɛ kɛbaal ɛvit mɛlu mɛlɛl, etɛɛ náá, bɛdjekel bɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛzɛdjii muu, tɔ́ nɛ yɛ, da bɛ ɛ́ kake náá: “Nyɛ eegom!” Tin, mɛkɔŋ menek ɛ́ waabaagék dhaa-dhaŋak yii nabɛ sok ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 27:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilat ɛ́ booke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Beeka esodja étɛp ɛkɛbaal é. Tɔ́ka, kɛbaal ɛvit dáa bi di ekwyɛl ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 27:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛtɔ́, kɛkoobal dáa bɛ aakɛbaal ɛvit ɛ. Bɛ ɛ́ boopyet ɛkok é ɛbɛ ɛ ɛvit ɛ tak ɛlyelɛpe. Esodja e tak eezɛnɔɔ mɛnyel, disi tin é ngwoob ɛvit.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s1">Ɛgom ɛ Yezu Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Dáa dwoo saba nadhaŋ ɛ, kɛɛŋ tɔ mɛlem mɛ dwoo mɛkɛn mɛ yenga, wɔ gwaa, Maali moma dɛl ɛ Makdala, nɛ nwyak dhiiti Maali zɛtɔ́, kɛbee ɛvit. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Dáa bɛ nakatɔ́ ɛ, bɛ kasɛka ɛ́, bɔs moo edheegel ɛlyelɛpe. Fofop ɛ Ghɛŋ ngɔt eedus pɛ tɔ gwoo, sul é bɔs, nyɛ eezɛbiŋal boo ɛkok ɛ bɛ nadiyal ɛbɛ ɛ ɛvit nɛ yɛ ɛ. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ nyel, disi kɔ ɛkok ɛ tak. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Nyɛ nadi ɛ́, ɛkasɛpe dáa ngwyes bhi, ekaad bɛ mɛpum dhaa nyel. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Tin, esodja ee nazɛbaal ɛvit ɔ, moo tin esyeela nɛ bɛbebwol, bɛ moo tin gbegbaagba epwak nɛ bwoo, saa dáa bɛ sa. <verse eid="MAT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />É di'enek, wɔ gwaa, fofop zokake nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Nàdika nɛ bwoo, mɛ nɛ gu náá, bi saŋ ɛ́ Yezu, mot nabemaa é mɛlaaba ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Nyɛ tokapɛ wak. Nyɛ eezegom dáa nyɛ nalɛɛ bin é ghɛŋ nyɛ nadi, nyɛ dinaa nɛ nen é di wat ɛ. Dha beeka di bɛ nakɛl muu'ɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Lelka, tɔ́ka, kɛlɛɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: “Nyɛ eezegom! Nyɛ eetɔ́, kɛbwood bin pɛ Ghalile. Yɛ ɛ́ penek ɛ bi aakɛboma nɛ nɛ.” Bhaadal mɛ kwyɛl mɛ neelɛɛ bin ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ yenek.»<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />É di tak wat, boa binɔk eezɛwyis tɔ ɛvit, bɛ eezɛsum kaab. Tɔ elyem bɔɔ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bwoo nɛ mɛmyaala ɛlyelɛpe. Bɔɔ zokasik kɛgoola lɛŋ pɛ daa bɛdjekel ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="MAT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />É di tak wat, Yezu zokazɛboma nɛ boa binɔk. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛ eeswos bin!» Tin, boa binɔk eezɛtiila pɛ daa Yezu, bɛ eezɛmɛt nyɛ é mɛko, bɛ moo tin eduwal nyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Yezu ɛ́ booke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Sa bi ààdi nɛ bwoo. Kɛlɛɛka nɛ bɔn-nyaagam náá, bɛ tɔ́ pɛ Ghalile. Yɛ ɛ́ penek ɛ bɛ aakɛbee mɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lɛŋ esodja ee nadi ebaal ɛvit ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Boa binɔk dinaa é ze, bɛdhiiti bot tɔ lɔɔg esodja ee nanɛɛgaa étɛp ɛbaal ɛvit ɔ eezɛkum pɛ dɛl. Bɛ moo tin elɛɛ eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb esesɛɛ ee nadhaa penek ɛ djas. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Bot ɛ nadi kɔ elo e bɛghaa-Zɛɛb ɔ, nɛ bɛpaa ɛ eYuda zokasɛɛga é kwan. Bhii bɛ nazegwakel ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bɛ djɛ esodja binɔk bɛtɛ nɛ epata. <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />Bɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi lɛɛ bot ɛ náá: “Bɛdjekel bɛ eezyɛ é pum, zɛdjii muu mot'ɔɔ, bisɔ é gɔ́.” <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Tin, kukuma yen ɛ gwak ɔɔ, yɛ aanàkwaasa sonok, etɛɛ náá, bis ɛ́ waagu dáa bis aasil nyɛ lyem ɛ. Bis ɛ́ waasa náá, bi nàbela etɛp pɛ edi mɛsa men.» <verse eid="MAT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Esodja e tak ɛ́ boonɔɔ epata e tak. Sika bɛ nakasik ɛ́, bɛ ɛ́ bookɛsa dáa bɛ nalɛɛ bɛ náá, bɛ sa ɛ. Deenek, ye nabɛ ɛ́ menduk mɛ etɛp binek naagék tɔ mɛlɔ mɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda djas, kɛkum dwoo pan mos'aak.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛtel nyel nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Bɛdjekel bɛ kam nɛ ngɔt nalik ɔ, nadi etɔ́ pɛ ze Ghalile, pɛ kɔ ɛtsok ɛ Yezu nalyo bɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Dáa bɛ nakum ɛ, bɛ eezɛbee nyɛ. Bhii tak bɛ moo tin eduwal nyɛ. Ye kabela tin ɛ́, bɛdhiiti nadi ɛ́, nɛ mɛso tɔ elyem bɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Yezu ɛ́ bootiila pɛ bɛ nadi ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Ye nabɛ ɛ́, Zɛɛb eedjɛ mɛ eghɛŋ nɛ mɛbwala mɛ djas pɛ tɔ gwoo nɛ kɔ bɔs. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Deenek, tɔ́ka pɛ daa bot ɛ membyak djas di kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɔ, da bi ɛ́ kɛsa náá, bɔɔ djas liigel, da bɛ ɛ́ di bɛdjekel bam. Duuka bɛ Zɛɛb nɛ din ɛ Sɛɛg, nɛ Mɔn, nɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ. <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />Lyoka bɛ, bɛ kɛlooba nɛ esesɛɛ djas mɛ nalyaal bin ɛ. Tin, bi ɛ́ waabee náá, mena waadika lɔɔg wat mɛlu djas, kɛkum dwoo bɔs'ak aabookɛsi ɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>